(1450363, 188697, 22734, '<td valign="top">I am giving this image a six. If it were presented in the size alloted I would have given it a ten. It is a winning image but too small of a size to compete for the top honors, yet that is where it belongs. A breataking capture.</td>', 'I am giving this image a six. If it were presented in the size alloted I would have given it a ten. It is a winning image but too small of a size to compete for the top honors, yet that is where it belongs. A breataking capture.', '2005-06-13 01:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1450364, 188965, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and exposure with decent feather detail. Nice catchlight. I like the tilt into the frame and the negative space. As an aside I dont think the title really goes since the suggestion to me is more like peek-a-boo than directly in your face, which suggests an aggressive, dominant full of frontal shot. Cute pic.</td>', 'Good lighting and exposure with decent feather detail. Nice catchlight. I like the tilt into the frame and the negative space. As an aside I dont think the title really goes since the suggestion to me is more like peek-a-boo than directly in your face, which suggests an aggressive, dominant full of frontal shot. Cute pic.', '2005-06-13 01:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
