(1451085, 187550, 11738, '<td valign="top">Left pigeson: "Ummm, Frank?  I don''t think he has any french fries."<br/>Right Pigeon: "Quiet George!  I think I can see his wallet from here."<br/> <br/>Excellent capture!  Fits the challenge perfectly.  I love the wide distortion effect.  This must have been taken with a super-wide.  Composition is also quite good.  This is scoring high in my book.</td>', 'Left pigeson: "Ummm, Frank?  I don''t think he has any french fries."Right Pigeon: "Quiet George!  I think I can see his wallet from here." Excellent capture!  Fits the challenge perfectly.  I love the wide distortion effect.  This must have been taken with a super-wide.  Composition is also quite good.  This is scoring high in my book.', '2005-06-13 07:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
