(1451090, 187172, 16488, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture!  Adorable songbird.  Wondering if this is the true robin-redbreast...we don''t have this one around here.  There are a few distracting elements that could have been cloned out or, in the case of the brown leaves that compete so much with the bird''s red breast, selective desaturation would have lessened their presence.  Nonetheless, sharp detail and a nice moment . . . . . .</td>', 'Wonderful capture!  Adorable songbird.  Wondering if this is the true robin-redbreast...we don''t have this one around here.  There are a few distracting elements that could have been cloned out or, in the case of the brown leaves that compete so much with the bird''s red breast, selective desaturation would have lessened their presence.  Nonetheless, sharp detail and a nice moment . . . . . .', '2005-06-13 08:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1451091, 189065, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait of a gull.</td>', 'Nice portrait of a gull.', '2005-06-13 08:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1451094, 187973, 11738, '<td valign="top">You captured this at the perfect moment!  Composition is superb and colours are very good with no overbearing blown-out highlights.  This is going to do very well.</td>', 'You captured this at the perfect moment!  Composition is superb and colours are very good with no overbearing blown-out highlights.  This is going to do very well.', '2005-06-13 08:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1451095, 188981, 35467, '<td valign="top">The first thing that bothers me is the colors, they do not seem natural. Nice composition Good luck</td>', 'The first thing that bothers me is the colors, they do not seem natural. Nice composition Good luck', '2005-06-13 08:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1451097, 187495, 11738, '<td valign="top">Words escape me, but I love this one.  Not sure if this is a partial desaturation: if so, it''s a very, very effective one.  Great work.</td>', 'Words escape me, but I love this one.  Not sure if this is a partial desaturation: if so, it''s a very, very effective one.  Great work.', '2005-06-13 08:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1451098, 189038, 16488, '<td valign="top">Lovely texture and motion on this Jay!  An expertly made portrait.  I wonder if his coat is ruffed not only because of the wind, but because he''s a juvenile?  Looks to be between plumages.<br/>Color well rendered. Perhaps desat on yellow would have pulled down the orange spot and lessened the tug of the green that competes with your subject.  Nicely captured, nonetheless . . . . . . . .</td>', 'Lovely texture and motion on this Jay!  An expertly made portrait.  I wonder if his coat is ruffed not only because of the wind, but because he''s a juvenile?  Looks to be between plumages.Color well rendered. Perhaps desat on yellow would have pulled down the orange spot and lessened the tug of the green that competes with your subject.  Nicely captured, nonetheless . . . . . . . .', '2005-06-13 08:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1451099, 188555, 36437, '<td valign="top">Beautyful shot...I''ll like to see with more contrast</td>', 'Beautyful shot...I''ll like to see with more contrast', '2005-06-13 08:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1451100, 186312, 35467, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. The birds are not very sharp, perhaps this is a small crop from a larger photo.  Nice composition.  Good luck</td>', 'Nice capture. The birds are not very sharp, perhaps this is a small crop from a larger photo.  Nice composition.  Good luck', '2005-06-13 08:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1451104, 188228, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice egret shot!  The detail is a joy to look at.  I wonder why you didn''t crop the right side...it pulls the eye away to ill effect.   Color on the palms is a bit strange, green is so hard to do well. . . . . .</td>', 'Nice egret shot!  The detail is a joy to look at.  I wonder why you didn''t crop the right side...it pulls the eye away to ill effect.   Color on the palms is a bit strange, green is so hard to do well. . . . . .', '2005-06-13 08:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
