(1451239, 187187, 14671, '<td valign="top">Your score may be a little off because for some reason when I was glancing at the thumbs somehow your photo got rated as a 2 when I hadn''t even started voting yet.  Anyways with that being said and hopefully corrected, I find the size of your photo to be huge even on this 21" monitor and the grass seems a little OoF.  The sun is also throwing a high contrast onto the from of the bird and the white part of the head that also gives the appearence of being a little OoF.  However I like the shot and find that the semi hidden bird in the sand is very well done and adds that little extra that a lot of photos don''t have.  I really like the definition in the goose and all in al is well composed.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'Your score may be a little off because for some reason when I was glancing at the thumbs somehow your photo got rated as a 2 when I hadn''t even started voting yet.  Anyways with that being said and hopefully corrected, I find the size of your photo to be huge even on this 21" monitor and the grass seems a little OoF.  The sun is also throwing a high contrast onto the from of the bird and the white part of the head that also gives the appearence of being a little OoF.  However I like the shot and find that the semi hidden bird in the sand is very well done and adds that little extra that a lot of photos don''t have.  I really like the definition in the goose and all in al is well composed.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.', '2005-06-13 08:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
