(1451284, 188746, 14671, '<td valign="top">lol nice title.  The blues are very blue, almost pastel like which I''m not fond of.  I also find the contrast to be a little on the high side taking away from te other colors in the photo.  I do like to composition and find it very pleasing to the eye.  All in all I think this is one of the better shots in this challenge because of the colors.  Well done and good luck in this challenge. &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'lol nice title.  The blues are very blue, almost pastel like which I''m not fond of.  I also find the contrast to be a little on the high side taking away from te other colors in the photo.  I do like to composition and find it very pleasing to the eye.  All in all I think this is one of the better shots in this challenge because of the colors.  Well done and good luck in this challenge. <6>', '2005-06-13 09:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
