(1451293, 187220, 14671, '<td valign="top">I like the one word title and find it fits this photo very well.  This shot reminds me of a "motivational" photo that bosses usually have hanging on their walls at the office.   Excellent clarity and color and the bright light from above adds a little more mystery to the bird.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'I like the one word title and find it fits this photo very well.  This shot reminds me of a "motivational" photo that bosses usually have hanging on their walls at the office.   Excellent clarity and color and the bright light from above adds a little more mystery to the bird.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  <8>', '2005-06-13 09:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
