(1451337, 188793, 15029, '<td valign="top">while technically this photo is well composed. I don''t like your subject matter. duh.  I know that it''s easy to photograph dead birds, but you should try live ones I think. the exclamation point in the title doesn''t help either because it conveys a sense of enthusiasm.</td>', 'while technically this photo is well composed. I don''t like your subject matter. duh.  I know that it''s easy to photograph dead birds, but you should try live ones I think. the exclamation point in the title doesn''t help either because it conveys a sense of enthusiasm.', '2005-06-13 09:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
