(1452104, 187043, 5286, '<td valign="top">Brilliant. Excellent focus and excellent composition. The background blur is super effective. Straight 10.</td>', 'Brilliant. Excellent focus and excellent composition. The background blur is super effective. Straight 10.', '2005-06-13 14:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452106, 189025, 19943, '<td valign="top">I like the barbed wire fence/post, bird, focus, clarity, dof.  I think the blueish object behind the bird is a distraction.  Nice job.</td>', 'I like the barbed wire fence/post, bird, focus, clarity, dof.  I think the blueish object behind the bird is a distraction.  Nice job.', '2005-06-13 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452108, 188439, 19672, '<td valign="top">very nice bokeh, however...a polarizer would have done wonders for the water...as such it''s brightness becomes too much of a distraction.<br/> <br/></td>', 'very nice bokeh, however...a polarizer would have done wonders for the water...as such it''s brightness becomes too much of a distraction. ', '2005-06-13 14:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452111, 188367, 39218, '<td valign="top">This is one of those photographs that just make you smile. Reminds me of my little brother jumping into the middle of every picture when we were kids!  VERY cute!</td>', 'This is one of those photographs that just make you smile. Reminds me of my little brother jumping into the middle of every picture when we were kids!  VERY cute!', '2005-06-13 14:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452112, 187039, 38950, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, I would have liked to see more detail round the eye.</td>', 'Nice capture, I would have liked to see more detail round the eye.', '2005-06-13 14:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452113, 189026, 19672, '<td valign="top">I think this would have done great with a "portrait" cropping instead of landscape.</td>', 'I think this would have done great with a "portrait" cropping instead of landscape.', '2005-06-13 14:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452114, 186595, 19672, '<td valign="top">seen this one with cows before...</td>', 'seen this one with cows before...', '2005-06-13 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452115, 188390, 19943, '<td valign="top">ordinary.   I can see your silhouette in the reflection on the eye.  Highlights on top of head are blown out.  Not clearly focused.  Good lighting, positioning, and subject.  (5)</td>', 'ordinary.   I can see your silhouette in the reflection on the eye.  Highlights on top of head are blown out.  Not clearly focused.  Good lighting, positioning, and subject.  (5)', '2005-06-13 14:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452116, 186973, 19672, '<td valign="top">if the face had some contrast this would be a 8</td>', 'if the face had some contrast this would be a 8', '2005-06-13 14:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452117, 188460, 39218, '<td valign="top">The Phyllis Diller of the Bird world!  Very funny!</td>', 'The Phyllis Diller of the Bird world!  Very funny!', '2005-06-13 14:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452121, 188227, 38950, '<td valign="top">The body is sharp but the head looks a little soft.</td>', 'The body is sharp but the head looks a little soft.', '2005-06-13 14:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452123, 188972, 19943, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the vignetting, colors are off.  Lighting on the feathers is too harsh in some spots, and not enough in others.  Love the composition and title.</td>', 'Don''t like the vignetting, colors are off.  Lighting on the feathers is too harsh in some spots, and not enough in others.  Love the composition and title.', '2005-06-13 14:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452124, 188811, 38950, '<td valign="top">Nice detail but the crop is a bit tight for my taste.</td>', 'Nice detail but the crop is a bit tight for my taste.', '2005-06-13 14:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452125, 187846, 26526, '<td valign="top">Like the dof. The green colors are very pleasing to look at. Nice detail in the bird feathers. Excellent composition.</td>', 'Like the dof. The green colors are very pleasing to look at. Nice detail in the bird feathers. Excellent composition.', '2005-06-13 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452127, 188646, 19943, '<td valign="top">tranquil, serene.  For one who doesn''t like borders, this one really fits well.  I love it.</td>', 'tranquil, serene.  For one who doesn''t like borders, this one really fits well.  I love it.', '2005-06-13 14:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452132, 188086, 38950, '<td valign="top">Nice pose, and nice composition!! <br/>Good shot.</td>', 'Nice pose, and nice composition!! Good shot.', '2005-06-13 14:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452136, 188976, 27482, '<td valign="top">I never give out 1 unless I explain why.  First of all, this is way off topic and I have never given a shot I percieve to be off topic a higher grade than 4.  secondly this isn´t anything spectacular, it´s just a so so shot of a silhouette of an airplane.  The sky isn´t very interesting, the composition is dead centered and well frankly if this were an airplane challenge I would have given it a 3 or a 4.  I just don´t find this interesting at all.<br/> <br/>Sorry for the rant, but I figured you deserved an explanation as to why I gave it a 1.</td>', 'I never give out 1 unless I explain why.  First of all, this is way off topic and I have never given a shot I percieve to be off topic a higher grade than 4.  secondly this isn´t anything spectacular, it´s just a so so shot of a silhouette of an airplane.  The sky isn´t very interesting, the composition is dead centered and well frankly if this were an airplane challenge I would have given it a 3 or a 4.  I just don´t find this interesting at all. Sorry for the rant, but I figured you deserved an explanation as to why I gave it a 1.', '2005-06-13 14:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452138, 188372, 19943, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Unbelievable capture; it shows the immense wingspan of the bird and strength to fly with cargo.  Maybe a little too much noise?  Try and post-edit more true color into the white on the head and green in the trees.</td>', 'Great shot.  Unbelievable capture; it shows the immense wingspan of the bird and strength to fly with cargo.  Maybe a little too much noise?  Try and post-edit more true color into the white on the head and green in the trees.', '2005-06-13 14:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452139, 187893, 39218, '<td valign="top">Just gotta love it!  The title is perfect!</td>', 'Just gotta love it!  The title is perfect!', '2005-06-13 14:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452146, 189068, 26526, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors. Like the dof, detail of the feathers. Excellent composition.</td>', 'Beautiful colors. Like the dof, detail of the feathers. Excellent composition.', '2005-06-13 14:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
