(1452371, 189021, 35645, '<td valign="top">The water in the upper left is too bright, causing you to lose detail in the bird. Makes me want my sunglasses. I also don''t care for the fact that his feet are cut off. Otherwise, it''s a good capture, and I like the sense of motion and immediacy that this gives me.</td>', 'The water in the upper left is too bright, causing you to lose detail in the bird. Makes me want my sunglasses. I also don''t care for the fact that his feet are cut off. Otherwise, it''s a good capture, and I like the sense of motion and immediacy that this gives me.', '2005-06-13 15:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452372, 188976, 36238, '<td valign="top">Good to see one person had the idea I had about ''birds'' being ''planes''.  Unfortunately I didn''t find a good ''plane'' photo to submit.  Bravo to you!</td>', 'Good to see one person had the idea I had about ''birds'' being ''planes''.  Unfortunately I didn''t find a good ''plane'' photo to submit.  Bravo to you!', '2005-06-13 15:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452373, 188228, 39116, '<td valign="top">well exposed....</td>', 'well exposed....', '2005-06-13 15:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452376, 188682, 39116, '<td valign="top">lovely detail</td>', 'lovely detail', '2005-06-13 15:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452377, 187139, 39116, '<td valign="top">the subject should have been sharper...so keep trying</td>', 'the subject should have been sharper...so keep trying', '2005-06-13 15:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452382, 188555, 39116, '<td valign="top">lovely shot...well done</td>', 'lovely shot...well done', '2005-06-13 15:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452383, 186749, 35645, '<td valign="top">It''s a pretty bird, and I _think_ I get what you''re going for with the effects on the person, but I relly don''t care for the look of it. It''s disconcerting to the eye, and it almost looks like you''ve cut and pasted the bird into another, older picture. 8 for the bird itself, 4 for the rest of the pic, so ya get a 6 from me.</td>', 'It''s a pretty bird, and I _think_ I get what you''re going for with the effects on the person, but I relly don''t care for the look of it. It''s disconcerting to the eye, and it almost looks like you''ve cut and pasted the bird into another, older picture. 8 for the bird itself, 4 for the rest of the pic, so ya get a 6 from me.', '2005-06-13 15:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452387, 189045, 32848, '<td valign="top">Great focus and stopped motion.  I like the plants stretching from front to back as well, nice capture.</td>', 'Great focus and stopped motion.  I like the plants stretching from front to back as well, nice capture.', '2005-06-13 15:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452388, 187648, 35645, '<td valign="top">What a cosmically ugly birdling! Ugh! Boy does he look ticked off!<br/>Wonderful, sharp detail and very nice color.</td>', 'What a cosmically ugly birdling! Ugh! Boy does he look ticked off!Wonderful, sharp detail and very nice color.', '2005-06-13 15:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452391, 188555, 32848, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  You managed to get the exposure just about right on what is a difficult subject with the white of the bird and bright background.</td>', 'Lovely shot.  You managed to get the exposure just about right on what is a difficult subject with the white of the bird and bright background.', '2005-06-13 15:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452392, 187480, 35645, '<td valign="top">Now that''s just funny! Love the colors and contrasts. Great composition. How did you get them to look so satisfied with themselves?  :)</td>', 'Now that''s just funny! Love the colors and contrasts. Great composition. How did you get them to look so satisfied with themselves?  :)', '2005-06-13 15:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452395, 186408, 35645, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting on this. Beautiful detail, especially in the wings. Great job.</td>', 'Love the lighting on this. Beautiful detail, especially in the wings. Great job.', '2005-06-13 15:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452397, 188975, 32848, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  The colours in the water compliment the picture very well.</td>', 'Lovely shot.  The colours in the water compliment the picture very well.', '2005-06-13 15:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452398, 188528, 32848, '<td valign="top">I like the title!</td>', 'I like the title!', '2005-06-13 15:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
