(1452403, 189080, 35645, '<td valign="top">Wow. I love the point of view on this one. Gives it a very unique feel. Beautiful colors, great composition, wonderful textures in the water. And the title made me smile!</td>', 'Wow. I love the point of view on this one. Gives it a very unique feel. Beautiful colors, great composition, wonderful textures in the water. And the title made me smile!', '2005-06-13 15:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
