(1452675, 188914, 24494, '<td valign="top">10 great shot look so cartoony (finding nemo)</td>', '10 great shot look so cartoony (finding nemo)', '2005-06-13 17:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452676, 188308, 24454, '<td valign="top">AWESOME!!!!!   This is my most favorite kind of duck, and I almost submitted one very similar to this myself (you can see it in my profile).     Yours is much better tho:  it is SO crystal clear, and the detail of the water is absolutely perfect on yours!!!    The only thing for me about your picture is that with the amazing colors of this bird, I wonder why you preferred black and white. . .but nevertheless, your picture is truly amazing and I love it!!!!    9</td>', 'AWESOME!!!!!   This is my most favorite kind of duck, and I almost submitted one very similar to this myself (you can see it in my profile).     Yours is much better tho:  it is SO crystal clear, and the detail of the water is absolutely perfect on yours!!!    The only thing for me about your picture is that with the amazing colors of this bird, I wonder why you preferred black and white. . .but nevertheless, your picture is truly amazing and I love it!!!!    9', '2005-06-13 17:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452682, 188681, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is FANTASTIC!    I am in awe of pictures like this where a beautiful bird is in graceful motion, and yet remains perfectly clear and focused in your photograph.   The sun (or the moon - whichever it is) adds such a great touch, and the tones are beautiful!    You REALLY did good!    10</td>', 'This is FANTASTIC!    I am in awe of pictures like this where a beautiful bird is in graceful motion, and yet remains perfectly clear and focused in your photograph.   The sun (or the moon - whichever it is) adds such a great touch, and the tones are beautiful!    You REALLY did good!    10', '2005-06-13 17:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452687, 187635, 24454, '<td valign="top">My most favorite kind of duck / bird  in the whole world!     I hope they aren''t killing you for the frame -- I''ve learned the hard way that they usually beat up frames pretty badly.   But I happen to be one that likes them, and think this adds a nice touch to your photograph.   Good luck!!!!!</td>', 'My most favorite kind of duck / bird  in the whole world!     I hope they aren''t killing you for the frame -- I''ve learned the hard way that they usually beat up frames pretty badly.   But I happen to be one that likes them, and think this adds a nice touch to your photograph.   Good luck!!!!!', '2005-06-13 17:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452690, 189026, 24454, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!   I love how that wire gives you the perspective of just how tiny and graceful this little fellow is.</td>', 'Beautiful!   I love how that wire gives you the perspective of just how tiny and graceful this little fellow is.', '2005-06-13 17:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
