(1452736, 187480, 24454, '<td valign="top">How CUTE!!!!!      I always notice that this type of duck with the green &amp; navy blue head and beautiful blue wings always hangs out with one of these brown little fellows.     This is very creative and interesting!  I like it a lot!</td>', 'How CUTE!!!!!      I always notice that this type of duck with the green & navy blue head and beautiful blue wings always hangs out with one of these brown little fellows.     This is very creative and interesting!  I like it a lot!', '2005-06-13 17:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
