(1452840, 188843, 24454, '<td valign="top">And a beautiful one it is!!! (portrait).    Seriously, with the black background, this bird looks gorgeous.   So noble and regal.    Great job.</td>', 'And a beautiful one it is!!! (portrait).    Seriously, with the black background, this bird looks gorgeous.   So noble and regal.    Great job.', '2005-06-13 18:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
