(1452849, 187217, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwww. . . I LOVE this!!!!    What a great job you did at turning a photograph of  an ordinary baby duckling into something truly amazing and incredible!!!    The water dripping off his beak, the selective desaturated greenery, and even the black and white.    I love taking pictures of ducks, and this makes me want to go take one like this  :)   10</td>', 'Awwww. . . I LOVE this!!!!    What a great job you did at turning a photograph of  an ordinary baby duckling into something truly amazing and incredible!!!    The water dripping off his beak, the selective desaturated greenery, and even the black and white.    I love taking pictures of ducks, and this makes me want to go take one like this  :)   10', '2005-06-13 18:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
