(1453052, 188587, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good clarity on the insect, and a nice shot though I don''t feel it really meets the challenge criteria.  The focus on the shot is nice and sharp, and I can''t see any noise, so well done!</td>', 'Good clarity on the insect, and a nice shot though I don''t feel it really meets the challenge criteria.  The focus on the shot is nice and sharp, and I can''t see any noise, so well done!', '2005-06-13 19:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453055, 187953, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good clarity on this shot.  I wonder if a background in a different color might help these birds stand out better, or make the shot pop more.  Lovely blue on the figurines.</td>', 'Good clarity on this shot.  I wonder if a background in a different color might help these birds stand out better, or make the shot pop more.  Lovely blue on the figurines.', '2005-06-13 19:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453056, 188903, 7810, '<td valign="top">nice capture</td>', 'nice capture', '2005-06-13 20:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453058, 188794, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good straight horizon.  This image looks a little soft to me, which eliminates some of the detail that would make this bird really pop!  Lighting looks pretty good, maybe a little harsh at the tail end of the bird, but not much you can do about the sun ;-)  Good composition.  Playing with the Levels might help make this shot pop a little more as well.  Nice colors!</td>', 'Good straight horizon.  This image looks a little soft to me, which eliminates some of the detail that would make this bird really pop!  Lighting looks pretty good, maybe a little harsh at the tail end of the bird, but not much you can do about the sun ;-)  Good composition.  Playing with the Levels might help make this shot pop a little more as well.  Nice colors!', '2005-06-13 20:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453060, 187321, 7810, '<td valign="top">nice capture ...like the colours</td>', 'nice capture ...like the colours', '2005-06-13 20:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
