(1453067, 188981, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but the adjustment to the colors is a bit distracting.  I think it obscures some of the detail on the young geese.  Detail on the mother goose looks pretty good!</td>', 'Good composition, but the adjustment to the colors is a bit distracting.  I think it obscures some of the detail on the young geese.  Detail on the mother goose looks pretty good!', '2005-06-13 20:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
