(1453075, 187039, 22537, '<td valign="top">Okay.....where''s the string??  This is one of my top picks.  The only thing I''m unsure of is the cropping.  It just doesn''t feel.....hmmm...perfect like the rest of the elements in this shot.  Sorry. 7 Good luck!</td>', 'Okay.....where''s the string??  This is one of my top picks.  The only thing I''m unsure of is the cropping.  It just doesn''t feel.....hmmm...perfect like the rest of the elements in this shot.  Sorry. 7 Good luck!', '2005-06-13 20:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453077, 188673, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good composition!  I like the difference in texture between the feathers and the rocks.  There is just a touch of noies/hazing in the photo, but not too much.  Detail on the duck looks pretty clear.  Playing with Levels might help bring out some of the darker and lighter spots and really make this photo pop!</td>', 'Good composition!  I like the difference in texture between the feathers and the rocks.  There is just a touch of noies/hazing in the photo, but not too much.  Detail on the duck looks pretty clear.  Playing with Levels might help bring out some of the darker and lighter spots and really make this photo pop!', '2005-06-13 20:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453080, 188835, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and nice wing spread on this shot!  The image looks a little soft, which causes it to lose some of the detail I''d like to see.  Nice choice of subject.</td>', 'Nice colors and nice wing spread on this shot!  The image looks a little soft, which causes it to lose some of the detail I''d like to see.  Nice choice of subject.', '2005-06-13 20:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453081, 188322, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good detail on the duck.  I think I would enjoy seeing this in color as well, though the b&amp;w does have a certain amount of charm.  Good composition, I like the spillway.</td>', 'Good detail on the duck.  I think I would enjoy seeing this in color as well, though the b&w does have a certain amount of charm.  Good composition, I like the spillway.', '2005-06-13 20:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
