(1453085, 188919, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very emotive shot!  The clarity of detail could be a little more precise in my opinion.  The black of the bird looks a little hazy, so perhaps some Level adjustment might help.  I like the composition and I''m amazed at the capture of this emotion on a bird!  Really like that :-)</td>', 'Very emotive shot!  The clarity of detail could be a little more precise in my opinion.  The black of the bird looks a little hazy, so perhaps some Level adjustment might help.  I like the composition and I''m amazed at the capture of this emotion on a bird!  Really like that :-)', '2005-06-13 20:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453088, 186660, 7810, '<td valign="top">The eye makes the shot...well done  love the colours</td>', 'The eye makes the shot...well done  love the colours', '2005-06-13 20:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453089, 189071, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good composition!  There is a little too much noise in this shot for my tastes...I think the image loses some of it''s clarity.  Good true to life colors, nice job!</td>', 'Good composition!  There is a little too much noise in this shot for my tastes...I think the image loses some of it''s clarity.  Good true to life colors, nice job!', '2005-06-13 20:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
