(1453093, 188467, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good composition and a nice tight frame.  The lighting seems to be a little harsh and there is a bit of noise in the image.  The colors came out very well and true to life!</td>', 'Good composition and a nice tight frame.  The lighting seems to be a little harsh and there is a bit of noise in the image.  The colors came out very well and true to life!', '2005-06-13 20:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
