(1453099, 188737, 22537, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Very sharp and well composed.  I''m seeing a little bit of noise on the top green part.  Otherwise, excellent. 6 Good luck!</td>', 'Great shot.  Very sharp and well composed.  I''m seeing a little bit of noise on the top green part.  Otherwise, excellent. 6 Good luck!', '2005-06-13 20:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453101, 188615, 22537, '<td valign="top">This is just so different from all of the "in your face" bird shots.  Has a "late Saturday afternoon sittin at the cafe" look to it.  Good presentation! 6</td>', 'This is just so different from all of the "in your face" bird shots.  Has a "late Saturday afternoon sittin at the cafe" look to it.  Good presentation! 6', '2005-06-13 20:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453105, 188252, 22537, '<td valign="top">The bird in the background really ties this photo together by balancing the subject and the background.  The colors are soothing and the main subject is crisp.  The only fault that is holding me back is the noiseacross the darker areas.  6 Good luck!</td>', 'The bird in the background really ties this photo together by balancing the subject and the background.  The colors are soothing and the main subject is crisp.  The only fault that is holding me back is the noiseacross the darker areas.  6 Good luck!', '2005-06-13 20:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453106, 189056, 38950, '<td valign="top">Nice background, good pose and a pleasent perch.</td>', 'Nice background, good pose and a pleasent perch.', '2005-06-13 20:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453108, 186595, 35739, '<td valign="top">Sorry about  this.  Where are  the birds? Those tiny white specks? A little closer on the birds would have been better.  Too much sky also.  My perception only.</td>', 'Sorry about  this.  Where are  the birds? Those tiny white specks? A little closer on the birds would have been better.  Too much sky also.  My perception only.', '2005-06-13 20:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453110, 188611, 35739, '<td valign="top">I believe it would have been nicer being a little closer.</td>', 'I believe it would have been nicer being a little closer.', '2005-06-13 20:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453111, 188659, 34659, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful shot &amp; reflection.  VERY nice job!  :-)  I''m sure that this one will do well...  It may sound odd, but I think that since this was an Advanced Editing Challenge, you could have selectively removed some of the white spots in the water - just a minor complaint.  Also there''s a bit of a glare on the white breast feathers of the Polish Mute...  All in all, a terrific shot!  (8)</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful shot & reflection.  VERY nice job!  :-)  I''m sure that this one will do well...  It may sound odd, but I think that since this was an Advanced Editing Challenge, you could have selectively removed some of the white spots in the water - just a minor complaint.  Also there''s a bit of a glare on the white breast feathers of the Polish Mute...  All in all, a terrific shot!  (8)', '2005-06-13 20:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453113, 188981, 35739, '<td valign="top">I believe color and clarity is the issue here.</td>', 'I believe color and clarity is the issue here.', '2005-06-13 20:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453114, 188918, 34659, '<td valign="top">I love the relative "unbalanced" feel of the shot.  Truly a remarkable job.  Exceptional cropping and color tones - the composition is impeccable.  It looks a little overprocessed (IMHO), but I''m not always very good at determining between naturally occurring abnormalities and the PP ones.  I really like the image a lot.  (9)</td>', 'I love the relative "unbalanced" feel of the shot.  Truly a remarkable job.  Exceptional cropping and color tones - the composition is impeccable.  It looks a little overprocessed (IMHO), but I''m not always very good at determining between naturally occurring abnormalities and the PP ones.  I really like the image a lot.  (9)', '2005-06-13 20:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453120, 188250, 35739, '<td valign="top">Nice view, yet it looks to me to be a little excessive on the pixels.  Not sure of the exact wording, looks as if you zoomed in too much.</td>', 'Nice view, yet it looks to me to be a little excessive on the pixels.  Not sure of the exact wording, looks as if you zoomed in too much.', '2005-06-13 20:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453121, 187680, 35739, '<td valign="top">Image is on the small side.</td>', 'Image is on the small side.', '2005-06-13 20:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453122, 187874, 35739, '<td valign="top">Not very clear. Appears to out of focus.</td>', 'Not very clear. Appears to out of focus.', '2005-06-13 20:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453123, 187973, 34659, '<td valign="top">Having been raised around fowl of all kinds (including white &amp; black swans), I really appreciate this image.  I love the way that the swans necks seem to create a natural heart.  The Australian black swans'' mating rituals are truly poetic in their rituals and the permutations of movement they create.  The swans look like they may have been a little overprocessed (on their edges), but the clarity of the overhead leaves and the softness of the background work very well.  VERY nice shot!  Congrats &amp; good luck!  (8)<br/></td>', 'Having been raised around fowl of all kinds (including white & black swans), I really appreciate this image.  I love the way that the swans necks seem to create a natural heart.  The Australian black swans'' mating rituals are truly poetic in their rituals and the permutations of movement they create.  The swans look like they may have been a little overprocessed (on their edges), but the clarity of the overhead leaves and the softness of the background work very well.  VERY nice shot!  Congrats & good luck!  (8)', '2005-06-13 20:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453125, 188787, 35739, '<td valign="top">Cool capture.  It would have been nicer if closer and more bird with less sky.</td>', 'Cool capture.  It would have been nicer if closer and more bird with less sky.', '2005-06-13 20:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
