(1453163, 188250, 27763, '<td valign="top">Unless I''m mistaken, there is a lot of noise in this image, both in the wings and in the sky.  Although I don''t think that the noise in the sky detracts from the shot, I think that the noise *under*  the wings does detract from it.  If you ran this image through "Neat Image", available for free on the internet, I bet it would make a dramatic reduction in the noise.  Disregard this comment if that''s not noise I''m seeing!  Otherwise, nice shot!  The bird is in a good pose and has a nice look in his eye.</td>', 'Unless I''m mistaken, there is a lot of noise in this image, both in the wings and in the sky.  Although I don''t think that the noise in the sky detracts from the shot, I think that the noise *under*  the wings does detract from it.  If you ran this image through "Neat Image", available for free on the internet, I bet it would make a dramatic reduction in the noise.  Disregard this comment if that''s not noise I''m seeing!  Otherwise, nice shot!  The bird is in a good pose and has a nice look in his eye.', '2005-06-13 20:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453165, 187321, 27763, '<td valign="top">I love how the mother and baby bird form one continuous curve.  That really makes this a great shot.  I think that the background would be better if there was nothing close behind the bird, so that the background became just a blur, but I''m sure there was nothing you could have done about that!  Nice shot!</td>', 'I love how the mother and baby bird form one continuous curve.  That really makes this a great shot.  I think that the background would be better if there was nothing close behind the bird, so that the background became just a blur, but I''m sure there was nothing you could have done about that!  Nice shot!', '2005-06-13 20:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453169, 189052, 9780, '<td valign="top">LOVLY! :) nice shallow dof! Setup is perfect so you get ten from me! 10+<br/></td>', 'LOVLY! :) nice shallow dof! Setup is perfect so you get ten from me! 10+', '2005-06-13 20:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453173, 188445, 27763, '<td valign="top">There''s nothing wrong with this shot, but there''s nothing great about it either.  It would have been better if you had tried something interesting or unusual.  Make me see the chicken like I''ve never a chicken before.  For example, maybe you could have gotten down real low and close to the chicken, so that your camera was pointing up at him, and then the chicken would look more interesting and the backround would have been just sky or maybe all blurred.  Just some thoughts.</td>', 'There''s nothing wrong with this shot, but there''s nothing great about it either.  It would have been better if you had tried something interesting or unusual.  Make me see the chicken like I''ve never a chicken before.  For example, maybe you could have gotten down real low and close to the chicken, so that your camera was pointing up at him, and then the chicken would look more interesting and the backround would have been just sky or maybe all blurred.  Just some thoughts.', '2005-06-13 20:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453176, 189016, 27763, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  It puts the bird in the context of his environment.</td>', 'Nice composition.  It puts the bird in the context of his environment.', '2005-06-13 20:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
