(1453181, 188756, 22537, '<td valign="top">What an interesting shot!  The colors are great and the composition is perfect.  I think you soooooo slightly oversaturated and that is why I can only give you a 7.  Good luck!</td>', 'What an interesting shot!  The colors are great and the composition is perfect.  I think you soooooo slightly oversaturated and that is why I can only give you a 7.  Good luck!', '2005-06-13 21:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
