(1453247, 189068, 27763, '<td valign="top">What a bizarre creature!  Nice shot.  Great blurred background.</td>', 'What a bizarre creature!  Nice shot.  Great blurred background.', '2005-06-13 21:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453252, 189069, 22537, '<td valign="top">This shot is tight. Lots going on, great tones, tack sharp and well balanced.  Had it been an option, it would have been good to either clone out or have included the full bird on the left that is missing it''s head.  Great work and good luck!</td>', 'This shot is tight. Lots going on, great tones, tack sharp and well balanced.  Had it been an option, it would have been good to either clone out or have included the full bird on the left that is missing it''s head.  Great work and good luck!', '2005-06-13 21:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453256, 187550, 22537, '<td valign="top">This is such a fresh shot for this challenge. The humor is the charm.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is such a fresh shot for this challenge. The humor is the charm.  Good luck!', '2005-06-13 21:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453258, 187565, 27763, '<td valign="top">Priceless pose!</td>', 'Priceless pose!', '2005-06-13 21:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453267, 186654, 34481, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and light of this image.  It make me laugh and it is also visually appealing.  One of the best of the challenge.  Good luck</td>', 'I love the composition and light of this image.  It make me laugh and it is also visually appealing.  One of the best of the challenge.  Good luck', '2005-06-13 21:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453268, 186564, 22537, '<td valign="top">What I like: Composition, sharpness, good use of border, sepia and overall lighting.  Dislike: Underwings are too dark and moreso the bird''s left wing.  Regardless, this shot is going to rank way up there.  Good luck!</td>', 'What I like: Composition, sharpness, good use of border, sepia and overall lighting.  Dislike: Underwings are too dark and moreso the bird''s left wing.  Regardless, this shot is going to rank way up there.  Good luck!', '2005-06-13 21:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453270, 188372, 22537, '<td valign="top">Okay, so the shot is not the sharpest but I have to give you points for getting this capture. 6 Good luck!</td>', 'Okay, so the shot is not the sharpest but I have to give you points for getting this capture. 6 Good luck!', '2005-06-13 21:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453273, 188547, 22537, '<td valign="top">This shot is crisp crisp crisp!  The colors are great but did you have to crop it so tight?You may have used a bit more sky and ofset the bird slightly.  6 Good luck!</td>', 'This shot is crisp crisp crisp!  The colors are great but did you have to crop it so tight?You may have used a bit more sky and ofset the bird slightly.  6 Good luck!', '2005-06-13 21:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453277, 188930, 22537, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image and it fits perfectly in the frame.  Sharp, colorful and 6.  Goodluck!</td>', 'Beautiful image and it fits perfectly in the frame.  Sharp, colorful and 6.  Goodluck!', '2005-06-13 21:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453280, 187446, 27763, '<td valign="top">How did you get the swan to sit still while you sprayed water on him ;)<br/></td>', 'How did you get the swan to sit still while you sprayed water on him ;)', '2005-06-13 21:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453281, 188086, 22537, '<td valign="top">What an excellent capture.  The shot is perfectly balanced and the colors are great.  Had you burned the shadows of the reeds/palm fronds, it would have been that much more striking.  Good luck!</td>', 'What an excellent capture.  The shot is perfectly balanced and the colors are great.  Had you burned the shadows of the reeds/palm fronds, it would have been that much more striking.  Good luck!', '2005-06-13 21:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453285, 188099, 22537, '<td valign="top">What an interesting photo!  Well balanced and sharp.  I would have liked to have seen the smaller bird have a bit more headroom but otherwise, excellent.  Good luck!</td>', 'What an interesting photo!  Well balanced and sharp.  I would have liked to have seen the smaller bird have a bit more headroom but otherwise, excellent.  Good luck!', '2005-06-13 21:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453286, 188915, 27763, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2005-06-13 21:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453290, 188914, 22537, '<td valign="top">Excellent sharpness as these guys are always such clowns to photograph.  The hues work great and had you burned more detail into the clouds, it would have balanced the shot better.  You will do very well.  Good luck!</td>', 'Excellent sharpness as these guys are always such clowns to photograph.  The hues work great and had you burned more detail into the clouds, it would have balanced the shot better.  You will do very well.  Good luck!', '2005-06-13 21:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1453292, 188793, 36091, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF and the colors on the bird are nice. The border takes a little away for me, but I don''t subtract for that. Overall a nice pic</td>', 'I like the DOF and the colors on the bird are nice. The border takes a little away for me, but I don''t subtract for that. Overall a nice pic', '2005-06-13 21:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
