(1453458, 187446, 6668, '<td valign="top">I personally don''t care for the close crop of this image, but that is only my opinion.</td>', 'I personally don''t care for the close crop of this image, but that is only my opinion.', '2005-06-13 23:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
