(1454079, 188651, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool, like the motion blur and composition, this photo works.</td>', 'Pretty cool, like the motion blur and composition, this photo works.', '2005-06-14 06:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454084, 188756, 27482, '<td valign="top">There are a few blown out highlights on the bird and in my opninion just a little too much contrast wich makes the colours a bit odd but good DOF and composition.</td>', 'There are a few blown out highlights on the bird and in my opninion just a little too much contrast wich makes the colours a bit odd but good DOF and composition.', '2005-06-14 06:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454089, 187148, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like this, great colours and contrast and I like the fact that it is a bit on the dark side.  It is however framed a bit too tight for my taste though, you clipped off a bit of the tail feathers, I would have liked to see a slightly wider shot as this seems a bit cramped.  Gave it a 7.</td>', 'I like this, great colours and contrast and I like the fact that it is a bit on the dark side.  It is however framed a bit too tight for my taste though, you clipped off a bit of the tail feathers, I would have liked to see a slightly wider shot as this seems a bit cramped.  Gave it a 7.', '2005-06-14 06:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454096, 189074, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad at all but the backround is a bit distracting at best and since the bird is completely black the backround draws more attention than the bird itself, at least in my opinion.</td>', 'Not bad at all but the backround is a bit distracting at best and since the bird is completely black the backround draws more attention than the bird itself, at least in my opinion.', '2005-06-14 06:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454104, 189076, 27482, '<td valign="top">I am not one of those that automatically mark down an image for not being tack sharp and in focus, I normally like these kind of shots but this one doesn´t really do anything for me.  I mean no offense but it just needs to be more interesting to work, some kind of motion going on or something else than the duck just sitting there.  Also the composition is a bit too centered for my taste.  Good job though and I like the idea, just not the execution this time, by all means keep up the experimentation.</td>', 'I am not one of those that automatically mark down an image for not being tack sharp and in focus, I normally like these kind of shots but this one doesn´t really do anything for me.  I mean no offense but it just needs to be more interesting to work, some kind of motion going on or something else than the duck just sitting there.  Also the composition is a bit too centered for my taste.  Good job though and I like the idea, just not the execution this time, by all means keep up the experimentation.', '2005-06-14 06:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454106, 187217, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I am not a big fan of selective desaturation, I can tell you right away I would have scored this even higher if it had been in colour or all in b/w.  Anyway, I still like this shot a lot, it lives up to it´s title and it makes me curious what is in store for this little duckling and the vegetation adds to the shot.  Good job.</td>', 'Sorry but I am not a big fan of selective desaturation, I can tell you right away I would have scored this even higher if it had been in colour or all in b/w.  Anyway, I still like this shot a lot, it lives up to it´s title and it makes me curious what is in store for this little duckling and the vegetation adds to the shot.  Good job.', '2005-06-14 06:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454110, 189052, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice title, really fits with this shot as he (she?) seems angry about something.  A little too short DOF for my taste as the tail feathers are out of focus but nice job other than that, like this shot.</td>', 'Nice title, really fits with this shot as he (she?) seems angry about something.  A little too short DOF for my taste as the tail feathers are out of focus but nice job other than that, like this shot.', '2005-06-14 06:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454127, 189069, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very nice, one of the few b/w shots in the challenge and it makes it stand out more wich is good and frankly I don´t think I would have liked this as much if it had been in colour.  Love the tones and the clarity.  Only to nitpick, you cut off one seagulls head to the left and it sticks out like a sore thumb to me but still I like this image a lot.  Great job!</td>', 'Very nice, one of the few b/w shots in the challenge and it makes it stand out more wich is good and frankly I don´t think I would have liked this as much if it had been in colour.  Love the tones and the clarity.  Only to nitpick, you cut off one seagulls head to the left and it sticks out like a sore thumb to me but still I like this image a lot.  Great job!', '2005-06-14 06:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454129, 187172, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, I am a sucker for these motion blur shots and this one is rather good.  The leaves  in the lower right part of the shot are a bit distracting though but still very nice overall shot.</td>', 'Nice, I am a sucker for these motion blur shots and this one is rather good.  The leaves  in the lower right part of the shot are a bit distracting though but still very nice overall shot.', '2005-06-14 06:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454130, 187903, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool moment you caught here, I like the symmetry but still not a jaw dropping shot, I don´t know what it is but there is something missing...  Anyway, still gave it a 7, congrats are in order on the perfect timing on this shot.</td>', 'Pretty cool moment you caught here, I like the symmetry but still not a jaw dropping shot, I don´t know what it is but there is something missing...  Anyway, still gave it a 7, congrats are in order on the perfect timing on this shot.', '2005-06-14 07:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454133, 188740, 24486, '<td valign="top">Love your perspective but just seems a bit too high key to me</td>', 'Love your perspective but just seems a bit too high key to me', '2005-06-14 07:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454136, 188460, 27482, '<td valign="top">Lol!  Reminds me of some creature out of sesame street or some similar shot, I know it´s a bird but I cant help but think this looks like a guy in a bird costume.  Gave it an 8, love this shot.</td>', 'Lol!  Reminds me of some creature out of sesame street or some similar shot, I know it´s a bird but I cant help but think this looks like a guy in a bird costume.  Gave it an 8, love this shot.', '2005-06-14 07:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454138, 188644, 24486, '<td valign="top">Excellant twist on the theme. Thanks for thinking outside the square. Bird on the left just seems a little out of focus.</td>', 'Excellant twist on the theme. Thanks for thinking outside the square. Bird on the left just seems a little out of focus.', '2005-06-14 07:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454148, 187209, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very nice, by far the best swan shot in the challenge, love the DOF.</td>', 'Very nice, by far the best swan shot in the challenge, love the DOF.', '2005-06-14 07:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454150, 188308, 27482, '<td valign="top">Lol!  The title really fits this shot, he (she?) looks very concentrated on something, presumably leading the orchestra.  Nice capture.</td>', 'Lol!  The title really fits this shot, he (she?) looks very concentrated on something, presumably leading the orchestra.  Nice capture.', '2005-06-14 07:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454156, 187635, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry and I bet I am not the first to comment on this, but that frame really doesn´t work here in my opinion, it draws more attention than the duck itself!  I try not to let frames bother me but this is just too much, again sorry, not meaning to offend.<br/> <br/>The shot itself is also below average, it seems out of focus, you either blow out some highlights on the feathers or come very close too it and the composition is dead centered and there is nothing interesting going on in this shot at all.  On the plus side the shot is definately on topic.</td>', 'Sorry and I bet I am not the first to comment on this, but that frame really doesn´t work here in my opinion, it draws more attention than the duck itself!  I try not to let frames bother me but this is just too much, again sorry, not meaning to offend. The shot itself is also below average, it seems out of focus, you either blow out some highlights on the feathers or come very close too it and the composition is dead centered and there is nothing interesting going on in this shot at all.  On the plus side the shot is definately on topic.', '2005-06-14 07:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454196, 187143, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very different from most shots here and I like it, great catch.</td>', 'Very different from most shots here and I like it, great catch.', '2005-06-14 08:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
