(1454231, 188984, 19943, '<td valign="top">the best peacock shot of the challenge.  I like the colors, the focus is good, and the contrast between the green grass and blue feathers is striking.  I''ve always been a fan of profile shots with these guys, but you''ve captured a neat expression on him.  Good job.</td>', 'the best peacock shot of the challenge.  I like the colors, the focus is good, and the contrast between the green grass and blue feathers is striking.  I''ve always been a fan of profile shots with these guys, but you''ve captured a neat expression on him.  Good job.', '2005-06-14 08:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454232, 188826, 32378, '<td valign="top">Outstanding capture, with good composition. 10</td>', 'Outstanding capture, with good composition. 10', '2005-06-14 08:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454235, 188811, 19943, '<td valign="top">Sooo good that it almost looks fake.  This is my pick for the blue ribbon.  Wonderful details, colors, focus, dof, and bokeh.  The only small criticism is the cropping of the top of the head.  However, if you decide to sell this print, let me know.  (10)</td>', 'Sooo good that it almost looks fake.  This is my pick for the blue ribbon.  Wonderful details, colors, focus, dof, and bokeh.  The only small criticism is the cropping of the top of the head.  However, if you decide to sell this print, let me know.  (10)', '2005-06-14 09:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454239, 188308, 19943, '<td valign="top">Unbelievable capture.  Absolutely no blur in the image.  That is so hard to do, and yet you''ve managed to keep such details in the wings.  The title is awesome.  I love it.  (9)</td>', 'Unbelievable capture.  Absolutely no blur in the image.  That is so hard to do, and yet you''ve managed to keep such details in the wings.  The title is awesome.  I love it.  (9)', '2005-06-14 09:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
