(1454389, 186994, 11738, '<td valign="top">I find the overall image a bit too dark and the eyes way too dark.  They need to be lightened as they are the image''s major focal point.  The more I look at it, the more it looks like a partial desaturation job.  Either with colour of partial desat., you need to bring out those beautiful eyes more by intensifying their colour and brightening them up.</td>', 'I find the overall image a bit too dark and the eyes way too dark.  They need to be lightened as they are the image''s major focal point.  The more I look at it, the more it looks like a partial desaturation job.  Either with colour of partial desat., you need to bring out those beautiful eyes more by intensifying their colour and brightening them up.', '2005-06-14 10:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454392, 186654, 19961, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!  Not very fond of the blown highlights, but still funny as hell!</td>', 'Very cool shot!  Not very fond of the blown highlights, but still funny as hell!', '2005-06-14 10:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
