(1454410, 187580, 19961, '<td valign="top">Sharp, good colours on the bird. Not very good composition though.</td>', 'Sharp, good colours on the bird. Not very good composition though.', '2005-06-14 10:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454413, 189032, 11738, '<td valign="top">Looks like the camera focussed on the left wing/shoulder of the bird and not on the bird''s eye.  Remember that depth of field is very small when working close with stronger telephoto lenses.  Using a lens at 300mm at f/5.6 with a 1.6x DSLR crop factor at a working distance of 6 ft creates a depth of field of only 0.2 inches (5mm).  The colours are very good on this shot.</td>', 'Looks like the camera focussed on the left wing/shoulder of the bird and not on the bird''s eye.  Remember that depth of field is very small when working close with stronger telephoto lenses.  Using a lens at 300mm at f/5.6 with a 1.6x DSLR crop factor at a working distance of 6 ft creates a depth of field of only 0.2 inches (5mm).  The colours are very good on this shot.', '2005-06-14 10:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454416, 188372, 11738, '<td valign="top">Superb action shot, but colours are weak.  Could have benefited from a little more brightness and contrast.</td>', 'Superb action shot, but colours are weak.  Could have benefited from a little more brightness and contrast.', '2005-06-14 10:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
