(1454638, 188372, 18216, '<td valign="top">Great stop action! I love the placement and angle. For prints, I suggest cloning out some of the white spots in the trees. Great job! 10</td>', 'Great stop action! I love the placement and angle. For prints, I suggest cloning out some of the white spots in the trees. Great job! 10', '2005-06-14 11:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454641, 188555, 25655, '<td valign="top">This is such a delicate moment captured!  wish I could be present at that moment.<br/>Beautiful photo with such great details and the most perfect DOF !!!<br/> <br/>The only suggestion I can come up with is playing with contrast and saturation to take a little of that yellowish tone off and boost all other colors up a little . I think it would enhance the beauty of this moment even more.<br/>Wonderfully photographed!</td>', 'This is such a delicate moment captured!  wish I could be present at that moment.Beautiful photo with such great details and the most perfect DOF !!! The only suggestion I can come up with is playing with contrast and saturation to take a little of that yellowish tone off and boost all other colors up a little . I think it would enhance the beauty of this moment even more.Wonderfully photographed!', '2005-06-14 11:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454643, 188099, 18216, '<td valign="top">I like the way they are balanced on the ropes, and balanced between them (one crest up, one faceing forward, etc.) Nice use of color. I''m glad you were able to get such good focus. 9</td>', 'I like the way they are balanced on the ropes, and balanced between them (one crest up, one faceing forward, etc.) Nice use of color. I''m glad you were able to get such good focus. 9', '2005-06-14 11:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
