(1454969, 187262, 36981, '<td valign="top">Completely adorable shot.  I really like this.  The browns are pretty and realistic, and go nicely with the grass.  I like the composition and the way you decided to crop it, and the fact that the grass is a an angle in the direction that they''re walking seems to give even more "momentum" to the walk.  Well done!</td>', 'Completely adorable shot.  I really like this.  The browns are pretty and realistic, and go nicely with the grass.  I like the composition and the way you decided to crop it, and the fact that the grass is a an angle in the direction that they''re walking seems to give even more "momentum" to the walk.  Well done!', '2005-06-14 14:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454971, 188980, 36981, '<td valign="top">Very pretty "mystical" looking shot.  I like the softness and the duo tones that you chose; I think the effect is very pretty.</td>', 'Very pretty "mystical" looking shot.  I like the softness and the duo tones that you chose; I think the effect is very pretty.', '2005-06-14 14:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454974, 187321, 36981, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  The contrast between the red-orange and everything else is very striking, and you got the moment really well.</td>', 'Great capture!  The contrast between the red-orange and everything else is very striking, and you got the moment really well.', '2005-06-14 14:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454976, 186654, 36981, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I''ve never actually been a fan of shopped frames, but this picture may change my mind.  I think that the picture is beautiful and the frame really complements it.  Well done!</td>', 'Beautiful!  I''ve never actually been a fan of shopped frames, but this picture may change my mind.  I think that the picture is beautiful and the frame really complements it.  Well done!', '2005-06-14 14:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454978, 188076, 36981, '<td valign="top">Great great pic.   Terrific stop-motion and the bird is perfectly extended.  I like the contrast between the blur on the wings and sharply focused head.  Pretty background &amp; beautiful bird.</td>', 'Great great pic.   Terrific stop-motion and the bird is perfectly extended.  I like the contrast between the blur on the wings and sharply focused head.  Pretty background & beautiful bird.', '2005-06-14 14:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454980, 189069, 36981, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I love the black &amp; white, the blackness of the sand is gorgeous and the reflections are terrific.  I might have like to have seen a little of where they are going, but I suppose you might have had to give up the almost triangular cluster, which I really like a lot.  Well done!</td>', 'Beautiful!  I love the black & white, the blackness of the sand is gorgeous and the reflections are terrific.  I might have like to have seen a little of where they are going, but I suppose you might have had to give up the almost triangular cluster, which I really like a lot.  Well done!', '2005-06-14 14:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454986, 187399, 37779, '<td valign="top">Dramatic and sad, very touching.</td>', 'Dramatic and sad, very touching.', '2005-06-14 14:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
