(1455029, 188086, 34659, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot!  I love the lines in this one.  It may be a little too golden from the sunlight, but otherwise the composition, clarity, and crop are superb.<br/> <br/>I came back to this one and bumped it up from a 9 to a 10.  GREAT job!</td>', 'Fantastic shot!  I love the lines in this one.  It may be a little too golden from the sunlight, but otherwise the composition, clarity, and crop are superb. I came back to this one and bumped it up from a 9 to a 10.  GREAT job!', '2005-06-14 15:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455034, 188789, 34659, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking scenery.  I really like the fact that the peacock really "fits" the background too.  It looks to me like the foreground grass is overprocessed or something (not sure whether it''s just a different variety of grass either), but it''s a little distracting.  Also the focus of the peacock is a little soft (but these are minor points IMHO).<br/> <br/>Great job!  (8)</td>', 'Breathtaking scenery.  I really like the fact that the peacock really "fits" the background too.  It looks to me like the foreground grass is overprocessed or something (not sure whether it''s just a different variety of grass either), but it''s a little distracting.  Also the focus of the peacock is a little soft (but these are minor points IMHO). Great job!  (8)', '2005-06-14 15:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455035, 189068, 34659, '<td valign="top">Stunningly beautiful colors and it doesn''t look overprocessed.  The feathers look to me to be just the right softness too.  I think you nailed it!  SPECTACULAR job!  Congrats!  I''m sure this will be a ribbon taker...  (10)</td>', 'Stunningly beautiful colors and it doesn''t look overprocessed.  The feathers look to me to be just the right softness too.  I think you nailed it!  SPECTACULAR job!  Congrats!  I''m sure this will be a ribbon taker...  (10)', '2005-06-14 15:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455036, 188930, 34659, '<td valign="top">Of all the flamingo shots, I think I like this one best.  Beautiful lines and detail.  (9)</td>', 'Of all the flamingo shots, I think I like this one best.  Beautiful lines and detail.  (9)', '2005-06-14 15:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455038, 188772, 34659, '<td valign="top">Really a beautiful image.  I love the composition and colors.  The clarity is a little off (IMHO) - probably due to the close crop.  Still, an exceptional shot.  Nice job!  (8)  And I like the border...</td>', 'Really a beautiful image.  I love the composition and colors.  The clarity is a little off (IMHO) - probably due to the close crop.  Still, an exceptional shot.  Nice job!  (8)  And I like the border...', '2005-06-14 15:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455044, 189076, 2923, '<td valign="top">others probably won''t like it, but this shot is pretty cool.</td>', 'others probably won''t like it, but this shot is pretty cool.', '2005-06-14 15:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455045, 187652, 31443, '<td valign="top">You must have been really close to get this shot, pleasure to look at..</td>', 'You must have been really close to get this shot, pleasure to look at..', '2005-06-14 15:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455070, 189025, 31443, '<td valign="top">I love this guy!</td>', 'I love this guy!', '2005-06-14 15:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455074, 188308, 32378, '<td valign="top">Normally I don''t like black and white here.  However you shot is outstanding.</td>', 'Normally I don''t like black and white here.  However you shot is outstanding.', '2005-06-14 15:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455077, 188740, 34659, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle and composition (I like the different perspective), but it looks way overprocessed.  The light &amp; glares are really distracting to me.  It looks like you had some good detail on the birds and trees too, but IMHO the processing blew it away.  It certainly meets the challenge, but personally the shot is not one of my favorites.  Sorry.  (3)</td>', 'Interesting angle and composition (I like the different perspective), but it looks way overprocessed.  The light & glares are really distracting to me.  It looks like you had some good detail on the birds and trees too, but IMHO the processing blew it away.  It certainly meets the challenge, but personally the shot is not one of my favorites.  Sorry.  (3)', '2005-06-14 15:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455078, 188086, 32378, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. I like the sharpness and colors work well together.</td>', 'Very nice capture. I like the sharpness and colors work well together.', '2005-06-14 15:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455079, 187043, 32378, '<td valign="top">Outstanding capture.  Reminds me of a picture I would expect to see on a card in a card shop. Compostion, lighting and exposure are all excellent.</td>', 'Outstanding capture.  Reminds me of a picture I would expect to see on a card in a card shop. Compostion, lighting and exposure are all excellent.', '2005-06-14 15:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455080, 188252, 31443, '<td valign="top">A pleasure to look at, the background color makes this image really beautiful and ofcourse the clarity and focus of the bird in the foreground..</td>', 'A pleasure to look at, the background color makes this image really beautiful and ofcourse the clarity and focus of the bird in the foreground..', '2005-06-14 15:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455084, 188587, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo.  Unfortunately though, I promised myself that I would stick to the letter of the challenge (which states there must be at least one bird in the shot).  I''m sticking to my scoring rules &amp; curve, but instead of a 1 I did give this the highest mark I could without meeting the challenge (3).  Like I said, I LOVE the shot, so it pains me to do it, but I do my best to remain consistent and unbiased in my scoring.  (You got amazing detail on the spider - very cool!)</td>', 'Very cool photo.  Unfortunately though, I promised myself that I would stick to the letter of the challenge (which states there must be at least one bird in the shot).  I''m sticking to my scoring rules & curve, but instead of a 1 I did give this the highest mark I could without meeting the challenge (3).  Like I said, I LOVE the shot, so it pains me to do it, but I do my best to remain consistent and unbiased in my scoring.  (You got amazing detail on the spider - very cool!)', '2005-06-14 15:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455085, 188446, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo.  Unfortunately though, I promised myself that I would stick to the letter of the challenge (which states there must be at least one bird in the shot).  I''m sticking to my scoring rules &amp; curve, but instead of a 1 I did give this the highest mark I could without meeting the challenge (3).  Like I said, I LOVE the shot, so it pains me to do it, but I do my best to remain consistent and unbiased in my scoring.  (You got amazing detail on the cat &amp; I love the beak &amp; background feathers! - very cool!)</td>', 'Very cool photo.  Unfortunately though, I promised myself that I would stick to the letter of the challenge (which states there must be at least one bird in the shot).  I''m sticking to my scoring rules & curve, but instead of a 1 I did give this the highest mark I could without meeting the challenge (3).  Like I said, I LOVE the shot, so it pains me to do it, but I do my best to remain consistent and unbiased in my scoring.  (You got amazing detail on the cat & I love the beak & background feathers! - very cool!)', '2005-06-14 15:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455087, 187488, 34659, '<td valign="top">This does meet the challenge, and for that I give you marks.  But the blurriness of the photo and the darkness of it are real distractions to me (IMHO).  Also, the border doesn''t seem to add anything to this particular shots (and I do like borders when used effectively).  I can almost see how you may have been going for a silhouette effect, but there''s just enough detail &amp; color visible to make it not work for me.  And again, I think if it were in focus, it would have scored MUCH better.  Cool idea, I just think that this particular shot may not have done what you hoped.  Sorry (3).</td>', 'This does meet the challenge, and for that I give you marks.  But the blurriness of the photo and the darkness of it are real distractions to me (IMHO).  Also, the border doesn''t seem to add anything to this particular shots (and I do like borders when used effectively).  I can almost see how you may have been going for a silhouette effect, but there''s just enough detail & color visible to make it not work for me.  And again, I think if it were in focus, it would have scored MUCH better.  Cool idea, I just think that this particular shot may not have done what you hoped.  Sorry (3).', '2005-06-14 15:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455088, 189047, 32378, '<td valign="top">This looks like a post card almost.  Only comment I would make is that the branch is a little to bright and pulls you away from the bird.</td>', 'This looks like a post card almost.  Only comment I would make is that the branch is a little to bright and pulls you away from the bird.', '2005-06-14 15:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455092, 187641, 32378, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  I like the reflection in the eye.</td>', 'Very nice capture.  I like the reflection in the eye.', '2005-06-14 15:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455094, 188526, 32378, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite duck pictures.  Background is a little too busy or I would have scored it higher. 7</td>', 'One of my favorite duck pictures.  Background is a little too busy or I would have scored it higher. 7', '2005-06-14 15:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455095, 187843, 34659, '<td valign="top">This does meet the challenge, and for that I give you marks.  But the graininess/blurriness of the photo and the oversaturated pink tones are real distractions to me (IMHO).  I''m sure that this little guy/girl is the apple of your eye and is cute as a button, but I just don''t think it came across in this particular shot.  can almost see how you may have been going for a close-up cute look/expression on the bird, but there''s just not enough detail to make it work for me.  And again, I think if it were not so grainy (looks overprocessed) and in focus, it would have scored MUCH better.  Cool idea, I just think that this particular shot may not have done what you hoped.  Sorry (3).</td>', 'This does meet the challenge, and for that I give you marks.  But the graininess/blurriness of the photo and the oversaturated pink tones are real distractions to me (IMHO).  I''m sure that this little guy/girl is the apple of your eye and is cute as a button, but I just don''t think it came across in this particular shot.  can almost see how you may have been going for a close-up cute look/expression on the bird, but there''s just not enough detail to make it work for me.  And again, I think if it were not so grainy (looks overprocessed) and in focus, it would have scored MUCH better.  Cool idea, I just think that this particular shot may not have done what you hoped.  Sorry (3).', '2005-06-14 15:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455096, 187648, 6668, '<td valign="top">That''s an ugly little birdy lol, love the capture of the fly on it''s head, nice work.</td>', 'That''s an ugly little birdy lol, love the capture of the fly on it''s head, nice work.', '2005-06-14 15:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
