(1455109, 188471, 34659, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been a real strong entry, but it''s way too dark (IMHO).  There''s really nice detail in the feathers, but the contrast and/or shadows really detract from the image.  Also, it would have been nice to see more of the parakeet''s eye.  You''ve got some great color going on, and like I said the detail is good too, but it''s overall too dark (IMHO).  Sorry (4).</td>', 'I think this could have been a real strong entry, but it''s way too dark (IMHO).  There''s really nice detail in the feathers, but the contrast and/or shadows really detract from the image.  Also, it would have been nice to see more of the parakeet''s eye.  You''ve got some great color going on, and like I said the detail is good too, but it''s overall too dark (IMHO).  Sorry (4).', '2005-06-14 15:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455111, 188250, 6668, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture, I think it would be a stronger image if you reduced some of the noise in the sky, but that is only my opinion.</td>', 'Very nice capture, I think it would be a stronger image if you reduced some of the noise in the sky, but that is only my opinion.', '2005-06-14 15:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
