(1455114, 188721, 34659, '<td valign="top">I almost entered a shot of an emu very similar to this!  Yours is MUCH better than mine however!.  You''ve got great detail and colors here, but the shot is a little dark for my tastes.  Still, my highest score for Big Bird!  :-)  (8)</td>', 'I almost entered a shot of an emu very similar to this!  Yours is MUCH better than mine however!.  You''ve got great detail and colors here, but the shot is a little dark for my tastes.  Still, my highest score for Big Bird!  :-)  (8)', '2005-06-14 15:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455115, 187488, 6668, '<td valign="top">The quality of this image is very poor in my opinion, the focus is extremely soft, and there seems to be alot of noise.</td>', 'The quality of this image is very poor in my opinion, the focus is extremely soft, and there seems to be alot of noise.', '2005-06-14 15:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455116, 187652, 32378, '<td valign="top">Very nice smooth coloration in this.</td>', 'Very nice smooth coloration in this.', '2005-06-14 15:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455119, 189052, 34659, '<td valign="top">Your caption is great!  It really brings into focus the concentrated and frustrated expression on the sparrow''s face (I assume it''s a sparrow of some sort).  It really looks like it''s gonna come after me if I utter one word of disagreement.  Very cute &amp; enjoyable shot!  (7)  I''ve come back to this one, because the expression &amp; caption just kill me...  I''m bumping it up to an 8.  Nice job!</td>', 'Your caption is great!  It really brings into focus the concentrated and frustrated expression on the sparrow''s face (I assume it''s a sparrow of some sort).  It really looks like it''s gonna come after me if I utter one word of disagreement.  Very cute & enjoyable shot!  (7)  I''ve come back to this one, because the expression & caption just kill me...  I''m bumping it up to an 8.  Nice job!', '2005-06-14 15:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455120, 187641, 6668, '<td valign="top">What a gorgous bird, I have never seen one of these before, love the detail in the feathers on top of it''s head. nice work, thanks for sharing this remarkable bird. good luck in the challenge. 10</td>', 'What a gorgous bird, I have never seen one of these before, love the detail in the feathers on top of it''s head. nice work, thanks for sharing this remarkable bird. good luck in the challenge. 10', '2005-06-14 15:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
