(1455126, 187846, 34659, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning clarity and I love the muted tones of this image.  VERY natural in appearance - no signs (to me) of overprocessing.  You really did a nice job juggling the necessary detail of the subject and softness of the background.  I also like the fact that this is something I could see in my backyard on any given day.  Great work - I''m bumping this up from my initial score of 7 to 9.</td>', 'Simply stunning clarity and I love the muted tones of this image.  VERY natural in appearance - no signs (to me) of overprocessing.  You really did a nice job juggling the necessary detail of the subject and softness of the background.  I also like the fact that this is something I could see in my backyard on any given day.  Great work - I''m bumping this up from my initial score of 7 to 9.', '2005-06-14 15:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
