(1455136, 187903, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is certainly a once-in-a-lifetime shot.  How cool!  A few distractions for me are the OOF portions of the gull and the loss of detail due to glare, but overall a great job.  The reflection and crop are superb.  Very well balanced &amp; composed.  I just wish it was a little crisper and a little less glare.  Still, overall a real keeper!  (8)</td>', 'This is certainly a once-in-a-lifetime shot.  How cool!  A few distractions for me are the OOF portions of the gull and the loss of detail due to glare, but overall a great job.  The reflection and crop are superb.  Very well balanced & composed.  I just wish it was a little crisper and a little less glare.  Still, overall a real keeper!  (8)', '2005-06-14 15:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
