(1455149, 187495, 32378, '<td valign="top">Well there is a bird so you got points for that.  Biggest problem is the reflection off the water is so overbearing you have to force yourself to look for the bird.</td>', 'Well there is a bird so you got points for that.  Biggest problem is the reflection off the water is so overbearing you have to force yourself to look for the bird.', '2005-06-14 16:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455151, 187565, 38838, '<td valign="top">Finally, a title and photograph that match. Great shot!</td>', 'Finally, a title and photograph that match. Great shot!', '2005-06-14 16:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455152, 188727, 6668, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photo, I love the capture of the bird flying away and the cute bird on the lamp post looking right at the camera, even the crack in the lamp that adds a touch of colors accents this image nicely.  Outstanding! 10</td>', 'This is a wonderful photo, I love the capture of the bird flying away and the cute bird on the lamp post looking right at the camera, even the crack in the lamp that adds a touch of colors accents this image nicely.  Outstanding! 10', '2005-06-14 16:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455153, 188831, 25655, '<td valign="top">aww... how cute!<br/>that white spot on the rusted bar makes me wonder what it is all the time, but it''s such a cutie shot...</td>', 'aww... how cute!that white spot on the rusted bar makes me wonder what it is all the time, but it''s such a cutie shot...', '2005-06-14 16:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455154, 188615, 32378, '<td valign="top">There are too many blown out spots in this to the point of distraction.  Bird on the left seems out of focus.  Birds are too dark and cant see any details in them.</td>', 'There are too many blown out spots in this to the point of distraction.  Bird on the left seems out of focus.  Birds are too dark and cant see any details in them.', '2005-06-14 16:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455155, 188646, 6668, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this image, the deep greens against the white birds is really beautiful, this photo also has a soft dreamy feel about it that works very well.  Nice work.</td>', 'I love the colors in this image, the deep greens against the white birds is really beautiful, this photo also has a soft dreamy feel about it that works very well.  Nice work.', '2005-06-14 16:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455156, 189045, 25655, '<td valign="top">i wish your dof was shallower and personally I would add some blur to the background to make it less distracting.<br/>but over all this is a nice catch of a beautiful and graceful flight.</td>', 'i wish your dof was shallower and personally I would add some blur to the background to make it less distracting.but over all this is a nice catch of a beautiful and graceful flight.', '2005-06-14 16:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455160, 188672, 32378, '<td valign="top">Well okay.  I like the lens the guy has on his shoulder.  Sorry but this just doesn''t belong in this challenge except as a fun shot.  I hope you had a good time at the game and that your team one.  At least now I know what the Nationals mascott looks like.</td>', 'Well okay.  I like the lens the guy has on his shoulder.  Sorry but this just doesn''t belong in this challenge except as a fun shot.  I hope you had a good time at the game and that your team one.  At least now I know what the Nationals mascott looks like.', '2005-06-14 16:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455161, 187148, 16046, '<td valign="top">Great color</td>', 'Great color', '2005-06-14 16:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455164, 188976, 32378, '<td valign="top">You must have been thinking outside of the box on this from the caption.  Actually I gave you some credit for not interpreting the challange like the other 200+ people.</td>', 'You must have been thinking outside of the box on this from the caption.  Actually I gave you some credit for not interpreting the challange like the other 200+ people.', '2005-06-14 16:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455165, 188308, 25655, '<td valign="top">wow! cool catch amazing details.<br/>I would love to see this one in colors, although the b&amp;w is very interesting for it.<br/></td>', 'wow! cool catch amazing details.I would love to see this one in colors, although the b&w is very interesting for it.', '2005-06-14 16:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455166, 188740, 32378, '<td valign="top">This needs to be cropped differently.  Obviously the sky is way to blown out to be anything but a distraction.  Appears the tree not the birds are the subject of this picture.</td>', 'This needs to be cropped differently.  Obviously the sky is way to blown out to be anything but a distraction.  Appears the tree not the birds are the subject of this picture.', '2005-06-14 16:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455168, 186654, 16046, '<td valign="top">This  is too good, wish the tags on the legs could be removed though. Nice work</td>', 'This  is too good, wish the tags on the legs could be removed though. Nice work', '2005-06-14 16:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455170, 188460, 32378, '<td valign="top">I think I would have prefered to see a real bird.</td>', 'I think I would have prefered to see a real bird.', '2005-06-14 16:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455171, 187043, 25655, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF, crisp and clear details, vivid colors, just beautiful!</td>', 'Excellent DOF, crisp and clear details, vivid colors, just beautiful!', '2005-06-14 16:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455174, 186973, 16046, '<td valign="top">nice detail</td>', 'nice detail', '2005-06-14 16:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455176, 188677, 16046, '<td valign="top">Excellent work</td>', 'Excellent work', '2005-06-14 16:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455179, 188611, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, must have been shot from too far away to pull the bird in closer.  Also seems the sky is underexposed.  I find that shooting at the sky I have to shoot to overexpose 1 to 2 stops based on the cameras light meter.</td>', 'Nice idea, must have been shot from too far away to pull the bird in closer.  Also seems the sky is underexposed.  I find that shooting at the sky I have to shoot to overexpose 1 to 2 stops based on the cameras light meter.', '2005-06-14 16:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455181, 188826, 16046, '<td valign="top">Wonderful pose, good detail</td>', 'Wonderful pose, good detail', '2005-06-14 16:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455182, 188972, 25655, '<td valign="top">flamingos!!! my biggest weakness.... <br/>what an unusual catch of them! <br/>I don''t like that effect on the background that makes the edges look dark and dreamy, but I just love flamingos, can''t help it!</td>', 'flamingos!!! my biggest weakness.... what an unusual catch of them! I don''t like that effect on the background that makes the edges look dark and dreamy, but I just love flamingos, can''t help it!', '2005-06-14 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455184, 187893, 32378, '<td valign="top">Looks like the bottom of this was cropped incorrectly, like the croping tool went outside the picture.  Hightlights obviously are blown out, and left wing is cut off.  I think more attention to detail would help you, at least in this shot.</td>', 'Looks like the bottom of this was cropped incorrectly, like the croping tool went outside the picture.  Hightlights obviously are blown out, and left wing is cut off.  I think more attention to detail would help you, at least in this shot.', '2005-06-14 16:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455185, 188446, 31443, '<td valign="top">This is so funny, reminds me of my Obelix the mighty bird hunter</td>', 'This is so funny, reminds me of my Obelix the mighty bird hunter', '2005-06-14 16:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455187, 188981, 25655, '<td valign="top">nice image and I like the colors of those ducks, but the high saturated water are very distracting IMO. <br/>I would lower the green saturation and leave the browns reds and yellows.</td>', 'nice image and I like the colors of those ducks, but the high saturated water are very distracting IMO. I would lower the green saturation and leave the browns reds and yellows.', '2005-06-14 16:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455188, 189005, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Howeverthe bird house is too bright.  I would have darkend this in editing so that more focus was on the bird than the outside of the house.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Howeverthe bird house is too bright.  I would have darkend this in editing so that more focus was on the bird than the outside of the house.', '2005-06-14 16:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455193, 189069, 16046, '<td valign="top">Excellent B&amp;W. Great tones.</td>', 'Excellent B&W. Great tones.', '2005-06-14 16:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455195, 187155, 32378, '<td valign="top">Creative idea. However, seems like the focus of the picture is not the pigeon.  If this was shot from a lower perspective, like you laying on the ground and shooting at birds eyelevel I think it would have been really neat with less emphasis on the bike.</td>', 'Creative idea. However, seems like the focus of the picture is not the pigeon.  If this was shot from a lower perspective, like you laying on the ground and shooting at birds eyelevel I think it would have been really neat with less emphasis on the bike.', '2005-06-14 16:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455197, 188715, 32378, '<td valign="top">Good try.  I was looking for a real bird though.</td>', 'Good try.  I was looking for a real bird though.', '2005-06-14 16:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455199, 186794, 32378, '<td valign="top">Cute girl, however she appears to be the subject of the picture and not the birds.</td>', 'Cute girl, however she appears to be the subject of the picture and not the birds.', '2005-06-14 16:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455202, 187613, 32378, '<td valign="top">There seems to be too much brightness in the flection off the ground to make this a pleasing picture.</td>', 'There seems to be too much brightness in the flection off the ground to make this a pleasing picture.', '2005-06-14 16:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455203, 188981, 32378, '<td valign="top">This looks over saturated and over sharpened.</td>', 'This looks over saturated and over sharpened.', '2005-06-14 16:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455206, 188914, 16046, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like they were painted, nice image.</td>', 'Almost looks like they were painted, nice image.', '2005-06-14 16:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455218, 187039, 16046, '<td valign="top">Nice image, well done</td>', 'Nice image, well done', '2005-06-14 16:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455221, 188668, 16046, '<td valign="top">Winner, awesome light, 10</td>', 'Winner, awesome light, 10', '2005-06-14 16:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455223, 189080, 16046, '<td valign="top">Well done, creative shot</td>', 'Well done, creative shot', '2005-06-14 16:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455230, 189068, 25787, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture...love the eyes....</td>', 'Very nice picture...love the eyes....', '2005-06-14 16:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455231, 188356, 25787, '<td valign="top">Very sharp picture!  Love the headress!</td>', 'Very sharp picture!  Love the headress!', '2005-06-14 16:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455232, 188793, 25787, '<td valign="top">Come''on......</td>', 'Come''on......', '2005-06-14 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455246, 189008, 34659, '<td valign="top">Adorable shot.  Great colors too.  I''d like to see a little more detail (there are a number of spots on the birds that are a little blurry (IMHO), but excellent composition!  (7)</td>', 'Adorable shot.  Great colors too.  I''d like to see a little more detail (there are a number of spots on the birds that are a little blurry (IMHO), but excellent composition!  (7)', '2005-06-14 16:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455248, 188460, 33947, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo. Clear, good background. Looks like something from Sesame Street. :) Nicely lit and cropped. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Lovely photo. Clear, good background. Looks like something from Sesame Street. :) Nicely lit and cropped. One of my favorites.', '2005-06-14 16:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455249, 188308, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great B/W piece!  The detail and textures are superb.  I think the lighting is a little harsh in spots, but it''s difficult to take many points away from this one.  Really beautiful job.  (9)</td>', 'Great B/W piece!  The detail and textures are superb.  I think the lighting is a little harsh in spots, but it''s difficult to take many points away from this one.  Really beautiful job.  (9)', '2005-06-14 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455251, 188476, 33947, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this quiet shot.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this quiet shot.', '2005-06-14 16:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455253, 189015, 34659, '<td valign="top">Excellent reflection.  The colors a little oversaturated in gold for my particular taste (and the shot looks a little overprocessed - it could just be me), but overall a really nice shot.  (6)</td>', 'Excellent reflection.  The colors a little oversaturated in gold for my particular taste (and the shot looks a little overprocessed - it could just be me), but overall a really nice shot.  (6)', '2005-06-14 16:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455256, 187565, 34659, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but the oversaturated yellow of the owl''s eyes is a little distracting.  IMHO, it makes the overall appearance of the bird somehow unnatural.  The rest of the shot is great - nice muted color tones (and I''m sure the eyes were probably intentional), I just wish the eyes had been toned down a bit.  Still, a great shot.  (7)<br/></td>', 'I like this shot, but the oversaturated yellow of the owl''s eyes is a little distracting.  IMHO, it makes the overall appearance of the bird somehow unnatural.  The rest of the shot is great - nice muted color tones (and I''m sure the eyes were probably intentional), I just wish the eyes had been toned down a bit.  Still, a great shot.  (7)', '2005-06-14 16:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455259, 188882, 33947, '<td valign="top">I very much like how you blurred the feathers in the background. Neat effect. The bird itself, though, could be a bit sharper.</td>', 'I very much like how you blurred the feathers in the background. Neat effect. The bird itself, though, could be a bit sharper.', '2005-06-14 16:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455262, 188574, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is so majestic...  That''s the word that immediately leaps to my mind when I see this image.  There''s a little too much glare on the dove (IMHO), but the sky and overall colors are superb!  The crop really adds to this shot too.  Well done.  (8)</td>', 'This is so majestic...  That''s the word that immediately leaps to my mind when I see this image.  There''s a little too much glare on the dove (IMHO), but the sky and overall colors are superb!  The crop really adds to this shot too.  Well done.  (8)', '2005-06-14 16:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455263, 188887, 33947, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouetted composition. I like the simplicity of it.</td>', 'Nice silhouetted composition. I like the simplicity of it.', '2005-06-14 16:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455264, 188919, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lack of detail in the shadows which is unfortunate given that this includes the main subject, doesn''t seem sharp, uninspiring background.</td>', 'Lack of detail in the shadows which is unfortunate given that this includes the main subject, doesn''t seem sharp, uninspiring background.', '2005-06-14 16:56:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1455267, 188697, 3087, '<td valign="top">The appeal of the shape of the bird in flight is lost because of the dark backdrop of the tree. For a shot like this to work for me, you''d need to have repositioned yourself to get a clean sky background.</td>', 'The appeal of the shape of the bird in flight is lost because of the dark backdrop of the tree. For a shot like this to work for me, you''d need to have repositioned yourself to get a clean sky background.', '2005-06-14 16:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455268, 188967, 33947, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture. He looks like he''s squintin'' at me.</td>', 'Interesting capture. He looks like he''s squintin'' at me.', '2005-06-14 16:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455269, 187488, 3087, '<td valign="top">Quality issues are the main problem for me here - there are pale halos around the dark edges, the focus doesn''t seem great either. Nor is the silhouette ideal as there is too much foliage competing with the bird. The border is also not appealing to me.</td>', 'Quality issues are the main problem for me here - there are pale halos around the dark edges, the focus doesn''t seem great either. Nor is the silhouette ideal as there is too much foliage competing with the bird. The border is also not appealing to me.', '2005-06-14 16:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455270, 188430, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  I love the composition.  What really detracts from it though (IMHO) is the glare on the water.  I think with some selective processing you could reduce the light &amp; glare on the water and draw the viewers'' attention more to the primary subjects.  Currently, I think the color of the light on the water and the color of the pelicans'' head are too similar - it makes the birds appear to be washed out (when in fact they''re not, they''re great - it''s the water).  I think you could desaturate the water and add a gaussian blur to it in several layers to really make the water add to the pic instead of detract.  Nice work though.  (6)</td>', 'This is a great shot.  I love the composition.  What really detracts from it though (IMHO) is the glare on the water.  I think with some selective processing you could reduce the light & glare on the water and draw the viewers'' attention more to the primary subjects.  Currently, I think the color of the light on the water and the color of the pelicans'' head are too similar - it makes the birds appear to be washed out (when in fact they''re not, they''re great - it''s the water).  I think you could desaturate the water and add a gaussian blur to it in several layers to really make the water add to the pic instead of detract.  Nice work though.  (6)', '2005-06-14 16:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455275, 188811, 33947, '<td valign="top">10! Superb.</td>', '10! Superb.', '2005-06-14 17:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455277, 188982, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love the content of this picture - to capture the heron with his catch and with the wonderful interest of the rocks too - excellent. The problem for me is that the main subject is in shadow and lacks detail whereas the background is perfectly lit. I can see that this is down to time of day and where the light is coming from but would question whether a little fill in flash would help (if you''re close enough) or simply just an exposure taken off the bird rather than the background. That said, this shot could be improved (in my opinion) with some post processing adjustment of levels and contrast.</td>', 'I love the content of this picture - to capture the heron with his catch and with the wonderful interest of the rocks too - excellent. The problem for me is that the main subject is in shadow and lacks detail whereas the background is perfectly lit. I can see that this is down to time of day and where the light is coming from but would question whether a little fill in flash would help (if you''re close enough) or simply just an exposure taken off the bird rather than the background. That said, this shot could be improved (in my opinion) with some post processing adjustment of levels and contrast.', '2005-06-14 17:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455279, 188776, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, good eye contact. Lacks excitement in terms of composition for me.</td>', 'Nice lighting, good eye contact. Lacks excitement in terms of composition for me.', '2005-06-14 17:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455280, 186994, 33947, '<td valign="top">The clarity is impressive. Very, very strong detail.</td>', 'The clarity is impressive. Very, very strong detail.', '2005-06-14 17:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455282, 188699, 3087, '<td valign="top">Bird is overwhelmed by the detail and colour of the yellower sticks in the foreground. Image also seems slightly oversharp or overcontrasted? I can''t see halos yet, something doesn''t feel quite right about it. Composition works reasonably well.</td>', 'Bird is overwhelmed by the detail and colour of the yellower sticks in the foreground. Image also seems slightly oversharp or overcontrasted? I can''t see halos yet, something doesn''t feel quite right about it. Composition works reasonably well.', '2005-06-14 17:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455283, 187220, 19672, '<td valign="top">this looks like the same style as the one who won with the vulture head....nice job!</td>', 'this looks like the same style as the one who won with the vulture head....nice job!', '2005-06-14 17:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455284, 188835, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting viewpoint though looking up in this way means what we see is in shadow. Image seems soft too - I just cant make out any detail. Composition works well.</td>', 'Interesting viewpoint though looking up in this way means what we see is in shadow. Image seems soft too - I just cant make out any detail. Composition works well.', '2005-06-14 17:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455285, 189037, 19672, '<td valign="top">topic was birds.... NOT a dinosaur!!! *lol*<br/> <br/>(would have rotate the image 90 degrees)</td>', 'topic was birds.... NOT a dinosaur!!! *lol* (would have rotate the image 90 degrees)', '2005-06-14 17:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455286, 188811, 22872, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!!! 10!  I absolutely love this!</td>', 'This is awesome!!! 10!  I absolutely love this!', '2005-06-14 17:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455287, 188918, 19672, '<td valign="top">poor thing....<br/> <br/>Let''s name him Manfrotto!</td>', 'poor thing.... Let''s name him Manfrotto!', '2005-06-14 17:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455288, 187284, 19672, '<td valign="top">Scalvert...is that you?</td>', 'Scalvert...is that you?', '2005-06-14 17:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455289, 188914, 19672, '<td valign="top">I love pelicans</td>', 'I love pelicans', '2005-06-14 17:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455290, 188283, 38072, '<td valign="top">This is a waxwing, right?  Very pretty birds.  It''s too bad the lighting wasn''t more on the bird to give finer detail and to separate his eye and beak a little better.  5</td>', 'This is a waxwing, right?  Very pretty birds.  It''s too bad the lighting wasn''t more on the bird to give finer detail and to separate his eye and beak a little better.  5', '2005-06-14 17:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455291, 189011, 3087, '<td valign="top">I think I''d really like this if only I could make the bird out more clearly against the background. They are simply too close in colour for me and whilst that may well be because of the bird''s propensity to rest in places where it is camouflaged, it doesn''t make for as strong a picture, in my opinion. If only the background were pale and bright like the rock it rests upon! Also, I don''t know if it''s because you''ve selected the background and then blurred it or due to sharpening but there''s a very strong pale halo right around the bird which doesn''t look good to me at all.</td>', 'I think I''d really like this if only I could make the bird out more clearly against the background. They are simply too close in colour for me and whilst that may well be because of the bird''s propensity to rest in places where it is camouflaged, it doesn''t make for as strong a picture, in my opinion. If only the background were pale and bright like the rock it rests upon! Also, I don''t know if it''s because you''ve selected the background and then blurred it or due to sharpening but there''s a very strong pale halo right around the bird which doesn''t look good to me at all.', '2005-06-14 17:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455294, 189068, 22872, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great colors!    Crystal clear right in the eyes.  The composition is a little different but I don''t mind. 9</td>', 'Wow!  Great colors!    Crystal clear right in the eyes.  The composition is a little different but I don''t mind. 9', '2005-06-14 17:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455295, 189074, 38072, '<td valign="top">A fun shot!  I think I would have enjoyed it more if the whole bird were in the picture.  5</td>', 'A fun shot!  I think I would have enjoyed it more if the whole bird were in the picture.  5', '2005-06-14 17:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455296, 187648, 22872, '<td valign="top">oh that poor pitiful ugly baby! lol.  And a nasty fly on it''s head to boot!  Great catch!</td>', 'oh that poor pitiful ugly baby! lol.  And a nasty fly on it''s head to boot!  Great catch!', '2005-06-14 17:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455298, 187741, 35804, '<td valign="top">A "so darn ugly it''s cute" kind of bird...those eyes are amazing!</td>', 'A "so darn ugly it''s cute" kind of bird...those eyes are amazing!', '2005-06-14 17:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455300, 189055, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure, night lighting and good framing but... whilst it''s interesting from a behavioural point of view, the pose just makes for a "messy" composition.</td>', 'Nice exposure, night lighting and good framing but... whilst it''s interesting from a behavioural point of view, the pose just makes for a "messy" composition.', '2005-06-14 17:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455301, 188827, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting colours but lacking in appeal for me in terms of content. Would be good to have captured the bird when the light was coming from another direction so as to provide a catchlight in the eye and make the eye the focal point. cropping seems a touch arbitrary - doesn''t feel balanced. Colour cast seems a bit cold...</td>', 'Interesting colours but lacking in appeal for me in terms of content. Would be good to have captured the bird when the light was coming from another direction so as to provide a catchlight in the eye and make the eye the focal point. cropping seems a touch arbitrary - doesn''t feel balanced. Colour cast seems a bit cold...', '2005-06-14 17:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455302, 187879, 35804, '<td valign="top">omg...perfect title...makes this such a funny / entertaining image.</td>', 'omg...perfect title...makes this such a funny / entertaining image.', '2005-06-14 17:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455303, 188062, 3087, '<td valign="top">There seems to be such a strange halo around the two geese - I don''t know if that''s because of an effect filter or because you''ve selectively processed the water/ birds etc. The whole thing feels soft too so maybe it''s all down to a soft focus filter (not a fan myself). I like the composition but the processing doesn''t work at all for me.</td>', 'There seems to be such a strange halo around the two geese - I don''t know if that''s because of an effect filter or because you''ve selectively processed the water/ birds etc. The whole thing feels soft too so maybe it''s all down to a soft focus filter (not a fan myself). I like the composition but the processing doesn''t work at all for me.', '2005-06-14 17:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455313, 188936, 25095, '<td valign="top">Hey this looks like my old bird, is this a Moluccan?  I had to get rid of mine due to the squealing he used to do...drove me INSANE!  I think a little more depth of field would make the background less obtrusive but still a good sharp image.  Good luck.</td>', 'Hey this looks like my old bird, is this a Moluccan?  I had to get rid of mine due to the squealing he used to do...drove me INSANE!  I think a little more depth of field would make the background less obtrusive but still a good sharp image.  Good luck.', '2005-06-14 17:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455316, 188774, 3087, '<td valign="top">Good light but poor composition - very static and uninspiring, too much detail in the background.</td>', 'Good light but poor composition - very static and uninspiring, too much detail in the background.', '2005-06-14 17:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455320, 188774, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice close up and personal view of the duck, i feel like very close to him/her now.   i wish you had cloned out the weed pointing to his bil and the one perpendicular to his bill in the background.  focus could be a bit tighter on the eye instead of the bill.-5</td>', 'nice close up and personal view of the duck, i feel like very close to him/her now.   i wish you had cloned out the weed pointing to his bil and the one perpendicular to his bill in the background.  focus could be a bit tighter on the eye instead of the bill.-5', '2005-06-14 17:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455324, 188908, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice eye detail and unusual angle helps a touch but simply not sharp enough or interesting enough to score highly with me.</td>', 'Nice eye detail and unusual angle helps a touch but simply not sharp enough or interesting enough to score highly with me.', '2005-06-14 17:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455327, 188831, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cute! I really like the ducklings themselves and the light in their eyes is great. What I dislike is the distraction of those white rocks behind. Even the rusty container isn''t ideal but it''s less of a distraction than the rocks.</td>', 'Cute! I really like the ducklings themselves and the light in their eyes is great. What I dislike is the distraction of those white rocks behind. Even the rusty container isn''t ideal but it''s less of a distraction than the rocks.', '2005-06-14 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455329, 188901, 13688, '<td valign="top">really  like the position of the head.  perhaps oversharpened a bit on the wing tip and face.  just seems odd, since it kind of looks like an owl and it''s against a daylit sky.  I guess it''s supposed to be a hawk.  i guess i should have studied at the aviary before this challenge. i guess i''ll give you a 6.  i still wish there was a cloud in the empty part of the screen.</td>', 'really  like the position of the head.  perhaps oversharpened a bit on the wing tip and face.  just seems odd, since it kind of looks like an owl and it''s against a daylit sky.  I guess it''s supposed to be a hawk.  i guess i should have studied at the aviary before this challenge. i guess i''ll give you a 6.  i still wish there was a cloud in the empty part of the screen.', '2005-06-14 17:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455333, 189047, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like the use of flash against a bright background.  I wish the sky background coverd the bird and the tree was more off to the left.  my eye wants to go to that dead space, so i guess i would have cropped closer to the wing.-6</td>', 'i like the use of flash against a bright background.  I wish the sky background coverd the bird and the tree was more off to the left.  my eye wants to go to that dead space, so i guess i would have cropped closer to the wing.-6', '2005-06-14 17:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455340, 189036, 3087, '<td valign="top">Sweet capture of behaviour but, for an image to work for me on a visually appealing level, I need more eyes and less arse. Background also uninspiring too detailed.</td>', 'Sweet capture of behaviour but, for an image to work for me on a visually appealing level, I need more eyes and less arse. Background also uninspiring too detailed.', '2005-06-14 17:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455342, 188789, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice to show the environment but in this case the bird is not a strong focal point. Firstly because it''s in the shadow whereas the brightest area is the grass behind - need more light on it and less elsewhere - and secondly because the image has detail from foreground all the way through to background - shallow DOF and blurred background might help.</td>', 'Nice to show the environment but in this case the bird is not a strong focal point. Firstly because it''s in the shadow whereas the brightest area is the grass behind - need more light on it and less elsewhere - and secondly because the image has detail from foreground all the way through to background - shallow DOF and blurred background might help.', '2005-06-14 17:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455345, 188644, 13688, '<td valign="top">great focus.  perhaps a straight on shot would have allowed you to show more of the base without the sill being skewed.  unfortunately i don''t find the subject very compelling.  perhaps a more artistic crop closer in might have helped, or maybe just made the whole thing confusing-5</td>', 'great focus.  perhaps a straight on shot would have allowed you to show more of the base without the sill being skewed.  unfortunately i don''t find the subject very compelling.  perhaps a more artistic crop closer in might have helped, or maybe just made the whole thing confusing-5', '2005-06-14 17:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455346, 188988, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and good detail in white feathers so very nicely exposed but background really doesn''t work well.</td>', 'Nice capture and good detail in white feathers so very nicely exposed but background really doesn''t work well.', '2005-06-14 17:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455348, 187741, 3087, '<td valign="top">Ha haaa, this one makes me smile. Nice detail in the beak and eye but DOF may be just a touch too shallow as I''d also like detail in the fur on the head and neck.</td>', 'Ha haaa, this one makes me smile. Nice detail in the beak and eye but DOF may be just a touch too shallow as I''d also like detail in the fur on the head and neck.', '2005-06-14 17:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455352, 188443, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like the orange reflections balance of the orange in the birds, i wish it wasn''t so close to the end of the frame.  the yellow flower and the plant between them are a bit distracting.-5</td>', 'i like the orange reflections balance of the orange in the birds, i wish it wasn''t so close to the end of the frame.  the yellow flower and the plant between them are a bit distracting.-5', '2005-06-14 17:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455355, 189022, 38950, '<td valign="top">There is a very distracting strange halo around the bird and pole.</td>', 'There is a very distracting strange halo around the bird and pole.', '2005-06-14 17:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455358, 188911, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice contrast.  i can feel the wood.  i like the muted hues-8</td>', 'nice contrast.  i can feel the wood.  i like the muted hues-8', '2005-06-14 17:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455359, 187609, 38950, '<td valign="top">The bird is not sharp enough.</td>', 'The bird is not sharp enough.', '2005-06-14 17:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455361, 189059, 3087, '<td valign="top">That eye really is something isn''t it? Such a strong focal point. Somehow it''s position within the frame doesn''t feel quite right - almost centred yet not centred. There seems to be some blowout in the whites which is a shame but not too bad.</td>', 'That eye really is something isn''t it? Such a strong focal point. Somehow it''s position within the frame doesn''t feel quite right - almost centred yet not centred. There seems to be some blowout in the whites which is a shame but not too bad.', '2005-06-14 17:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455362, 188254, 3087, '<td valign="top">Diagonal is interesting but doesn''t save this from being too static and too uninteresting an image. The detail is nice, it''s good that you have that eye detail too. I think the grass being in the same plane as the bird and therefore in focus definitely doesn''t help make the bird pop out.</td>', 'Diagonal is interesting but doesn''t save this from being too static and too uninteresting an image. The detail is nice, it''s good that you have that eye detail too. I think the grass being in the same plane as the bird and therefore in focus definitely doesn''t help make the bird pop out.', '2005-06-14 17:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455366, 188268, 38950, '<td valign="top">The barb wire is distracting, I would also have liked to see more detail in the head.</td>', 'The barb wire is distracting, I would also have liked to see more detail in the head.', '2005-06-14 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455368, 186749, 3087, '<td valign="top">Absolutely great detail on the bird - I can see the feathers so clearly, and wonderful colour too. I really don''t like the artificial way that the focus has been taken away from the person holding and kissing the bird at all though. Also, I don''t like the way that the background seems to have been painted over with yellow and orange. There are also some strange artifacts in that yellow and orange area on the left.</td>', 'Absolutely great detail on the bird - I can see the feathers so clearly, and wonderful colour too. I really don''t like the artificial way that the focus has been taken away from the person holding and kissing the bird at all though. Also, I don''t like the way that the background seems to have been painted over with yellow and orange. There are also some strange artifacts in that yellow and orange area on the left.', '2005-06-14 17:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455369, 188228, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice action capture.  a couple of steps to the left if possible to separate them (the beak from the wing) a bit might have helped. i like how the pattern of the palm trees match their feathers, but in this case i would have rather been closer to their faces-5</td>', 'nice action capture.  a couple of steps to the left if possible to separate them (the beak from the wing) a bit might have helped. i like how the pattern of the palm trees match their feathers, but in this case i would have rather been closer to their faces-5', '2005-06-14 17:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455370, 188788, 38950, '<td valign="top">A bit overexposed, otherwise nice shot.</td>', 'A bit overexposed, otherwise nice shot.', '2005-06-14 17:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455372, 188920, 3087, '<td valign="top">Careless cropping (either when taking or processing) means losing the rest of that crown. Good to have some reflection in the eye yet this image seems dark given that indication of light.</td>', 'Careless cropping (either when taking or processing) means losing the rest of that crown. Good to have some reflection in the eye yet this image seems dark given that indication of light.', '2005-06-14 17:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455373, 188981, 3087, '<td valign="top">Colours seem strongly oversaturated. That green is so vivid it competes for attention against the birds and wins.</td>', 'Colours seem strongly oversaturated. That green is so vivid it competes for attention against the birds and wins.', '2005-06-14 17:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455374, 187635, 13688, '<td valign="top">wish there was more space between the reflection and the border. it''s very painterly, but i still wish the focus was a bit tighter.  As you already know...the border was a bit over the top.-5</td>', 'wish there was more space between the reflection and the border. it''s very painterly, but i still wish the focus was a bit tighter.  As you already know...the border was a bit over the top.-5', '2005-06-14 17:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455375, 189077, 3087, '<td valign="top">Noisy and soft. Horizon very central making for a very heavy feeling composition. Nice idea and nice colour to the sky but quality and composition of image not quite strong enough.</td>', 'Noisy and soft. Horizon very central making for a very heavy feeling composition. Nice idea and nice colour to the sky but quality and composition of image not quite strong enough.', '2005-06-14 17:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455379, 188313, 3087, '<td valign="top">I have an image of the same name in my portfolio which is also of a parent bird feeding their chick. This is a nice example of behaviour but doesn''t work for me on a visual level. The dark beaks don''t show up well against the dark breast of the adult. The foreground colour competes for attention with the subject. The composition isn''t particularly attention grabbing. But I do like the subject matter.</td>', 'I have an image of the same name in my portfolio which is also of a parent bird feeding their chick. This is a nice example of behaviour but doesn''t work for me on a visual level. The dark beaks don''t show up well against the dark breast of the adult. The foreground colour competes for attention with the subject. The composition isn''t particularly attention grabbing. But I do like the subject matter.', '2005-06-14 17:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455381, 189062, 38950, '<td valign="top">Nice looking kingfisher, sadly the image is a bit soft.</td>', 'Nice looking kingfisher, sadly the image is a bit soft.', '2005-06-14 17:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455384, 189060, 13688, '<td valign="top">face is a bit dark...though you had some pretty tough lighting.  I would have cloned out everything branchy after just past  the feet.  it feels like there''s too much empty space-4</td>', 'face is a bit dark...though you had some pretty tough lighting.  I would have cloned out everything branchy after just past  the feet.  it feels like there''s too much empty space-4', '2005-06-14 17:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455392, 188975, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like how you have captured determination in his face...most likely from getting ready to take off.  I wish you would have been able to call this pick "Determined" and gotten away with it on this site.  Actually "Determined to catch that fish"  might have worked.   the focus is a bit soft,  the colors are a bit washed out.  i''m not a big fan of those vertical reflections.  i would have tried to focus on the face somehow-5</td>', 'i like how you have captured determination in his face...most likely from getting ready to take off.  I wish you would have been able to call this pick "Determined" and gotten away with it on this site.  Actually "Determined to catch that fish"  might have worked.   the focus is a bit soft,  the colors are a bit washed out.  i''m not a big fan of those vertical reflections.  i would have tried to focus on the face somehow-5', '2005-06-14 17:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455393, 188835, 38950, '<td valign="top">This image to to blurry.</td>', 'This image to to blurry.', '2005-06-14 17:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455396, 188824, 34459, '<td valign="top">A great pic of an ''ordinary'' bird - really good idea, well captured, and I like budgies. 8</td>', 'A great pic of an ''ordinary'' bird - really good idea, well captured, and I like budgies. 8', '2005-06-14 18:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455398, 188320, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice focus.  like the smoothness of the lake.  would have liked to see a wider composition, as this with the tough, minimal lighting just isn''t that exciting to me-4</td>', 'nice focus.  like the smoothness of the lake.  would have liked to see a wider composition, as this with the tough, minimal lighting just isn''t that exciting to me-4', '2005-06-14 18:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455410, 188668, 34459, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot but the water dripping from the swan''s beak is distracting - shame as it spoils an otherwise perfect picture.</td>', 'beautiful shot but the water dripping from the swan''s beak is distracting - shame as it spoils an otherwise perfect picture.', '2005-06-14 18:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
