(1455415, 188247, 13688, '<td valign="top">cool capture.  wish the colors were a bit more saturated.  looks like the camera had some trouble with fringing on the tail feathers.  i wish the there was closer proportion between sky above and below..  so i guess i would have liked to see a tighter crop.-6</td>', 'cool capture.  wish the colors were a bit more saturated.  looks like the camera had some trouble with fringing on the tail feathers.  i wish the there was closer proportion between sky above and below..  so i guess i would have liked to see a tighter crop.-6', '2005-06-14 18:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1455423, 189052, 34459, '<td valign="top">great shot, simple, effective, well done.</td>', 'great shot, simple, effective, well done.', '2005-06-14 18:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
