(1455435, 188680, 13688, '<td valign="top">the wingspan of the main gull really compliments the rock formation.  if he could have angled himself even more...that would have been art.  i would have cloned out the other one.  colors are a bit muted...seagulls face is a blown out, but it still works for me due to the shapes, and interesting background textures-6</td>', 'the wingspan of the main gull really compliments the rock formation.  if he could have angled himself even more...that would have been art.  i would have cloned out the other one.  colors are a bit muted...seagulls face is a blown out, but it still works for me due to the shapes, and interesting background textures-6', '2005-06-14 18:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
