(1455977, 188573, 6179, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a hummingbird. It would have been cool if you could have had a slightly faster shutter speed to create a little less blur of the flapping wings.</td>', 'Nice capture of a hummingbird. It would have been cool if you could have had a slightly faster shutter speed to create a little less blur of the flapping wings.', '2005-06-14 23:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
