(1456500, 188908, 13688, '<td valign="top">i''m a big fan of odd animals...like emu''s and llamas.  this guys got an interesting hairdo.  a sharper focus on the eye would have helped</td>', 'i''m a big fan of odd animals...like emu''s and llamas.  this guys got an interesting hairdo.  a sharper focus on the eye would have helped', '2005-06-15 02:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1456505, 188574, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice and crisp, good lighting.  i would have liked to see more of the structure as I believe it would have complimented the dove, better than the open sky as far as composition.</td>', 'nice and crisp, good lighting.  i would have liked to see more of the structure as I believe it would have complimented the dove, better than the open sky as far as composition.', '2005-06-15 02:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1456511, 188717, 13688, '<td valign="top">great focus in tough conditions.  the leaves, though a good idea for a frame, are just too close to the head.</td>', 'great focus in tough conditions.  the leaves, though a good idea for a frame, are just too close to the head.', '2005-06-15 02:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1456527, 188972, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice capture, great lighting.  i wish the flamingo with his back turned wasn''t there as it seems to be adding just a bit too much clutter.</td>', 'nice capture, great lighting.  i wish the flamingo with his back turned wasn''t there as it seems to be adding just a bit too much clutter.', '2005-06-15 02:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1456539, 187321, 13688, '<td valign="top">great technique.  I might have cropped down to just the faces to keep the background uniform.  But perhaps that rock area under the baby''s head would have made that look weird. -6</td>', 'great technique.  I might have cropped down to just the faces to keep the background uniform.  But perhaps that rock area under the baby''s head would have made that look weird. -6', '2005-06-15 02:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1456541, 187039, 17279, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!  The only thing that I don''t like is the position of the wings (down), but not much you could do about that with such a hard subject to shoot.</td>', 'Beautiful shot!  The only thing that I don''t like is the position of the wings (down), but not much you could do about that with such a hard subject to shoot.', '2005-06-15 02:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1456548, 188798, 17279, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird... perhaps cropping in tighter on the head/chest would have made this more effective.</td>', 'Beautiful bird... perhaps cropping in tighter on the head/chest would have made this more effective.', '2005-06-15 02:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1456551, 188471, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but it doesn''t do much for me.  Also the cage bars in the background are somewhat distracting.</td>', 'Nice shot, but it doesn''t do much for me.  Also the cage bars in the background are somewhat distracting.', '2005-06-15 02:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
