(1456627, 188227, 13688, '<td valign="top">great capture.  lighting looks a bit unnatural as if from a flash.  i really like how the eyes came out.  i wish the background wasn''t so similiar in color to the subjects</td>', 'great capture.  lighting looks a bit unnatural as if from a flash.  i really like how the eyes came out.  i wish the background wasn''t so similiar in color to the subjects', '2005-06-15 02:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1456641, 188194, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like the blue toning. i like the little motion in the leg.  i wish the shot wasn''t so tight, as the textures of the land and water are very interesting and hard to enjoy with the bird taking up so much of the frame-5</td>', 'i like the blue toning. i like the little motion in the leg.  i wish the shot wasn''t so tight, as the textures of the land and water are very interesting and hard to enjoy with the bird taking up so much of the frame-5', '2005-06-15 02:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1456657, 188372, 13688, '<td valign="top">very interesting.  unfortunately, made me think of staged performance instead of wilderness action.  Maybe because the eagle looks so beautiful against a rather drab scenery.  like the way the fish appears to still be fighting.  wish a longer lense was used to blur out the background.  wish the colors  and focus were a bit stronger.  overall nice comp and capture.</td>', 'very interesting.  unfortunately, made me think of staged performance instead of wilderness action.  Maybe because the eagle looks so beautiful against a rather drab scenery.  like the way the fish appears to still be fighting.  wish a longer lense was used to blur out the background.  wish the colors  and focus were a bit stronger.  overall nice comp and capture.', '2005-06-15 02:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1456664, 187224, 13688, '<td valign="top">excellent focus.  like how the bird looks pissed off.  missing the top of the fence bother''s me.</td>', 'excellent focus.  like how the bird looks pissed off.  missing the top of the fence bother''s me.', '2005-06-15 02:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1456672, 189038, 13688, '<td valign="top">your background lends itself to some very interesting patterns.  i wish you would have blurred it out a bit more. nice focus on the bird.  the orange in the background is a bit distracting...maybe desat the orange out.</td>', 'your background lends itself to some very interesting patterns.  i wish you would have blurred it out a bit more. nice focus on the bird.  the orange in the background is a bit distracting...maybe desat the orange out.', '2005-06-15 02:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1456681, 187893, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice expression.  the 1 sided border seems a bit odd, but very avant-garde.  the lighting and focus could be a bit tighter.  good idea, but i would have waited a bit longer and worked for a stronger composition.-4</td>', 'nice expression.  the 1 sided border seems a bit odd, but very avant-garde.  the lighting and focus could be a bit tighter.  good idea, but i would have waited a bit longer and worked for a stronger composition.-4', '2005-06-15 03:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1456691, 188526, 13688, '<td valign="top">strong comp.  nice focus.  the eye and bill look a bit over-processed...maybe just the camera''s fault.   his buddy''s eye is uncomfortably close to the border.  Actually without the middle grey duck, this would be superb.  overall still a cool looking shot-6</td>', 'strong comp.  nice focus.  the eye and bill look a bit over-processed...maybe just the camera''s fault.   his buddy''s eye is uncomfortably close to the border.  Actually without the middle grey duck, this would be superb.  overall still a cool looking shot-6', '2005-06-15 03:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1456699, 187565, 13688, '<td valign="top">i''m guessing this has the qualities to ribbon.  great, humorous capture and the eyes are stunning.  i never realized owls had such long legs...maybe it''s just the entertainers.  the only thing that bothers me is the base.  it feels incomplete.  not sure what you could have done about that.</td>', 'i''m guessing this has the qualities to ribbon.  great, humorous capture and the eyes are stunning.  i never realized owls had such long legs...maybe it''s just the entertainers.  the only thing that bothers me is the base.  it feels incomplete.  not sure what you could have done about that.', '2005-06-15 03:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1456709, 187262, 13688, '<td valign="top">good capture. the middle gooses head seems a bit out of focus from moving.  would have been nice if you could have posed him with his head up...he didn''t get the cool catchlight in his eye the other 2 have.-5</td>', 'good capture. the middle gooses head seems a bit out of focus from moving.  would have been nice if you could have posed him with his head up...he didn''t get the cool catchlight in his eye the other 2 have.-5', '2005-06-15 03:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
