(1457675, 189053, 19672, '<td valign="top">okay...this one just did not appeal to me...if you captured it with the wings out stretched....or if you cropped the bottom off (the dark part beneath the roof is too distracting.  It''s hard but I gave this a 2.  And thought I''d share why.<br/> <br/>The birds silhouette is just too small to be a major factor in this thus making the roof seem more dominant.  But I also understand that it is darn hard to get these birds to listen to us and do what we want.<br/> <br/>;-)</td>', 'okay...this one just did not appeal to me...if you captured it with the wings out stretched....or if you cropped the bottom off (the dark part beneath the roof is too distracting.  It''s hard but I gave this a 2.  And thought I''d share why. The birds silhouette is just too small to be a major factor in this thus making the roof seem more dominant.  But I also understand that it is darn hard to get these birds to listen to us and do what we want. ;-)', '2005-06-15 12:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
