(1459182, 188750, 13688, '<td valign="top">the planter isn''t that interesting, i wish you would have cropped in closer on the bird</td>', 'the planter isn''t that interesting, i wish you would have cropped in closer on the bird', '2005-06-15 21:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459190, 186973, 37334, '<td valign="top">I don''t normally like geese/ducks/swans in images, but I really like this one! I love the subdued tones; the water droplets on the head; the colours on the water. The composition is quite dynamic too going from corner to corner - a little dodging around the eye to bring it out would have made it stronger, perhaps? 8</td>', 'I don''t normally like geese/ducks/swans in images, but I really like this one! I love the subdued tones; the water droplets on the head; the colours on the water. The composition is quite dynamic too going from corner to corner - a little dodging around the eye to bring it out would have made it stronger, perhaps? 8', '2005-06-15 21:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459195, 189074, 37334, '<td valign="top">I like the ggraphic quality of this image. With the bird sitting up above too it reminds me of Hitchcock''s ''the birds'' :)</td>', 'I like the ggraphic quality of this image. With the bird sitting up above too it reminds me of Hitchcock''s ''the birds'' :)', '2005-06-15 22:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
