(1459206, 188436, 37334, '<td valign="top">I really like this image.I think it would have been more dramatic to crop it so that the bottom righthand triangle with the ducks was balanced with a top left hand triangle of equal-ish size?</td>', 'I really like this image.I think it would have been more dramatic to crop it so that the bottom righthand triangle with the ducks was balanced with a top left hand triangle of equal-ish size?', '2005-06-15 22:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
