(1459473, 188698, 10261, '<td valign="top">Although the green nicely complements the colors of the duck, the way that the foliage occludes the subject more than negates the benefit. Perhaps a slightly different angle and a wider crop would have accomplished a similar result without the green blurs in the foreground.</td>', 'Although the green nicely complements the colors of the duck, the way that the foliage occludes the subject more than negates the benefit. Perhaps a slightly different angle and a wider crop would have accomplished a similar result without the green blurs in the foreground.', '2005-06-16 00:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459478, 189046, 10261, '<td valign="top">The cropped body of the bird in the bottom right leads my eyes out of the image. The image would have been improved by more diffused lighting.</td>', 'The cropped body of the bird in the bottom right leads my eyes out of the image. The image would have been improved by more diffused lighting.', '2005-06-16 00:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459480, 187172, 10261, '<td valign="top">Great capture. The blurry foliage in the foreground is distracting, but I imagine that there wasn''t a lot of time to recompose this shot.</td>', 'Great capture. The blurry foliage in the foreground is distracting, but I imagine that there wasn''t a lot of time to recompose this shot.', '2005-06-16 00:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459483, 188721, 11078, '<td valign="top">A top pick from me Great work<br/>Love the highlights in this image 10</td>', 'A top pick from me Great workLove the highlights in this image 10', '2005-06-16 00:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459484, 188823, 10261, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the soft focus on the bird; I would have preferred to see the bird sharply in focus, to contrast with the fuzzy clouds. The bird''s proximity to the edge of the frame leads my eyes out of the picture in the bird''s direction of movement.</td>', 'I don''t care for the soft focus on the bird; I would have preferred to see the bird sharply in focus, to contrast with the fuzzy clouds. The bird''s proximity to the edge of the frame leads my eyes out of the picture in the bird''s direction of movement.', '2005-06-16 00:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459486, 188555, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awww. . . . . this is an amazing photo!    This is the very last one for me to vote on.   It''s like a treat -- like saving one of the very best for last!    What incredible composition   I just love this!!!</td>', 'Awww. . . . . this is an amazing photo!    This is the very last one for me to vote on.   It''s like a treat -- like saving one of the very best for last!    What incredible composition   I just love this!!!', '2005-06-16 00:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459487, 186595, 10261, '<td valign="top">I''d like this much better if the details on the gulls weren''t blown out. A bird landing / taking off would add a welcome point of interest to a peaceful but uneventful image.</td>', 'I''d like this much better if the details on the gulls weren''t blown out. A bird landing / taking off would add a welcome point of interest to a peaceful but uneventful image.', '2005-06-16 00:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459495, 188367, 10261, '<td valign="top">This looks very oversharpened, but I love the expression. Something about the dumb but happy look on the ostrich''s face and his placement in the frame makes it feel like a goofy kid just bobbed unexpectedly into the frame. The oversharpening is the only identifiable thing preventing me from rating this higher.<br/></td>', 'This looks very oversharpened, but I love the expression. Something about the dumb but happy look on the ostrich''s face and his placement in the frame makes it feel like a goofy kid just bobbed unexpectedly into the frame. The oversharpening is the only identifiable thing preventing me from rating this higher.', '2005-06-16 00:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459497, 188282, 10261, '<td valign="top">underexposed, focus rather soft</td>', 'underexposed, focus rather soft', '2005-06-16 00:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459500, 188811, 11078, '<td valign="top">Top Pick! <br/> <br/>Brilliant image, great work!</td>', 'Top Pick!  Brilliant image, great work!', '2005-06-16 00:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459502, 188837, 10261, '<td valign="top">The strong shadow that shrouds the front of the hawk detracts from an otherwise solid image. A more diffused light source or a reflector to bounce some light back onto the bird would have helped push this up a point or two.<br/></td>', 'The strong shadow that shrouds the front of the hawk detracts from an otherwise solid image. A more diffused light source or a reflector to bounce some light back onto the bird would have helped push this up a point or two.', '2005-06-16 00:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459503, 189003, 10261, '<td valign="top">The focus is rather soft, and the image too small to see clearly.</td>', 'The focus is rather soft, and the image too small to see clearly.', '2005-06-16 00:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459507, 189062, 10261, '<td valign="top">The focus is rather soft, and the subject seems slightly underexposed</td>', 'The focus is rather soft, and the subject seems slightly underexposed', '2005-06-16 00:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459511, 188789, 10261, '<td valign="top">The uneven, harsh light really hurts an otherwise well composed shot. The same photograph taken closer to dawn / dusk would have yielded a really great image.</td>', 'The uneven, harsh light really hurts an otherwise well composed shot. The same photograph taken closer to dawn / dusk would have yielded a really great image.', '2005-06-16 00:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459513, 189049, 10261, '<td valign="top">The bar at the top makes this image feel claustrophobic; even the bird seems to be hunched over a bit.</td>', 'The bar at the top makes this image feel claustrophobic; even the bird seems to be hunched over a bit.', '2005-06-16 00:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459518, 187610, 23680, '<td valign="top">I like that you chose to tint this but I think it''s just too bright orange.  Nice shot though</td>', 'I like that you chose to tint this but I think it''s just too bright orange.  Nice shot though', '2005-06-16 00:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459523, 188930, 10261, '<td valign="top">This is a good picture, but sadly it''s rather cliché; this is at least the 3rd image of a flamingo with a nearly identical pose that I''ve rated so far in this challenge. There seems to be an unusual amount of noise in this image, particularly noticeable on his beak. Perhaps shooting at a lower ISO speed would help.</td>', 'This is a good picture, but sadly it''s rather cliché; this is at least the 3rd image of a flamingo with a nearly identical pose that I''ve rated so far in this challenge. There seems to be an unusual amount of noise in this image, particularly noticeable on his beak. Perhaps shooting at a lower ISO speed would help.', '2005-06-16 00:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459527, 187596, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and textures, but I find the macro crop off-putting. The bird''s eye, which should be the focal point of the image, seems partially shadowed and in rather soft focus. A catchlight would have really helped his eye to stand out.<br/></td>', 'I like the colors and textures, but I find the macro crop off-putting. The bird''s eye, which should be the focal point of the image, seems partially shadowed and in rather soft focus. A catchlight would have really helped his eye to stand out.', '2005-06-16 00:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459529, 187741, 10261, '<td valign="top">I went to high school with a guy who looked a lot like this. On a technical note, the DOF is a little shallow for my tastes; I''d prefer to see his eyes in sharp focus as well.<br/></td>', 'I went to high school with a guy who looked a lot like this. On a technical note, the DOF is a little shallow for my tastes; I''d prefer to see his eyes in sharp focus as well.', '2005-06-16 00:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459534, 189038, 23680, '<td valign="top">Now that''s what I call a bad hair day :0  Good capture</td>', 'Now that''s what I call a bad hair day :0  Good capture', '2005-06-16 00:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459535, 187912, 10261, '<td valign="top">This would be a stronger image if there was some strong feature visible besides feathers (a beak, a well-defined eye, etc.).</td>', 'This would be a stronger image if there was some strong feature visible besides feathers (a beak, a well-defined eye, etc.).', '2005-06-16 00:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459537, 187846, 23680, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Great light!  I like the placement in the frame and how the tree in the background almost mimics the shape of the bird.</td>', 'Very nice.  Great light!  I like the placement in the frame and how the tree in the background almost mimics the shape of the bird.', '2005-06-16 00:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459539, 188575, 10261, '<td valign="top">The focus on the bird''s eye and beak seems rather soft. An angle which accentuated rather than minimized his face would have made the photo more interesting.</td>', 'The focus on the bird''s eye and beak seems rather soft. An angle which accentuated rather than minimized his face would have made the photo more interesting.', '2005-06-16 00:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
