(1459555, 189023, 10261, '<td valign="top">A deeper DOF would have helped this image, as would a slightly sharper focus. The USM artifacts and the obvious halo around the sign are distracting.<br/></td>', 'A deeper DOF would have helped this image, as would a slightly sharper focus. The USM artifacts and the obvious halo around the sign are distracting.', '2005-06-16 00:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
