(1459560, 187879, 10261, '<td valign="top">I love the pose (which the title nicely emphasizes), but a sharper focus / higher shutter speed would have helped make this image really stand out. I find the aggressive crop at the bottom a bit distracting. A little more negative space to the left would have been nice.</td>', 'I love the pose (which the title nicely emphasizes), but a sharper focus / higher shutter speed would have helped make this image really stand out. I find the aggressive crop at the bottom a bit distracting. A little more negative space to the left would have been nice.', '2005-06-16 00:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
