(1459721, 188975, 29904, '<td valign="top">This is really nice, good catch.  The only thing that would make it technically better- change your horizon.  Looking at the bird bill and it''s reflection, the horizon is tilted.  Also it should not be directly half-way from the top/bottom, but a little off.  Hope that helps, othewise lovely! 8</td>', 'This is really nice, good catch.  The only thing that would make it technically better- change your horizon.  Looking at the bird bill and it''s reflection, the horizon is tilted.  Also it should not be directly half-way from the top/bottom, but a little off.  Hope that helps, othewise lovely! 8', '2005-06-16 02:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
