(1460517, 187155, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is just so witty and so nicely done. I love the solidity of the pigeon against the blurred motorcyclist. Shame about the blowout on the motorist''s jacket but not a big problem. Nice diagonals in the road markings. 8</td>', 'This is just so witty and so nicely done. I love the solidity of the pigeon against the blurred motorcyclist. Shame about the blowout on the motorist''s jacket but not a big problem. Nice diagonals in the road markings. 8', '2005-06-16 13:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460520, 186408, 3087, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful composition really using the pose so effectively. Like the pattern of light through the wing feathers. Would prefer more light and therefore more detail on the face and eyes. Lovely clean background too. 8</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful composition really using the pose so effectively. Like the pattern of light through the wing feathers. Would prefer more light and therefore more detail on the face and eyes. Lovely clean background too. 8', '2005-06-16 13:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460521, 187874, 32321, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and placement of the bird. Picture seams grainy or out of focus</td>', 'Nice framing and placement of the bird. Picture seams grainy or out of focus', '2005-06-16 13:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460524, 188889, 38950, '<td valign="top">A completely black background is a negative in my opinion.</td>', 'A completely black background is a negative in my opinion.', '2005-06-16 13:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460532, 187653, 32321, '<td valign="top">Liked the pose. Found the focus off. Not enough detail in front Gold finch</td>', 'Liked the pose. Found the focus off. Not enough detail in front Gold finch', '2005-06-16 13:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460533, 189021, 32848, '<td valign="top">It''s a pity about the burnt out area, but I realise how little time you probably had to take this.  Good shot.</td>', 'It''s a pity about the burnt out area, but I realise how little time you probably had to take this.  Good shot.', '2005-06-16 13:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460536, 188756, 3087, '<td valign="top">Perfect capture of a great pose and with great detail too. Shame about the blowout resulting in loss of detail on the bird''s body but still a great image. Nice blurred background too and like the gradiation of dark to light there. 8</td>', 'Perfect capture of a great pose and with great detail too. Shame about the blowout resulting in loss of detail on the bird''s body but still a great image. Nice blurred background too and like the gradiation of dark to light there. 8', '2005-06-16 13:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460538, 188794, 32321, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and pose. Bird focus appears off</td>', 'Nice framing and pose. Bird focus appears off', '2005-06-16 13:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460541, 188532, 32848, '<td valign="top">I like the way the tail is out of focus, but there is also quite a bit of the head out of focus too.  Nice shot otherwise.</td>', 'I like the way the tail is out of focus, but there is also quite a bit of the head out of focus too.  Nice shot otherwise.', '2005-06-16 13:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460544, 188254, 32321, '<td valign="top">Not the most flattering pose for a morning dove. Found the focus a little off. Would have liked to have seen more detail in the feathers</td>', 'Not the most flattering pose for a morning dove. Found the focus a little off. Would have liked to have seen more detail in the feathers', '2005-06-16 13:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460547, 188668, 32848, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture, especially the backlighting on the ducklings.  I''m not sure if the  falling water adds to the picture or not, but it''s certainly captured well.</td>', 'Lovely capture, especially the backlighting on the ducklings.  I''m not sure if the  falling water adds to the picture or not, but it''s certainly captured well.', '2005-06-16 13:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460548, 188918, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice separation of bird from background and wonderful blurred green. Love the composition and the colours and the detail. A touch dark on the bird for me but only a touch. Very nice indeed. 8</td>', 'Nice separation of bird from background and wonderful blurred green. Love the composition and the colours and the detail. A touch dark on the bird for me but only a touch. Very nice indeed. 8', '2005-06-16 13:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460550, 188114, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in the feathers and eye. Nice lighting too. Not overly keen on composition or background or lost tail feathers. 7</td>', 'Nice detail in the feathers and eye. Nice lighting too. Not overly keen on composition or background or lost tail feathers. 7', '2005-06-16 13:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460555, 187899, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is very cool. A lovely and unusual treatment which conveys much more than a standard colour, low contrast image would. I really like it. 9</td>', 'This is very cool. A lovely and unusual treatment which conveys much more than a standard colour, low contrast image would. I really like it. 9', '2005-06-16 13:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460556, 187043, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed right down to (presumably waiting and waiting for and then catching) the perfect pose, superb lighting and detail and absolutely perfect background blurred to perfect extent by your DOF choice. 9</td>', 'Beautifully composed right down to (presumably waiting and waiting for and then catching) the perfect pose, superb lighting and detail and absolutely perfect background blurred to perfect extent by your DOF choice. 9', '2005-06-16 13:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460557, 188811, 3087, '<td valign="top">Just wonderful sharpness and detail and colour too. Absolutely wonderful. Unfortunately, with such a tight crop, the loss of the top of his head has more of an impact than it might otherwise and weakens the composition considerably. Still one of my top 3 in this challenge though! 9</td>', 'Just wonderful sharpness and detail and colour too. Absolutely wonderful. Unfortunately, with such a tight crop, the loss of the top of his head has more of an impact than it might otherwise and weakens the composition considerably. Still one of my top 3 in this challenge though! 9', '2005-06-16 13:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460560, 188356, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love crowned cranes and this photo is lovely. Lighting is great especially on the eye and the colours it gives. Nice feathet detail and I like how you have filled the whole frame. 8</td>', 'I love crowned cranes and this photo is lovely. Lighting is great especially on the eye and the colours it gives. Nice feathet detail and I like how you have filled the whole frame. 8', '2005-06-16 13:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460565, 187550, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the unusual viewpoint and the way the birds are part of a slightly surreal tableau. Can''t say the distortion works for me, I think this would be even better without it. Black and white suits it very well. 7</td>', 'Love the unusual viewpoint and the way the birds are part of a slightly surreal tableau. Can''t say the distortion works for me, I think this would be even better without it. Black and white suits it very well. 7', '2005-06-16 13:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460566, 188793, 3087, '<td valign="top">An unusual subject matter and an unusual viewpoint of a sad but everyday occurence across Britain. Seems a bit tilted and the bright sky tends to pull my eye up and out but, I do like the viewpoint. 7</td>', 'An unusual subject matter and an unusual viewpoint of a sad but everyday occurence across Britain. Seems a bit tilted and the bright sky tends to pull my eye up and out but, I do like the viewpoint. 7', '2005-06-16 13:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460567, 188937, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice light in the eye, nice detail, nice composition with great use of empty space. Like the background too with that curtain of green along the top. 7</td>', 'Nice light in the eye, nice detail, nice composition with great use of empty space. Like the background too with that curtain of green along the top. 7', '2005-06-16 13:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460568, 189037, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a fascinating creature! Nice background, good use of shallower DOF to blur it. Nice detail on bird and nicely lit. Unusual pose adds interest. 7</td>', 'What a fascinating creature! Nice background, good use of shallower DOF to blur it. Nice detail on bird and nicely lit. Unusual pose adds interest. 7', '2005-06-16 13:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460569, 188527, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great composition and black background is perfect for this bird. Nice colour and quality of light and nice catchlight in the eye too. Exposure has lead to blow out in the white areas where I''d most like to see detail. 7</td>', 'Great composition and black background is perfect for this bird. Nice colour and quality of light and nice catchlight in the eye too. Exposure has lead to blow out in the white areas where I''d most like to see detail. 7', '2005-06-16 13:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460570, 188369, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great photo on the behavioural front with wonderful lighting right down to the catchlights. Quality of the image seems a bit poor and the cropping a bit tight on the tail feathers but... a nice shot. 7</td>', 'Great photo on the behavioural front with wonderful lighting right down to the catchlights. Quality of the image seems a bit poor and the cropping a bit tight on the tail feathers but... a nice shot. 7', '2005-06-16 13:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460571, 188016, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great colours and composition too. Nice light in the eye. There are some blobs on the tree, seem like blowout areas yet they aren''t white, which is confusing. Must just be light bits of the tree. Seems a bit noisy but otherwise very nice. 7</td>', 'Great colours and composition too. Nice light in the eye. There are some blobs on the tree, seem like blowout areas yet they aren''t white, which is confusing. Must just be light bits of the tree. Seems a bit noisy but otherwise very nice. 7', '2005-06-16 13:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460572, 188308, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and black and white really allows one to focus on the wonderful shapes and tones of those large wing feathers. Unusual composition too. 7</td>', 'Nice capture and black and white really allows one to focus on the wonderful shapes and tones of those large wing feathers. Unusual composition too. 7', '2005-06-16 13:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460573, 188882, 32848, '<td valign="top">I like the tail, but the head is not sharp enough.  Nice angle though.</td>', 'I like the tail, but the head is not sharp enough.  Nice angle though.', '2005-06-16 13:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460580, 189052, 3087, '<td valign="top">Unusual head-on perspective which is interesting but leads to lack of eye contact and clarity on the face. Nice framing and dof on the background. 7</td>', 'Unusual head-on perspective which is interesting but leads to lack of eye contact and clarity on the face. Nice framing and dof on the background. 7', '2005-06-16 13:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460581, 189069, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely image and unusual too. Black and white strengthens it a lot. Horizon seems to really cut the picture in two though I like both the cloud detail and sand with bird reflections, I think I''d prefer to see more of the latter... 7</td>', 'Lovely image and unusual too. Black and white strengthens it a lot. Horizon seems to really cut the picture in two though I like both the cloud detail and sand with bird reflections, I think I''d prefer to see more of the latter... 7', '2005-06-16 13:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460584, 189074, 32321, '<td valign="top">Liked the framing and pose of the bird. Found the background distracting</td>', 'Liked the framing and pose of the bird. Found the background distracting', '2005-06-16 13:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460585, 188245, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail on the feathers with a nice exposure and no blowout. I like the eye detail, vivid colours of pink and greens. Composition is week with what feels like abitrary crop on main bird with messiness added by bits of other birds. 7</td>', 'Lovely detail on the feathers with a nice exposure and no blowout. I like the eye detail, vivid colours of pink and greens. Composition is week with what feels like abitrary crop on main bird with messiness added by bits of other birds. 7', '2005-06-16 13:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460588, 187172, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture, I love the sharpness on the eye whilst also capturing that incredible motion in the wings. Composition a bit weak but still a strong pic. 7</td>', 'Beautiful capture, I love the sharpness on the eye whilst also capturing that incredible motion in the wings. Composition a bit weak but still a strong pic. 7', '2005-06-16 13:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460589, 189038, 35804, '<td valign="top">The blues are so pretty..the texture of the feathers is so nice... nicely done.</td>', 'The blues are so pretty..the texture of the feathers is so nice... nicely done.', '2005-06-16 13:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460590, 188825, 3087, '<td valign="top">Fun capture that creates a really strong composition within the frame. Love teh way that the focal point is the colourful object and yet I am still drawn to the birds. Would love a touch more detail in the shadows but can appreciate the image well without. 7</td>', 'Fun capture that creates a really strong composition within the frame. Love teh way that the focal point is the colourful object and yet I am still drawn to the birds. Would love a touch more detail in the shadows but can appreciate the image well without. 7', '2005-06-16 13:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460593, 187641, 3087, '<td valign="top">What an unusual bird and your composition really highlights that incredible crown. Nice detail, nice contrast between colours of bird and background, nice composition too. 8</td>', 'What an unusual bird and your composition really highlights that incredible crown. Nice detail, nice contrast between colours of bird and background, nice composition too. 8', '2005-06-16 13:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460596, 189054, 32321, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! I would have liked to have seen a deeper field of view with more wing feather detail</td>', 'Nice shot! I would have liked to have seen a deeper field of view with more wing feather detail', '2005-06-16 13:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460598, 188930, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, lighting and detail on the feathers, beak and in the eye. Background provides perfect contrast with subject and yet doesn''t interfere with beak which is shown against the pink of the bird. 8</td>', 'Beautiful composition, lighting and detail on the feathers, beak and in the eye. Background provides perfect contrast with subject and yet doesn''t interfere with beak which is shown against the pink of the bird. 8', '2005-06-16 13:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460600, 189080, 35804, '<td valign="top">Wonderful title! This is one of my favorite images in the challenge...the title adds that really nice touch of humor...and I don''t think I have ever seen a flamingo photographed in this way before...excellent entry!</td>', 'Wonderful title! This is one of my favorite images in the challenge...the title adds that really nice touch of humor...and I don''t think I have ever seen a flamingo photographed in this way before...excellent entry!', '2005-06-16 13:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460603, 188980, 35804, '<td valign="top">...so soft...so quiet...completely precious...</td>', '...so soft...so quiet...completely precious...', '2005-06-16 13:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460605, 188837, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely light and shade patterns which are echoed by patterns of colouring. Nice light in the eye. Interesting tight crop, feels a touch too tight at top and left. 7</td>', 'Lovely light and shade patterns which are echoed by patterns of colouring. Nice light in the eye. Interesting tight crop, feels a touch too tight at top and left. 7', '2005-06-16 13:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460607, 188911, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love the framing of this, it feels so well composed and adds such interest for me. Nice lighting on the dove and the way it''s tail points to the left top corner as it looks into the frame works well. 8</td>', 'I love the framing of this, it feels so well composed and adds such interest for me. Nice lighting on the dove and the way it''s tail points to the left top corner as it looks into the frame works well. 8', '2005-06-16 13:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460609, 189068, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely colour and good use of DOF to blur background. Interesting composition and interesting bird too. 7</td>', 'Lovely colour and good use of DOF to blur background. Interesting composition and interesting bird too. 7', '2005-06-16 13:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460612, 188446, 35804, '<td valign="top">So funny! I''ll have to try this with my trio...but I better put some leather gauntlets on first! Great take on the challenge...a real fun image.</td>', 'So funny! I''ll have to try this with my trio...but I better put some leather gauntlets on first! Great take on the challenge...a real fun image.', '2005-06-16 13:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460613, 188915, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice composition using trunk and branch. Clean background. Nice lighting on the heron. 7</td>', 'Nice composition using trunk and branch. Clean background. Nice lighting on the heron. 7', '2005-06-16 13:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460615, 188737, 32848, '<td valign="top">Great detail in the feathers, lovely focus, but not the nicest pose I''ve seen for a falcon.  Great picture though.</td>', 'Great detail in the feathers, lovely focus, but not the nicest pose I''ve seen for a falcon.  Great picture though.', '2005-06-16 13:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460616, 187399, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting and unusual image with an intriguing angle. I love the shallow DOF. Not sure about the selective desaturation but I don''t dislike it. 8</td>', 'Interesting and unusual image with an intriguing angle. I love the shallow DOF. Not sure about the selective desaturation but I don''t dislike it. 8', '2005-06-16 13:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460618, 188920, 32848, '<td valign="top">Not sharp enough and a little dull, imo.</td>', 'Not sharp enough and a little dull, imo.', '2005-06-16 13:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460619, 189052, 35804, '<td valign="top">..."you wanna piece a me?!" ...Perfect title!  Excellent clarity and DOF...just a really fun image that make me smile too! Excellent!</td>', '..."you wanna piece a me?!" ...Perfect title!  Excellent clarity and DOF...just a really fun image that make me smile too! Excellent!', '2005-06-16 13:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460620, 187682, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and colours and patterns. Not sure I like the somewhat chaotic composition, in particular the inclusion of hte bird and reflection to the left. Were that part of the frame pure black, with just the bird at the right and the ripples in the water, I think it would be even stronger. 7</td>', 'Nice detail and colours and patterns. Not sure I like the somewhat chaotic composition, in particular the inclusion of hte bird and reflection to the left. Were that part of the frame pure black, with just the bird at the right and the ripples in the water, I think it would be even stronger. 7', '2005-06-16 13:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460621, 186564, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely light, nice angle. Composition ok, not bad just not striking either. Brown toning is interesting... 8</td>', 'Lovely light, nice angle. Composition ok, not bad just not striking either. Brown toning is interesting... 8', '2005-06-16 13:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460622, 188914, 39389, '<td valign="top">that is stunning</td>', 'that is stunning', '2005-06-16 13:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460623, 188371, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in the feathers, great colours and wonderful catchlight. Foreground and background both rather busy for my preferences though I appreciate this may be the natural habitat. 7</td>', 'Nice detail in the feathers, great colours and wonderful catchlight. Foreground and background both rather busy for my preferences though I appreciate this may be the natural habitat. 7', '2005-06-16 13:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460625, 188086, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture in what I assume is red later afternoon light? Great use of stem in the composition. 7</td>', 'Lovely capture in what I assume is red later afternoon light? Great use of stem in the composition. 7', '2005-06-16 13:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460626, 189026, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely clarity, nice simple composition, lovely shallow DOF on both the rope and to blur out background, which is lovely too and contrasts well with the bird. Nice light in his eye too. Very nice. 8</td>', 'Lovely clarity, nice simple composition, lovely shallow DOF on both the rope and to blur out background, which is lovely too and contrasts well with the bird. Nice light in his eye too. Very nice. 8', '2005-06-16 13:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460627, 188737, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great close up and wonderful detail. I think what seems weirdest for me though is the way his eyes seem almost to be missing in their blackness. A catchlight would help this image very much indeed. 7</td>', 'Great close up and wonderful detail. I think what seems weirdest for me though is the way his eyes seem almost to be missing in their blackness. A catchlight would help this image very much indeed. 7', '2005-06-16 13:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460628, 186994, 3087, '<td valign="top">Close crop = dynamic and intense. Shadowy around the left but nice eye detail. Don''t think it needs selective desat myself, but that''s personal taste. 7</td>', 'Close crop = dynamic and intense. Shadowy around the left but nice eye detail. Don''t think it needs selective desat myself, but that''s personal taste. 7', '2005-06-16 13:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460629, 188668, 32321, '<td valign="top">I think this is an excellent shot. I like the lighting and detail. Only draw back is the water catured in the swans beak. I find it very unatural and distracting.</td>', 'I think this is an excellent shot. I like the lighting and detail. Only draw back is the water catured in the swans beak. I find it very unatural and distracting.', '2005-06-16 13:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460630, 188441, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail and wonderful natural framing with nice blurring of background. Wonderful light in his eye and nice feather detail. Strong composition. 8</td>', 'Beautiful detail and wonderful natural framing with nice blurring of background. Wonderful light in his eye and nice feather detail. Strong composition. 8', '2005-06-16 13:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460632, 188882, 3087, '<td valign="top">Clever use of shallow DOF - I like how the bird is his own background. Light nice and even and lovely catchlight and detail in that eye. Nice composition too. 7</td>', 'Clever use of shallow DOF - I like how the bird is his own background. Light nice and even and lovely catchlight and detail in that eye. Nice composition too. 7', '2005-06-16 13:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460635, 188793, 32792, '<td valign="top">Qaulity speaking, this is a good photo! Nice use of a shallow depth of field, colors are good, not a centered subject! but IMO, it''s a sad photo!<br/>It would probably gimme a diff sensation, if the title was different, and without the cars on the shot! Not voting you down though!</td>', 'Qaulity speaking, this is a good photo! Nice use of a shallow depth of field, colors are good, not a centered subject! but IMO, it''s a sad photo!It would probably gimme a diff sensation, if the title was different, and without the cars on the shot! Not voting you down though!', '2005-06-16 13:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460637, 188575, 32792, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. There''s a bit of a green color cast to the image (on the bird''s neck).</td>', 'Interesting shot. There''s a bit of a green color cast to the image (on the bird''s neck).', '2005-06-16 13:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460646, 187488, 32321, '<td valign="top">Very dark with fuzzy lines. May have worked better with major part of nest cropped out.</td>', 'Very dark with fuzzy lines. May have worked better with major part of nest cropped out.', '2005-06-16 13:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460652, 188659, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lack of detail on brighter white areas but nice detail elsewhere and nice reflection too. Like the darkness of the water and background. Crop is a touch too tight at top for me and could do with more space infront of swan too. Nice though. 7</td>', 'Lack of detail on brighter white areas but nice detail elsewhere and nice reflection too. Like the darkness of the water and background. Crop is a touch too tight at top for me and could do with more space infront of swan too. Nice though. 7', '2005-06-16 13:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460655, 187899, 32321, '<td valign="top">Found picture too dark and too noisy to appreciate the motion</td>', 'Found picture too dark and too noisy to appreciate the motion', '2005-06-16 13:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460656, 188681, 3087, '<td valign="top">Really like the translucency of the feathers and the angle and inclusion of the sun. Composition isn''t strong for me but overall, I like the image. 7</td>', 'Really like the translucency of the feathers and the angle and inclusion of the sun. Composition isn''t strong for me but overall, I like the image. 7', '2005-06-16 13:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460661, 188772, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, though a bit tight to the bottom right. A touch dark though that works ok in this one. 7</td>', 'Nicely composed, though a bit tight to the bottom right. A touch dark though that works ok in this one. 7', '2005-06-16 13:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460662, 188315, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed - well chosen to opt for square frame. Unfortunately there''s a little too much detail o things such as the roots/ twigs and grass which reduces focus on the duck and ducklings. Nice though.</td>', 'Nicely composed - well chosen to opt for square frame. Unfortunately there''s a little too much detail o things such as the roots/ twigs and grass which reduces focus on the duck and ducklings. Nice though.', '2005-06-16 13:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460663, 189076, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like the motion blurring here, nice feel, but not so keen on centred composition.</td>', 'Like the motion blurring here, nice feel, but not so keen on centred composition.', '2005-06-16 13:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460666, 188812, 32321, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Too much white space and not enough bird detail for me</td>', 'Nice shot. Too much white space and not enough bird detail for me', '2005-06-16 13:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460667, 189023, 3087, '<td valign="top">A great picture with lots of interest and somewhat unusual too but... processing is hurting it a lot for me. Huge halo right around sign and pole and each bird in the sky. Lots of banding in the skyt oo. Improving your post processing skills would give biggest boost to your results based on this image. 6</td>', 'A great picture with lots of interest and somewhat unusual too but... processing is hurting it a lot for me. Huge halo right around sign and pole and each bird in the sky. Lots of banding in the skyt oo. Improving your post processing skills would give biggest boost to your results based on this image. 6', '2005-06-16 13:44:50.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1460668, 188099, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and toning. I''m left wondering what they are both looking at, outside the frame. Blow out in whites and seems quite noisy. 6</td>', 'Interesting composition and toning. I''m left wondering what they are both looking at, outside the frame. Blow out in whites and seems quite noisy. 6', '2005-06-16 13:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460669, 187139, 32321, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, too bad the focus is off</td>', 'Nice framing, too bad the focus is off', '2005-06-16 13:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460671, 188668, 7531, '<td valign="top">Cute, just a tad more luminance and it would be there = 8</td>', 'Cute, just a tad more luminance and it would be there = 8', '2005-06-16 13:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460673, 188668, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting though the red is a touch too red for me, even though it''s likely realistic rendition of late evening light. A little more detail in face of parent swan would help too. 6</td>', 'Lovely lighting though the red is a touch too red for me, even though it''s likely realistic rendition of late evening light. A little more detail in face of parent swan would help too. 6', '2005-06-16 13:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460674, 187039, 7531, '<td valign="top">Nice capture</td>', 'Nice capture', '2005-06-16 13:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460675, 188650, 32321, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the Gull. Found the background distracting. Not enough detail.</td>', 'Nice capture of the Gull. Found the background distracting. Not enough detail.', '2005-06-16 13:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460677, 188915, 7531, '<td valign="top">This is well posed by the Heron, it is a heron isn''t it?</td>', 'This is well posed by the Heron, it is a heron isn''t it?', '2005-06-16 13:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460681, 189022, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Contrast seems a touch high, presumably because of time of day = harsh light.</td>', 'Nice composition. Contrast seems a touch high, presumably because of time of day = harsh light.', '2005-06-16 13:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460682, 188886, 7531, '<td valign="top">Good capture, although a little out of focus, which is understandable, 7</td>', 'Good capture, although a little out of focus, which is understandable, 7', '2005-06-16 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460683, 187137, 32792, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing shot. I would have removed that metal bar, as it is an advanced editing challenge! The green color of the birds give an awesome contrast against the blue sky!</td>', 'This is an amazing shot. I would have removed that metal bar, as it is an advanced editing challenge! The green color of the birds give an awesome contrast against the blue sky!', '2005-06-16 13:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460685, 186654, 3087, '<td valign="top">Ha haa! Very funny. Exposure a little off and too contrasty but great composition and content. 7 but would have been more with better exposure etc.</td>', 'Ha haa! Very funny. Exposure a little off and too contrasty but great composition and content. 7 but would have been more with better exposure etc.', '2005-06-16 13:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460686, 189051, 7531, '<td valign="top">Ok assuming this is chicken, or the remnants of a pidgeon pie</td>', 'Ok assuming this is chicken, or the remnants of a pidgeon pie', '2005-06-16 13:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460688, 188252, 7531, '<td valign="top">Very cute, nice capture</td>', 'Very cute, nice capture', '2005-06-16 13:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460689, 188752, 3087, '<td valign="top">A sweet study, nice reflections. Shame the light is more on swan''s side than face. 6</td>', 'A sweet study, nice reflections. Shame the light is more on swan''s side than face. 6', '2005-06-16 13:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460693, 188682, 7531, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, but nothing that grabs the viewer. Sparrows are boring period.</td>', 'A nice shot, but nothing that grabs the viewer. Sparrows are boring period.', '2005-06-16 13:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460695, 187043, 32792, '<td valign="top">Great great shot! The bird is incredibly sharp, and the blur on the background is just as pleasing, nothing disturbing the shot! Also that yellow spot on the bird''s neck, is very beautiful!</td>', 'Great great shot! The bird is incredibly sharp, and the blur on the background is just as pleasing, nothing disturbing the shot! Also that yellow spot on the bird''s neck, is very beautiful!', '2005-06-16 13:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460697, 188886, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely shape to the bird and nice detail in the wings. Whilst I like the second bird being in frame the overall composition isn''t that strong for me. Also a touch noisy. Still like it though. 7</td>', 'Lovely shape to the bird and nice detail in the wings. Whilst I like the second bird being in frame the overall composition isn''t that strong for me. Also a touch noisy. Still like it though. 7', '2005-06-16 13:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460698, 188776, 7531, '<td valign="top">Cute pic, although some pixelation in the background hurts it</td>', 'Cute pic, although some pixelation in the background hurts it', '2005-06-16 13:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460701, 186937, 7531, '<td valign="top">I guess sparrows have taken over the world, at least for this week anyway.</td>', 'I guess sparrows have taken over the world, at least for this week anyway.', '2005-06-16 13:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460703, 188838, 3087, '<td valign="top">Rotating to correct horizon tilt would make a massive difference. Otherwise nice. 6</td>', 'Rotating to correct horizon tilt would make a massive difference. Otherwise nice. 6', '2005-06-16 13:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460704, 188022, 7531, '<td valign="top">Soft focus, u seem to have focused on the grass in front. Try to focus on the subject, hold the shutter button halfway down and recompose the shot</td>', 'Soft focus, u seem to have focused on the grass in front. Try to focus on the subject, hold the shutter button halfway down and recompose the shot', '2005-06-16 13:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460710, 188460, 7531, '<td valign="top">Incredibly comical, looks like it''s just about to tell a one liner.</td>', 'Incredibly comical, looks like it''s just about to tell a one liner.', '2005-06-16 13:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460711, 187610, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the silhouette and composition but intensely dislike the red colours. I don''t know if it''s infrared or just toning or what but... doesn''t work for me. 6</td>', 'Love the silhouette and composition but intensely dislike the red colours. I don''t know if it''s infrared or just toning or what but... doesn''t work for me. 6', '2005-06-16 13:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460722, 186959, 3087, '<td valign="top">I know everyone says you need to leave space for living things to move INTO in the frame but... this looks unbalanced to me and cropped too closely at the right hand side. Nice detail in the neck but too dark around the eye for my preference.</td>', 'I know everyone says you need to leave space for living things to move INTO in the frame but... this looks unbalanced to me and cropped too closely at the right hand side. Nice detail in the neck but too dark around the eye for my preference.', '2005-06-16 13:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460752, 186749, 10432, '<td valign="top">The bird is beautiful - sharp focus.  Lighting might be a little harsh.  However, the treatment for the person holding the bird - including the green hand just doesn''t work or appeal to me.</td>', 'The bird is beautiful - sharp focus.  Lighting might be a little harsh.  However, the treatment for the person holding the bird - including the green hand just doesn''t work or appeal to me.', '2005-06-16 14:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460763, 187550, 16488, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully rendered B&amp;W!  What an interesting image with the pigeons looking on!<br/>Don''t understand your title perfectly...but that really doesn''t detract.<br/>Good luck with this quirky street scene.</td>', 'Wonderfully rendered B&W!  What an interesting image with the pigeons looking on!Don''t understand your title perfectly...but that really doesn''t detract.Good luck with this quirky street scene.', '2005-06-16 14:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460764, 189067, 16488, '<td valign="top">Sweet little ducklings!<br/>I like the ripples in the water, but the compotition seems off.</td>', 'Sweet little ducklings!I like the ripples in the water, but the compotition seems off.', '2005-06-16 14:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460765, 188308, 37851, '<td valign="top">How did you get him in such a perfect position?  I love it!</td>', 'How did you get him in such a perfect position?  I love it!', '2005-06-16 14:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460770, 189039, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting moment.<br/>Like the coloration.<br/>It''s an interesting capture with the wings just so, but it doesn''t really "say" much, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Interesting moment.Like the coloration.It''s an interesting capture with the wings just so, but it doesn''t really "say" much, I''m afraid.', '2005-06-16 14:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460772, 188727, 37851, '<td valign="top">The blurry bird taking off is very distracting.</td>', 'The blurry bird taking off is very distracting.', '2005-06-16 14:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460774, 187400, 16488, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail in the feathers.<br/>Odd bit of yellow on the beak suggests you pumped the saturation a bit too much in post-process.</td>', 'Beautiful detail in the feathers.Odd bit of yellow on the beak suggests you pumped the saturation a bit too much in post-process.', '2005-06-16 14:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460776, 188981, 37851, '<td valign="top">I really dont care for the colors.  The water hurts my eyes.  An adorable duck family though.<br/></td>', 'I really dont care for the colors.  The water hurts my eyes.  An adorable duck family though.', '2005-06-16 14:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460779, 188644, 37851, '<td valign="top">Is that a screen in the background?  It is very distracting.</td>', 'Is that a screen in the background?  It is very distracting.', '2005-06-16 14:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460780, 187680, 16488, '<td valign="top">Wonderful wing action!  The red seems a bit off--did you up the saturation on this?<br/>Hard to capture these quick birds other than on a perch, I applaud the effort.<br/>Grass, however, is one of the dreariest background imaginable for most subjects.</td>', 'Wonderful wing action!  The red seems a bit off--did you up the saturation on this?Hard to capture these quick birds other than on a perch, I applaud the effort.Grass, however, is one of the dreariest background imaginable for most subjects.', '2005-06-16 14:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460784, 187610, 37851, '<td valign="top">I dont like the colors.  It looks like a forest fire.</td>', 'I dont like the colors.  It looks like a forest fire.', '2005-06-16 14:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460786, 186660, 16488, '<td valign="top">Love the title.  Sharp focus where it needs to be, controlled dof.<br/>Makes a decent portrait of an emu.  (Was this the challenge for emus, or what?)<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Love the title.  Sharp focus where it needs to be, controlled dof.Makes a decent portrait of an emu.  (Was this the challenge for emus, or what?)Good luck.', '2005-06-16 14:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460788, 188715, 37851, '<td valign="top">Your bird seems much easier to pose then mine was!  Good thinking!</td>', 'Your bird seems much easier to pose then mine was!  Good thinking!', '2005-06-16 14:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460790, 189074, 37851, '<td valign="top">background to distracting.</td>', 'background to distracting.', '2005-06-16 14:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460793, 187488, 37851, '<td valign="top">blurry.</td>', 'blurry.', '2005-06-16 14:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460794, 188740, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle and juxtaposition of the two geese.<br/>Wish the Canada Goose still had the tip of its beak.<br/>Exposure is a bit blown out...could be effectively used to carry a graphic quality but, in that case, I think you need to tone down the background colors.</td>', 'Interesting angle and juxtaposition of the two geese.Wish the Canada Goose still had the tip of its beak.Exposure is a bit blown out...could be effectively used to carry a graphic quality but, in that case, I think you need to tone down the background colors.', '2005-06-16 14:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460796, 186868, 37851, '<td valign="top">The bright spot is rather glaring.</td>', 'The bright spot is rather glaring.', '2005-06-16 14:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460798, 188446, 37851, '<td valign="top">So cute!</td>', 'So cute!', '2005-06-16 14:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460801, 189052, 37851, '<td valign="top">Looks like he was about to peck your lense.</td>', 'Looks like he was about to peck your lense.', '2005-06-16 14:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460803, 187217, 6667, '<td valign="top">Came back to bump this up a notch. BOL</td>', 'Came back to bump this up a notch. BOL', '2005-06-16 14:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460804, 187879, 37851, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh!  He looks like he is shooing a crowd away.</td>', 'Made me laugh!  He looks like he is shooing a crowd away.', '2005-06-16 14:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460805, 187172, 37851, '<td valign="top">I love how clear the bird is, while you still captured the motion of the wings.</td>', 'I love how clear the bird is, while you still captured the motion of the wings.', '2005-06-16 14:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460809, 188460, 37851, '<td valign="top">cute fuzzball.  A really great shot.</td>', 'cute fuzzball.  A really great shot.', '2005-06-16 14:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460810, 188268, 16488, '<td valign="top">Oh!  I like this one!  Just a fun image with the bird''s expression.  Focus is a bit off--unfortunate.</td>', 'Oh!  I like this one!  Just a fun image with the bird''s expression.  Focus is a bit off--unfortunate.', '2005-06-16 14:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460813, 187480, 37851, '<td valign="top">Are they looking for the wet bar?  great shot.</td>', 'Are they looking for the wet bar?  great shot.', '2005-06-16 14:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460816, 188887, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I like the graphic quality of the image.  Feels a bit oversharp.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I like the graphic quality of the image.  Feels a bit oversharp.', '2005-06-16 14:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460820, 188756, 16488, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I love the background color!  How smooth is that?!<br/>Perfect capture!  Going up....</td>', 'Wow!  I love the background color!  How smooth is that?!Perfect capture!  Going up....', '2005-06-16 14:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460823, 188282, 37851, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird.  I wish he was a little more clear.</td>', 'Beautiful bird.  I wish he was a little more clear.', '2005-06-16 14:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460838, 188298, 13688, '<td valign="top">good timing.  focus is a bit soft.  your composition could use some work.  there''s alot going on against your subject and on the edges, it''s hard to focus on the bird that''s landing-4</td>', 'good timing.  focus is a bit soft.  your composition could use some work.  there''s alot going on against your subject and on the edges, it''s hard to focus on the bird that''s landing-4', '2005-06-16 14:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460840, 187741, 13688, '<td valign="top">the mouth reminds me of something out of jurassic park.  very cool.  the eyes are very soft...perhaps this was your intention.  it definitely got my attention for a few moments-6</td>', 'the mouth reminds me of something out of jurassic park.  very cool.  the eyes are very soft...perhaps this was your intention.  it definitely got my attention for a few moments-6', '2005-06-16 14:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
