(1461236, 188740, 36981, '<td valign="top">This looks very unnatural to me, but I''m not sure why.  Too heavy onthe sharpening?  I like the concept of the angle, but to me the tree overpowers the geese - perhaps get more of the birds in, or crop down to lessen the impact of the trees?</td>', 'This looks very unnatural to me, but I''m not sure why.  Too heavy onthe sharpening?  I like the concept of the angle, but to me the tree overpowers the geese - perhaps get more of the birds in, or crop down to lessen the impact of the trees?', '2005-06-16 17:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461237, 188682, 36981, '<td valign="top">Sometimes simplicity is best!  This photo works well for me.</td>', 'Sometimes simplicity is best!  This photo works well for me.', '2005-06-16 17:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
