(1461865, 187321, 23680, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''ve never seen a baby flamingo - thanks for showing me!  I like the contrast of the mother''s and baby''s colors and how you chose only to show a little bit of the mother.  I''d like to see how this looks cropped a little more in the left so that only her neck shows but then it would probably be too tight on the baby.</td>', 'Wow, I''ve never seen a baby flamingo - thanks for showing me!  I like the contrast of the mother''s and baby''s colors and how you chose only to show a little bit of the mother.  I''d like to see how this looks cropped a little more in the left so that only her neck shows but then it would probably be too tight on the baby.', '2005-06-16 21:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461866, 189047, 23680, '<td valign="top">Nice bird, great colors.  Wish the tail wasn''t cut off though.  The blue on the bird blends in a little too much with the sky.</td>', 'Nice bird, great colors.  Wish the tail wasn''t cut off though.  The blue on the bird blends in a little too much with the sky.', '2005-06-16 21:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
