(1461870, 187973, 35739, '<td valign="top">Wish the birds were closer.  A little more of the birds and less scenery, especially the way thay are posed.</td>', 'Wish the birds were closer.  A little more of the birds and less scenery, especially the way thay are posed.', '2005-06-16 21:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
