(1462810, 188990, 24983, '<td valign="top">You have prollybeen savaged by the no brains on this image but I think it works extremely well. A domestic bird is supposed to be photograhed in its own enviroment and the lighting and colours are well done , bumping to a 9</td>', 'You have prollybeen savaged by the no brains on this image but I think it works extremely well. A domestic bird is supposed to be photograhed in its own enviroment and the lighting and colours are well done , bumping to a 9', '2005-06-17 06:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462812, 188756, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great colors, great sharpness and bokeh.</td>', 'Great colors, great sharpness and bokeh.', '2005-06-17 06:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462814, 188936, 24983, '<td valign="top">Gave this an 8 as I think that you have successfully conveyed to me the bird and its enviroment as it should be the flash is a little harsh but you have good detail in the plumage .</td>', 'Gave this an 8 as I think that you have successfully conveyed to me the bird and its enviroment as it should be the flash is a little harsh but you have good detail in the plumage .', '2005-06-17 06:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462815, 188811, 22748, '<td valign="top">Outstanding sharpness!! Great color. Very nice.</td>', 'Outstanding sharpness!! Great color. Very nice.', '2005-06-17 06:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462816, 186794, 24983, '<td valign="top">there are so many worthwhile photos in this challenge and for me this is one of them. A simple candid it may be but this is one of the shots to remember and for you to cherish 7</td>', 'there are so many worthwhile photos in this challenge and for me this is one of them. A simple candid it may be but this is one of the shots to remember and for you to cherish 7', '2005-06-17 06:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462817, 187172, 24983, '<td valign="top">really caught my eye it might not be technically perfect but it has got oommph  7</td>', 'really caught my eye it might not be technically perfect but it has got oommph  7', '2005-06-17 06:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462827, 188930, 22970, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful. Tack sharp filled with detail everywhere i look but yet has a smoothing color to it. The DOF could not of been better, almost a perfect DOF if it would not of been for the lower left not being the same color. Not that there is anything wrong with that I am just amazed at how good the DOF is. I could keep going on but you know no I have given this a 10. Good luck.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful. Tack sharp filled with detail everywhere i look but yet has a smoothing color to it. The DOF could not of been better, almost a perfect DOF if it would not of been for the lower left not being the same color. Not that there is anything wrong with that I am just amazed at how good the DOF is. I could keep going on but you know no I have given this a 10. Good luck.', '2005-06-17 06:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462832, 188443, 22970, '<td valign="top">Great photograph. Not much to pick a part. I do feel it''s a little under exposed (or at least that what I see on my monitor) but nothing that would take away from the picture. I do feel that the feet of the birds seem to be a little saturated. A great natural capture with a good clean back drop and DOF. Focus is great through out the photograph and lighting is smooth, not harsh. I don''t know what the orange reflections are in the water but to me it works as a balance to all the green. Great job 9.</td>', 'Great photograph. Not much to pick a part. I do feel it''s a little under exposed (or at least that what I see on my monitor) but nothing that would take away from the picture. I do feel that the feet of the birds seem to be a little saturated. A great natural capture with a good clean back drop and DOF. Focus is great through out the photograph and lighting is smooth, not harsh. I don''t know what the orange reflections are in the water but to me it works as a balance to all the green. Great job 9.', '2005-06-17 07:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462836, 188114, 22970, '<td valign="top">I like your picture because it is nature, are at least looks that way to me. I wish the DOF would of been large having the complete bird sharp as his head. I feel the crop or if not cropped the picture it self should of included the tail of the bird. Lighting good and focus great along with good detail. 7</td>', 'I like your picture because it is nature, are at least looks that way to me. I wish the DOF would of been large having the complete bird sharp as his head. I feel the crop or if not cropped the picture it self should of included the tail of the bird. Lighting good and focus great along with good detail. 7', '2005-06-17 07:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462849, 188843, 22970, '<td valign="top">Around the edges of this beautiful bird looks to flat like an extraction was done. Causing a distraction to me. Great detail within the bird from head down. BTW I can see the photographer in his eye :). Great shot but I''m just a bit distracted the way the subject blends with the background. 8</td>', 'Around the edges of this beautiful bird looks to flat like an extraction was done. Causing a distraction to me. Great detail within the bird from head down. BTW I can see the photographer in his eye :). Great shot but I''m just a bit distracted the way the subject blends with the background. 8', '2005-06-17 07:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462853, 188752, 22459, '<td valign="top">Lovely image the B/W works well with this shot but I feel you would get better composition if you cropped some of the reflection off. Still the same a very pleasant image 7</td>', 'Lovely image the B/W works well with this shot but I feel you would get better composition if you cropped some of the reflection off. Still the same a very pleasant image 7', '2005-06-17 07:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462854, 187973, 39347, '<td valign="top">I like this picture alot. I like the soft backround, the clarity of the foreground and what appears to be  fog on the water at lands edge.. Add in the black swans with their red bills and it adds very nicely. Caught my eye.</td>', 'I like this picture alot. I like the soft backround, the clarity of the foreground and what appears to be  fog on the water at lands edge.. Add in the black swans with their red bills and it adds very nicely. Caught my eye.', '2005-06-17 07:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462855, 188099, 22459, '<td valign="top">Great image, would have been better with a bit more space above the birds and I''m not real sure about that frame I don''t think it gives any enhancement to an already sweet image.</td>', 'Great image, would have been better with a bit more space above the birds and I''m not real sure about that frame I don''t think it gives any enhancement to an already sweet image.', '2005-06-17 07:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462858, 188972, 22459, '<td valign="top">One of the best I have seen so far I would have preferred more space above the birds but still very very nice.</td>', 'One of the best I have seen so far I would have preferred more space above the birds but still very very nice.', '2005-06-17 07:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462872, 187039, 32105, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Composition, detail, color, action - just right!</td>', 'Beautiful! Composition, detail, color, action - just right!', '2005-06-17 07:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462880, 189044, 32105, '<td valign="top">Good action, reflection, detail, color - good shot!</td>', 'Good action, reflection, detail, color - good shot!', '2005-06-17 08:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462976, 187879, 38240, '<td valign="top">rofl</td>', 'rofl', '2005-06-17 09:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462998, 188812, 35739, '<td valign="top">Too much sky and not enough bird.  My thoughts.</td>', 'Too much sky and not enough bird.  My thoughts.', '2005-06-17 09:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462999, 188835, 35739, '<td valign="top">Sure wish this was clearer.</td>', 'Sure wish this was clearer.', '2005-06-17 09:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463087, 188315, 11895, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for this border, it takes too much attention away from the image</td>', 'I don''t care for this border, it takes too much attention away from the image', '2005-06-17 10:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463103, 189052, 39347, '<td valign="top">I like the closeness and the detail of the bird. Very nice, title fits.</td>', 'I like the closeness and the detail of the bird. Very nice, title fits.', '2005-06-17 11:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463106, 188752, 39347, '<td valign="top">I like the white in all the dark, makes it stand out. It also looks like mom may be saying, hey kids look at that. The swans seem very focused. I like it.</td>', 'I like the white in all the dark, makes it stand out. It also looks like mom may be saying, hey kids look at that. The swans seem very focused. I like it.', '2005-06-17 11:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463108, 187565, 39347, '<td valign="top">The eyes have it on this one. Made me smile,cause I have felt like that owl looks. Very focused and the eyes said BAM look at me.</td>', 'The eyes have it on this one. Made me smile,cause I have felt like that owl looks. Very focused and the eyes said BAM look at me.', '2005-06-17 11:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463115, 188308, 39347, '<td valign="top">This picture is just awesome, the detail of the wings and I think the black and white aspect made it all the better. Although color may have been just as stunning. The beads of water on the ducks face are visible. I just love this shot. I may have to get a print of this.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-24 06:23:17.</i></td>', 'This picture is just awesome, the detail of the wings and I think the black and white aspect made it all the better. Although color may have been just as stunning. The beads of water on the ducks face are visible. I just love this shot. I may have to get a print of this.', '2005-06-17 11:24:06.000000', '2005-06-24 07:23:17.000000', 1),
(1463119, 187284, 39347, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, the detail of the wings although a bit blurry on the ends. The gaping mouth of the bird, it fits the title.</td>', 'I like this shot, the detail of the wings although a bit blurry on the ends. The gaping mouth of the bird, it fits the title.', '2005-06-17 11:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463122, 188430, 39347, '<td valign="top">I like how the birds look as if they are looking at something else and yet you have the full attention of just one bird. The clarity is good,maybe a titch bright, but I like it.</td>', 'I like how the birds look as if they are looking at something else and yet you have the full attention of just one bird. The clarity is good,maybe a titch bright, but I like it.', '2005-06-17 11:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463125, 188252, 35739, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.</td>', 'Nice capture.', '2005-06-17 11:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463126, 188811, 15832, '<td valign="top">my second fav in this theme...  Geggað. I always feel sorry for the photos that comes on, next after a picture like this... 10<br/>Gauti?</td>', 'my second fav in this theme...  Geggað. I always feel sorry for the photos that comes on, next after a picture like this... 10Gauti?', '2005-06-17 11:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463127, 188746, 39347, '<td valign="top">I just like the whole color and  clarity. Very very nice picture.</td>', 'I just like the whole color and  clarity. Very very nice picture.', '2005-06-17 11:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463132, 187039, 35739, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.</td>', 'Beautiful capture.', '2005-06-17 11:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463135, 188772, 39347, '<td valign="top">This picture makes me feel a calmness. I like how the bird is the focus,the reeds/long grass are blurred as well as the water in back which leves all the attention and focus on the bird as it should be. Very good pic.</td>', 'This picture makes me feel a calmness. I like how the bird is the focus,the reeds/long grass are blurred as well as the water in back which leves all the attention and focus on the bird as it should be. Very good pic.', '2005-06-17 11:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463138, 188546, 39347, '<td valign="top">I like the detail and the closeness. The title fits.</td>', 'I like the detail and the closeness. The title fits.', '2005-06-17 11:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463140, 188980, 35739, '<td valign="top">Not real sure about the color.  I do like the capture.</td>', 'Not real sure about the color.  I do like the capture.', '2005-06-17 11:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
