(1464978, 188575, 34192, '<td valign="top">how would you like to go through life like that?!  Sorry - I saw this image and had to comment.  Its like Jimmy Durante''s nose on steroids!  My god what an ugly bird.  One of those so ugly its cute in a weird sort of way.  I had to look it up.  Poor bird!  Anyway.  You got my attention.  Unique in all of challenge.  Focus, crop, colors all excellent.  Honestly, the only thing I really find lacking is POV which hurts your composition.  I am taking into consideration that this is NOT a posed studio shot (maybe zoo but they''re still wild animals) and you can''t control the situation.  Lighting is great.  The emotional impact outweighs the pov for me in this case.  9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'how would you like to go through life like that?!  Sorry - I saw this image and had to comment.  Its like Jimmy Durante''s nose on steroids!  My god what an ugly bird.  One of those so ugly its cute in a weird sort of way.  I had to look it up.  Poor bird!  Anyway.  You got my attention.  Unique in all of challenge.  Focus, crop, colors all excellent.  Honestly, the only thing I really find lacking is POV which hurts your composition.  I am taking into consideration that this is NOT a posed studio shot (maybe zoo but they''re still wild animals) and you can''t control the situation.  Lighting is great.  The emotional impact outweighs the pov for me in this case.  9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 07:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464981, 188918, 34192, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool bird.  The composition, pov, focus, crop are dead on in this image.  All your technicals are great.  I would argue that the saturation is a little high but not too much - it may have been the light.  For me though, the image is a little static.  Can''t put my finger on why.  Maybe because the background is so blurred I get no sense of place.  Excellent capture - 8 from me.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Pretty cool bird.  The composition, pov, focus, crop are dead on in this image.  All your technicals are great.  I would argue that the saturation is a little high but not too much - it may have been the light.  For me though, the image is a little static.  Can''t put my finger on why.  Maybe because the background is so blurred I get no sense of place.  Excellent capture - 8 from me.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 07:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464982, 188228, 34192, '<td valign="top">excellent timing!  The space in the right is empty - I would have cropped there to pull the image off center - its kind of wasted space.  This would have given more room to the birds so we could see the detail.  Shadowing/lighting pretty good.  Birds are great to photograph because the make you work!  I would have added a little saturation to the green - it would provide a little more eye catchiness (is that really a word?)  Excellent stop motion. 7 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'excellent timing!  The space in the right is empty - I would have cropped there to pull the image off center - its kind of wasted space.  This would have given more room to the birds so we could see the detail.  Shadowing/lighting pretty good.  Birds are great to photograph because the make you work!  I would have added a little saturation to the green - it would provide a little more eye catchiness (is that really a word?)  Excellent stop motion. 7 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 07:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465011, 188737, 25500, '<td valign="top">Great angles.  There area between the eyes seems overexposed to me.</td>', 'Great angles.  There area between the eyes seems overexposed to me.', '2005-06-18 08:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465017, 186595, 25500, '<td valign="top">I like the intent of showing a few birds dwarfed be a large empty space, but the birds aren''t well defined relative to the grass so I''m not sure of what I''m looking at withot refering to the title.</td>', 'I like the intent of showing a few birds dwarfed be a large empty space, but the birds aren''t well defined relative to the grass so I''m not sure of what I''m looking at withot refering to the title.', '2005-06-18 08:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465018, 189080, 25500, '<td valign="top">Brilliant.  I particularly enjoy the interplay of the ripples on the water.  The bird (flamingo?) seems a tad oversaturated to me, but just a tad.</td>', 'Brilliant.  I particularly enjoy the interplay of the ripples on the water.  The bird (flamingo?) seems a tad oversaturated to me, but just a tad.', '2005-06-18 08:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465019, 187682, 25500, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Great use of reflections.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Great use of reflections.', '2005-06-18 08:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465021, 187148, 25500, '<td valign="top">Your use of dappled light creates a wonderful sense of mood.  Well done.</td>', 'Your use of dappled light creates a wonderful sense of mood.  Well done.', '2005-06-18 08:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465022, 186408, 25500, '<td valign="top">Great use of lines.  The swan''s head and torso seem a bit dark to me, but overall well done.</td>', 'Great use of lines.  The swan''s head and torso seem a bit dark to me, but overall well done.', '2005-06-18 09:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465042, 188798, 38643, '<td valign="top">magnificant!</td>', 'magnificant!', '2005-06-18 09:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465090, 188948, 25500, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  The focus on the first flamingo is right on and the echoing of the primary flamingo with the flamingo behind it gives the photo a nice depth.</td>', 'Nicely done.  The focus on the first flamingo is right on and the echoing of the primary flamingo with the flamingo behind it gives the photo a nice depth.', '2005-06-18 10:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465091, 188975, 25500, '<td valign="top">Great reflection.</td>', 'Great reflection.', '2005-06-18 10:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465202, 187039, 19943, '<td valign="top">that is some great focus on a fast moving target.  Nicely titled, great bokeh, very cool.  I wonder if you could dodge the eyes a little more to increase details?</td>', 'that is some great focus on a fast moving target.  Nicely titled, great bokeh, very cool.  I wonder if you could dodge the eyes a little more to increase details?', '2005-06-18 12:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465204, 189068, 19943, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a odd looking bird.  Fantastic colors, feather details, and focus on the head/eye.  Great job.</td>', 'Wow, what a odd looking bird.  Fantastic colors, feather details, and focus on the head/eye.  Great job.', '2005-06-18 12:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465209, 188823, 19943, '<td valign="top">decent in-flight capture.  However, the focus isn''t sharp enough and you''ve overprocessed in post-editing (too much blue hue).</td>', 'decent in-flight capture.  However, the focus isn''t sharp enough and you''ve overprocessed in post-editing (too much blue hue).', '2005-06-18 12:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465211, 188268, 19943, '<td valign="top">Wish that barbed wire fence wasn''t so distracting.  Looks like it is coming out of the ears.  Not sharp enough on the head, but I can''t tell where your focal point is in the frame (maybe on the bottom wire?).  Nice title.  Good in the field capture.</td>', 'Wish that barbed wire fence wasn''t so distracting.  Looks like it is coming out of the ears.  Not sharp enough on the head, but I can''t tell where your focal point is in the frame (maybe on the bottom wire?).  Nice title.  Good in the field capture.', '2005-06-18 12:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465212, 189080, 19943, '<td valign="top">Humorous.  I really like the reflection in the water and the color of the flamingo.</td>', 'Humorous.  I really like the reflection in the water and the color of the flamingo.', '2005-06-18 12:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465216, 188789, 19943, '<td valign="top">Beautiful setting for this photo.  However, overall it is too dark.  Too bad the peacock wasn''t strutting his stuff so you could have captured his tail.</td>', 'Beautiful setting for this photo.  However, overall it is too dark.  Too bad the peacock wasn''t strutting his stuff so you could have captured his tail.', '2005-06-18 12:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465256, 188752, 20115, '<td valign="top">absolutely gorgeous</td>', 'absolutely gorgeous', '2005-06-18 12:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465288, 188467, 28337, '<td valign="top">bit blurry and there is noise</td>', 'bit blurry and there is noise', '2005-06-18 13:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465291, 186595, 28337, '<td valign="top">too much blank blue sky</td>', 'too much blank blue sky', '2005-06-18 13:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465293, 188240, 28337, '<td valign="top">nice capture.</td>', 'nice capture.', '2005-06-18 13:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465296, 187613, 28337, '<td valign="top">my attention seems to be drawn to the ground below the bird not the bird itself.</td>', 'my attention seems to be drawn to the ground below the bird not the bird itself.', '2005-06-18 13:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465312, 188372, 6104, '<td valign="top">I think this would have benefited from more deapth of field, but nice capture.</td>', 'I think this would have benefited from more deapth of field, but nice capture.', '2005-06-18 13:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465320, 187879, 25742, '<td valign="top">wonderful expression. Makes you wonder what''s beyond the frame on the left. I, actually, would like to see further onto the left and maybe his feet as well, but with a shot like this you don''t get to choose the framing too much I think. Well done /9</td>', 'wonderful expression. Makes you wonder what''s beyond the frame on the left. I, actually, would like to see further onto the left and maybe his feet as well, but with a shot like this you don''t get to choose the framing too much I think. Well done /9', '2005-06-18 13:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465387, 187187, 11895, '<td valign="top">the lighting adds a lot to this image, well done</td>', 'the lighting adds a lot to this image, well done', '2005-06-18 14:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465405, 188918, 11248, '<td valign="top">My favorite in this challenge. Simple and effective. Orange color stand out. Nice bird, nice pose. - 10</td>', 'My favorite in this challenge. Simple and effective. Orange color stand out. Nice bird, nice pose. - 10', '2005-06-18 14:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465407, 187565, 11248, '<td valign="top">Nice and funny. I like it very much. -9</td>', 'Nice and funny. I like it very much. -9', '2005-06-18 14:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465410, 189068, 11248, '<td valign="top">Impressive and really beautiful details. I like the cropping you''ve done. -9<br/></td>', 'Impressive and really beautiful details. I like the cropping you''ve done. -9', '2005-06-18 14:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
