(1465503, 187480, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very funny but above all a very nice capture and title to fit.</td>', 'Very funny but above all a very nice capture and title to fit.', '2005-06-18 15:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465505, 188801, 22734, '<td valign="top">Lovely with such poise.</td>', 'Lovely with such poise.', '2005-06-18 15:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465538, 189051, 15832, '<td valign="top">yummy... Funny "out of the box" idea!!!</td>', 'yummy... Funny "out of the box" idea!!!', '2005-06-18 16:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465542, 188016, 28742, '<td valign="top">That is a mighty strange bird. Is he holding his breath? ;-)<br/>Nice photo. Good composition and color. A touch blurry though.</td>', 'That is a mighty strange bird. Is he holding his breath? ;-)Nice photo. Good composition and color. A touch blurry though.', '2005-06-18 16:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465546, 188446, 28742, '<td valign="top">If you were going to shoot a cat for the bird challenge - maybe a yellow feather or feathers sticking out of the cat''s mouth and title it "Where''s Tweety?" ;-)<br/>Interesting photo - cute and well executed, but have to ding ya for the challenge topic a little. I''m sure you had fun doing it though. :)</td>', 'If you were going to shoot a cat for the bird challenge - maybe a yellow feather or feathers sticking out of the cat''s mouth and title it "Where''s Tweety?" ;-)Interesting photo - cute and well executed, but have to ding ya for the challenge topic a little. I''m sure you had fun doing it though. :)', '2005-06-18 16:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465549, 187217, 28742, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, but the desat does not work for me.</td>', 'Very nice shot, but the desat does not work for me.', '2005-06-18 16:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465554, 189049, 28742, '<td valign="top">Looks like a police mugshot. I would''ve cropped out the shackles and the top bar to give it less of a "captivity" feel - not much you can do about the background though. Colors and focus are good though - overall a good job!</td>', 'Looks like a police mugshot. I would''ve cropped out the shackles and the top bar to give it less of a "captivity" feel - not much you can do about the background though. Colors and focus are good though - overall a good job!', '2005-06-18 16:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465555, 188889, 28742, '<td valign="top">I shall call him Jabba the Finch! Must be supersizing all his happy worm meals. ;-)<br/>Nice shot, good color, lighting, focus and texture.</td>', 'I shall call him Jabba the Finch! Must be supersizing all his happy worm meals. ;-)Nice shot, good color, lighting, focus and texture.', '2005-06-18 16:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465557, 186595, 28742, '<td valign="top">I''ll take your word for it.</td>', 'I''ll take your word for it.', '2005-06-18 16:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465571, 188811, 28742, '<td valign="top">I predict a ribbon for this great shot! You captured the colors and textures fantastically.</td>', 'I predict a ribbon for this great shot! You captured the colors and textures fantastically.', '2005-06-18 16:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465575, 188308, 28742, '<td valign="top">Great shot, great title!</td>', 'Great shot, great title!', '2005-06-18 17:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465577, 187220, 11518, '<td valign="top">My pick for a ribbon!  Very well done!  10</td>', 'My pick for a ribbon!  Very well done!  10', '2005-06-18 17:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465636, 188076, 24486, '<td valign="top">Nicely timed. Good sense of movement</td>', 'Nicely timed. Good sense of movement', '2005-06-18 18:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465702, 189052, 24976, '<td valign="top">nice composition</td>', 'nice composition', '2005-06-18 19:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465708, 189047, 24976, '<td valign="top">uneven exposure makes the background seem like a picture rather than real, i would say that it was indeed  a picturebackdrop  but it would be better if it was much harder to tell.</td>', 'uneven exposure makes the background seem like a picture rather than real, i would say that it was indeed  a picturebackdrop  but it would be better if it was much harder to tell.', '2005-06-18 19:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465712, 187139, 24976, '<td valign="top">has some nice artistic qualities such as the bokeh effect in the background and  the slightly oof bird... i dont like the leaves in the foreground having blown out highlights however.</td>', 'has some nice artistic qualities such as the bokeh effect in the background and  the slightly oof bird... i dont like the leaves in the foreground having blown out highlights however.', '2005-06-18 19:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465715, 189022, 24976, '<td valign="top">excellent composition, the simplicity works really well here.</td>', 'excellent composition, the simplicity works really well here.', '2005-06-18 19:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465721, 187635, 24976, '<td valign="top">You would have done much better without the frame. if you are ever deciding whether to frame or not, always choose not to for challenges and then feel free to frame for anything else.</td>', 'You would have done much better without the frame. if you are ever deciding whether to frame or not, always choose not to for challenges and then feel free to frame for anything else.', '2005-06-18 19:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465723, 188646, 24976, '<td valign="top">beautifully captured. 10</td>', 'beautifully captured. 10', '2005-06-18 19:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465724, 188752, 24976, '<td valign="top">the black and white needs more contrast imo. right now everything seems to be a shade of grey w/ no pure whites and no blacks.</td>', 'the black and white needs more contrast imo. right now everything seems to be a shade of grey w/ no pure whites and no blacks.', '2005-06-18 19:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465728, 189054, 24976, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition. the eye adds a lot to the shot. and the white feathers against the black background is really classy and simple. 10</td>', 'beautiful composition. the eye adds a lot to the shot. and the white feathers against the black background is really classy and simple. 10', '2005-06-18 19:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465731, 188615, 24976, '<td valign="top">perfect shot. love the mood created by the toning. 10</td>', 'perfect shot. love the mood created by the toning. 10', '2005-06-18 19:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465746, 188367, 19982, '<td valign="top">that''s just too funny!  weird compo (but as I said, funny) with nice DOF.</td>', 'that''s just too funny!  weird compo (but as I said, funny) with nice DOF.', '2005-06-18 20:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465750, 188737, 19982, '<td valign="top">awesome!  tack sharp with obvious shallow DOF .. shot to perfection!  only thing I could wish for would be more light in the eyes.</td>', 'awesome!  tack sharp with obvious shallow DOF .. shot to perfection!  only thing I could wish for would be more light in the eyes.', '2005-06-18 20:07:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1465751, 189026, 19982, '<td valign="top">really nice shallow DOF with sharp focus on the eye - nice!</td>', 'really nice shallow DOF with sharp focus on the eye - nice!', '2005-06-18 20:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465752, 189023, 19982, '<td valign="top">Very funny!  Nice shot... feels almost surreal.</td>', 'Very funny!  Nice shot... feels almost surreal.', '2005-06-18 20:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465759, 189052, 34192, '<td valign="top">I love this image.  In this challenge it gets a 10.  Challenge aside, and knowing this is one of those take or it lose it shots where you only have about a second to react, I can only say that next time, try to get him to pose better! ;) A little lighting from under his belly would have added to an already amazing image.  I''m hoping that, while voting, people take into consideration the difficulty in getting this kind of image.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I love this image.  In this challenge it gets a 10.  Challenge aside, and knowing this is one of those take or it lose it shots where you only have about a second to react, I can only say that next time, try to get him to pose better! ;) A little lighting from under his belly would have added to an already amazing image.  I''m hoping that, while voting, people take into consideration the difficulty in getting this kind of image.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 20:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465763, 187565, 34192, '<td valign="top">Love the pose.  Excellent timing.  The eyes look unnaturally saturated, maybe even unreal. Don''t care for the background - seems like its seen through glass.  But, that''s my tastes.  8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Love the pose.  Excellent timing.  The eyes look unnaturally saturated, maybe even unreal. Don''t care for the background - seems like its seen through glass.  But, that''s my tastes.  8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 20:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465766, 188980, 34192, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image but slightly over processed for my tastes.  Back off the blur just a hair and I would like it much better.  Like the tones you  used.  Think the blur makes it overly soft so I can''t judge on focus.  Composition okay.  I think you really have something to work with here but again, I am distracted by the blur.  That is personal taste so take it for what its worth.  7 from me, good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Beautiful image but slightly over processed for my tastes.  Back off the blur just a hair and I would like it much better.  Like the tones you  used.  Think the blur makes it overly soft so I can''t judge on focus.  Composition okay.  I think you really have something to work with here but again, I am distracted by the blur.  That is personal taste so take it for what its worth.  7 from me, good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 20:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465771, 188446, 34192, '<td valign="top">I am giving a 6 if only because you managed to get a cat to wear that rediculous costume!  How cruel!  Or is he pretending like wily e coyote?  Colors work well but technically not a bird.  Lighting a little harsh.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I am giving a 6 if only because you managed to get a cat to wear that rediculous costume!  How cruel!  Or is he pretending like wily e coyote?  Colors work well but technically not a bird.  Lighting a little harsh.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 20:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465773, 187488, 34192, '<td valign="top">Honestly, this image is not in focus, even for a silhouette.  There is potential here, but I think reshooting with a tripod or a higher ISO would greatly improve the image.  Also, size is an issue - if you could recrop some of the bottom out and make it bigger I''m sure it would open up the image.  Right now, with all the black and the funky frame it seems a little claustrophobic to me.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Honestly, this image is not in focus, even for a silhouette.  There is potential here, but I think reshooting with a tripod or a higher ISO would greatly improve the image.  Also, size is an issue - if you could recrop some of the bottom out and make it bigger I''m sure it would open up the image.  Right now, with all the black and the funky frame it seems a little claustrophobic to me.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 20:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465778, 188587, 34192, '<td valign="top">For a spider picture, its pretty cool.  Maybe it has the bird ''tied up'' inside?  The image itself is pretty good, a little static for my taste but the colors, focus, and DOF are right there.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'For a spider picture, its pretty cool.  Maybe it has the bird ''tied up'' inside?  The image itself is pretty good, a little static for my taste but the colors, focus, and DOF are right there.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 20:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465783, 188740, 34192, '<td valign="top">This could be a really interesting and humorous image if not for the over saturation.  It makes the geese look plastic.  The cropping may have included some more of the white goose but I know sometimes you take what you can get with wild animals!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'This could be a really interesting and humorous image if not for the over saturation.  It makes the geese look plastic.  The cropping may have included some more of the white goose but I know sometimes you take what you can get with wild animals!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 20:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465787, 188298, 34192, '<td valign="top">I honestly don''t care too much for this image but I think it is a direct result of the lighting.  Outdoor shots are impossible to control in that respect - all you can do is wait around and see if it gets better.  Sometimes though, you have to make due with what you''ve got.  For an action shot its pretty good - your timing is excellent.  Think maybe a slighter tighter crop would help, maybe eliminating the duck to the far left and the duck butt at the bottom.  That kind of crop would put more emphasis on the splash rather than the empty space in the middle of the image.  A decent attempt at a bird shot, a great stop action shot.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I honestly don''t care too much for this image but I think it is a direct result of the lighting.  Outdoor shots are impossible to control in that respect - all you can do is wait around and see if it gets better.  Sometimes though, you have to make due with what you''ve got.  For an action shot its pretty good - your timing is excellent.  Think maybe a slighter tighter crop would help, maybe eliminating the duck to the far left and the duck butt at the bottom.  That kind of crop would put more emphasis on the splash rather than the empty space in the middle of the image.  A decent attempt at a bird shot, a great stop action shot.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 20:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465791, 188882, 34192, '<td valign="top">I actually photographed one of these today.  He got mad at me - it is a calm before the storm!  I think the composition is great.  The depth of field works well - the viewer can see the eyes of the tail without them being distracting.  My only pick at this image is the lighting - its a little harsh on top of this head, blowing out the detail above his eyes.  The plummage at the top is great as is the neck.  Good capture - 7 from me.  good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I actually photographed one of these today.  He got mad at me - it is a calm before the storm!  I think the composition is great.  The depth of field works well - the viewer can see the eyes of the tail without them being distracting.  My only pick at this image is the lighting - its a little harsh on top of this head, blowing out the detail above his eyes.  The plummage at the top is great as is the neck.  Good capture - 7 from me.  good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 20:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465796, 188250, 34192, '<td valign="top">Good capture.  Focus is a little off but moving birds are not that easy unless you''re working at 1/1000 or better.  Image a little noisy - not sure if its ISO noise or enlarging after a crop. I would have liked the crop a little looser - this crop seems to constrain the bird - I like my birds free - a little space does wonders!  Personal taste - take it as that.  Detail in the feathers quite good considering the soft focus.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Good capture.  Focus is a little off but moving birds are not that easy unless you''re working at 1/1000 or better.  Image a little noisy - not sure if its ISO noise or enlarging after a crop. I would have liked the crop a little looser - this crop seems to constrain the bird - I like my birds free - a little space does wonders!  Personal taste - take it as that.  Detail in the feathers quite good considering the soft focus.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 20:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465805, 188467, 34192, '<td valign="top">Cute cockatiel.  I''m sure, if this is your bird, you have a more interesting background/environment to photograph him in.  One of the great things about nature photography, even captive nature, is to see the animal in an environment.  This image doesn''t give me that and I think that is its greatest flaw.  Put him on a swing or a fake tree he can peak out of - it would do him justice.  I have an african grey - birds are wonderful pets!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Cute cockatiel.  I''m sure, if this is your bird, you have a more interesting background/environment to photograph him in.  One of the great things about nature photography, even captive nature, is to see the animal in an environment.  This image doesn''t give me that and I think that is its greatest flaw.  Put him on a swing or a fake tree he can peak out of - it would do him justice.  I have an african grey - birds are wonderful pets!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 20:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465817, 188644, 34192, '<td valign="top">While this is a neat statue of birds, I think it is outdone in this challenge by real birds.  The backlighting from the window provides a nice glow but it can''t overcome the staticness of this image.  Hoestly, I know nothing is going to happen and nothing has happened so it makes the image kind of, well, boring.  This is good for what it is, its just not my taste as far as images go. Part of scoring a challenge is the technicals.  You did okay with that.  Part of scoring in a challenge is viewer reaction.  You got none from me. I admire your creativeness in using a statue but I can''t give you a great score. All of this should be taken with a grain of salt.  It is strictly my opinion and taste.  4</td>', 'While this is a neat statue of birds, I think it is outdone in this challenge by real birds.  The backlighting from the window provides a nice glow but it can''t overcome the staticness of this image.  Hoestly, I know nothing is going to happen and nothing has happened so it makes the image kind of, well, boring.  This is good for what it is, its just not my taste as far as images go. Part of scoring a challenge is the technicals.  You did okay with that.  Part of scoring in a challenge is viewer reaction.  You got none from me. I admire your creativeness in using a statue but I can''t give you a great score. All of this should be taken with a grain of salt.  It is strictly my opinion and taste.  4', '2005-06-18 21:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465821, 188715, 34192, '<td valign="top">Okay, it is a bird.  Kinda cute little bird too.  And he''s in focus - even the tree is in focus.  I believe the image is a little over saturated - the orange is almost blinding.  There are many amazing real bird image in this challenge.  Held up to them, this image kind of fails.  On its own, its pretty cute.  Looks a little oversharpened.  Creative though - this is the only one in the challenge. Good luck!</td>', 'Okay, it is a bird.  Kinda cute little bird too.  And he''s in focus - even the tree is in focus.  I believe the image is a little over saturated - the orange is almost blinding.  There are many amazing real bird image in this challenge.  Held up to them, this image kind of fails.  On its own, its pretty cute.  Looks a little oversharpened.  Creative though - this is the only one in the challenge. Good luck!', '2005-06-18 21:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465831, 188283, 34192, '<td valign="top">Cool bird.  Like the composition and the crop.  What needs work is the focus.  I know you were probably pretty far away - at least I hope those powerlines are up high!  And I know wild birds are not easy to capture - I''m sure this one wasn''t an exception.  6 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Cool bird.  Like the composition and the crop.  What needs work is the focus.  I know you were probably pretty far away - at least I hope those powerlines are up high!  And I know wild birds are not easy to capture - I''m sure this one wasn''t an exception.  6 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 21:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465833, 186595, 34192, '<td valign="top">Honestly, beautiful landscape.  Too bad those white dots are all over the image.  Seems to me the important part of the image is the view - its incredible.  The birds are there just because they are there.  They don''t add to the image nor make up an important part of the image.  I love this field and would actually like to see this with the birds cloned out.  You missed with the challenge topic - birds as the main subject - at least for me.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Honestly, beautiful landscape.  Too bad those white dots are all over the image.  Seems to me the important part of the image is the view - its incredible.  The birds are there just because they are there.  They don''t add to the image nor make up an important part of the image.  I love this field and would actually like to see this with the birds cloned out.  You missed with the challenge topic - birds as the main subject - at least for me.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 21:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465839, 187893, 34192, '<td valign="top">Wow - he looks mad!  The other ones look mad at him!  The focus on this image is not very good.  I know the birds are moving; maybe bump up your ISO next time so you can get a faster shutterspeed. Not sure aobut the white line at the bottom.  Doesn''t enhance.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Wow - he looks mad!  The other ones look mad at him!  The focus on this image is not very good.  I know the birds are moving; maybe bump up your ISO next time so you can get a faster shutterspeed. Not sure aobut the white line at the bottom.  Doesn''t enhance.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 21:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465856, 186794, 34192, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  The birds don''t seem the subject of the photograph.</td>', 'Very cute.  The birds don''t seem the subject of the photograph.', '2005-06-18 21:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465859, 188919, 34192, '<td valign="top">great capture.  I think this could be improved with a lower point of view and a little better focus.  I know you only have a split second to react, but for next time.  :)  Love the expression on his face.</td>', 'great capture.  I think this could be improved with a lower point of view and a little better focus.  I know you only have a split second to react, but for next time.  :)  Love the expression on his face.', '2005-06-18 21:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465861, 188396, 31173, '<td valign="top">Nice pose!</td>', 'Nice pose!', '2005-06-18 21:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465870, 187139, 34192, '<td valign="top">What kind of bird is that?  Great color.  Unfortunately, the bird is a little too small to make out the details.  Can''t even tell if he''s in focus or not.  If this were my image I would have cut out from the fork to the right.  That would have given me more space for the bird.  Composition and pov are good with what you have now.  Lighting details on the leaves provide a slight distraction.  I know you don''t chose where they land or when they land - makes photographing birds even more difficult.  Guess that''s what makes them fun.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'What kind of bird is that?  Great color.  Unfortunately, the bird is a little too small to make out the details.  Can''t even tell if he''s in focus or not.  If this were my image I would have cut out from the fork to the right.  That would have given me more space for the bird.  Composition and pov are good with what you have now.  Lighting details on the leaves provide a slight distraction.  I know you don''t chose where they land or when they land - makes photographing birds even more difficult.  Guess that''s what makes them fun.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 21:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465874, 189062, 34192, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird.  Only thing holding this image back is that the softness hides some of the detail.  Crop, composition and DOF are excellent. 6 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Beautiful bird.  Only thing holding this image back is that the softness hides some of the detail.  Crop, composition and DOF are excellent. 6 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 21:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465880, 187446, 34192, '<td valign="top">Wow.  A little too close for my taste.  Birds like this (or anything for that matter) with such strong blacks and whites are very difficult to expose properly.  you did a pretty good job keeping much of the detail - I applaud you for that.  7 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Wow.  A little too close for my taste.  Birds like this (or anything for that matter) with such strong blacks and whites are very difficult to expose properly.  you did a pretty good job keeping much of the detail - I applaud you for that.  7 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 21:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465887, 189017, 34192, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  like the stillness of the water.  I don''t care for the POV - would have liked it down lower, closer to the water - goose eye view if you will.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Very cute!  like the stillness of the water.  I don''t care for the POV - would have liked it down lower, closer to the water - goose eye view if you will.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 21:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465891, 189076, 34192, '<td valign="top">I honestly don''t care for the blur effect in this image.  It overpowers the subject.  My taste, so take it for what its worth.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I honestly don''t care for the blur effect in this image.  It overpowers the subject.  My taste, so take it for what its worth.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 21:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465898, 189077, 34192, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... I''m wondering if cropping this off at the water line would improve it for me.  Yep, I would like it better without the distracting building in the back.  It draws my attention away from the ducks and the great reflections on the water.  Other opinions may differ - take mine with a grain of salt.  As it is, this looks like two separate images stuck together.  I think the bottom alone would be inifintely stronger without the top.</td>', 'Hmmm... I''m wondering if cropping this off at the water line would improve it for me.  Yep, I would like it better without the distracting building in the back.  It draws my attention away from the ducks and the great reflections on the water.  Other opinions may differ - take mine with a grain of salt.  As it is, this looks like two separate images stuck together.  I think the bottom alone would be inifintely stronger without the top.', '2005-06-18 21:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465904, 188794, 34192, '<td valign="top">I love those birds - so cute when they flitter around!  I really like the composition of this image.  Think you cropped well.  What''s holding this back from being great is the soft focus.  Not sure if thats the camera or oversaturation.  The DOF and POV work well for me also.  Back to the softness - not sure how to improve on this particular image.  Maybe a tripod and a prayer or a higher ISO.  The prayer is for waiting for a bird to appear within your frame.  One of the draw backs of shooting anything moving in lower light.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I love those birds - so cute when they flitter around!  I really like the composition of this image.  Think you cropped well.  What''s holding this back from being great is the soft focus.  Not sure if thats the camera or oversaturation.  The DOF and POV work well for me also.  Back to the softness - not sure how to improve on this particular image.  Maybe a tripod and a prayer or a higher ISO.  The prayer is for waiting for a bird to appear within your frame.  One of the draw backs of shooting anything moving in lower light.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 21:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465907, 187874, 34192, '<td valign="top">pretty scene.  I think the frame is overwhelming - all that space could have been devoted to making the bird larger so I could see the detail!  Oh well - personal taste.</td>', 'pretty scene.  I think the frame is overwhelming - all that space could have been devoted to making the bird larger so I could see the detail!  Oh well - personal taste.', '2005-06-18 21:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465914, 188525, 34192, '<td valign="top">Adorable baby - not sure what kind would be yellow. Guessing from the size of his beak, maybe a conure?  Image is okay - DOF works to blur out distracting elements.  Wish i could see a little more of the bird.  The feather detail is there.  The yellow cast is a little distracting - not the bird - the image - probably the tungsten lighting.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Adorable baby - not sure what kind would be yellow. Guessing from the size of his beak, maybe a conure?  Image is okay - DOF works to blur out distracting elements.  Wish i could see a little more of the bird.  The feather detail is there.  The yellow cast is a little distracting - not the bird - the image - probably the tungsten lighting.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 21:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465926, 188835, 34192, '<td valign="top">I really wish they would hold still!  Makes them come out in better focus.  Very interesting point of view.  Good crop/composition.  Focus is the main issue here - really tough to do with a moving bird.  If you get another chance, try upping your ISO and test exposing the sky.  Then set the same exposure orthe next faster one in manual mode.   The image will be a little darker but you will have a better chance of getting him in sharper focus.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I really wish they would hold still!  Makes them come out in better focus.  Very interesting point of view.  Good crop/composition.  Focus is the main issue here - really tough to do with a moving bird.  If you get another chance, try upping your ISO and test exposing the sky.  Then set the same exposure orthe next faster one in manual mode.   The image will be a little darker but you will have a better chance of getting him in sharper focus.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 21:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465928, 189051, 34192, '<td valign="top">Very amusing image though after looking at 280 shots of birds, I''m kind of anti chicken eating right now.  You have some stuck in your teeth.  ;)  Selective desat works, comp works, crop works, focus spot on as is POV.  Gotta give you at least a 7 even if the bird is, thankfully, dead.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Very amusing image though after looking at 280 shots of birds, I''m kind of anti chicken eating right now.  You have some stuck in your teeth.  ;)  Selective desat works, comp works, crop works, focus spot on as is POV.  Gotta give you at least a 7 even if the bird is, thankfully, dead.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 21:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465929, 188647, 38267, '<td valign="top">Nice Capture.  I think you framed the shot really well.  It would have maybe been nicer if you could have just focused in on the bird and used an aperature setting to make everything else like the grass and trees out of focus.  The are just a little bit distracting for my taste, but good job none the less.</td>', 'Nice Capture.  I think you framed the shot really well.  It would have maybe been nicer if you could have just focused in on the bird and used an aperature setting to make everything else like the grass and trees out of focus.  The are just a little bit distracting for my taste, but good job none the less.', '2005-06-18 21:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465935, 188976, 34192, '<td valign="top">pretty cool.  Love the clouds and the pov.  Works with a center composition.  A little oversharpened.  Good luck in the challenge! 6</td>', 'pretty cool.  Love the clouds and the pov.  Works with a center composition.  A little oversharpened.  Good luck in the challenge! 6', '2005-06-18 22:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465938, 189039, 34192, '<td valign="top">Love the tones in this image.  Could have maybe cropped a little out of the top, maybe not.  Wish the tails were just a little bit whiter - it owuld provide some balance to all the dark in the image.  Focus very good.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Love the tones in this image.  Could have maybe cropped a little out of the top, maybe not.  Wish the tails were just a little bit whiter - it owuld provide some balance to all the dark in the image.  Focus very good.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 22:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465939, 186408, 34192, '<td valign="top">beautiful bird.  Excellent capture.  Trying to think of what I would have done differently.  Can''t think of anything.  The POV is excellent - I love shots where people get on the level of what they are shooting - makes the image that much more real.  The lighting is good, the timing is good, the crop and composition is good.  8 from me!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'beautiful bird.  Excellent capture.  Trying to think of what I would have done differently.  Can''t think of anything.  The POV is excellent - I love shots where people get on the level of what they are shooting - makes the image that much more real.  The lighting is good, the timing is good, the crop and composition is good.  8 from me!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-06-18 22:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465943, 188322, 34192, '<td valign="top">The expression on his face is priceless.  Makes up a little bit for the lack of contrast in the image - this could use stronger blacks and whiter whites to really grab me.  Composition, crop and POV are pretty good.  Duck a little soft but I can tell he''s moving so it makes sharpness a little more difficult.  6 from me. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'The expression on his face is priceless.  Makes up a little bit for the lack of contrast in the image - this could use stronger blacks and whiter whites to really grab me.  Composition, crop and POV are pretty good.  Duck a little soft but I can tell he''s moving so it makes sharpness a little more difficult.  6 from me. Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 22:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465944, 188436, 34192, '<td valign="top">The blue really accents the ducks.  Like the composition. Wish the POV was a little closer to the ducks eye view rather than a standing person.  That would really give the wow factor to this image for me.  As it is, its good, just not quite there.  6 - Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'The blue really accents the ducks.  Like the composition. Wish the POV was a little closer to the ducks eye view rather than a standing person.  That would really give the wow factor to this image for me.  As it is, its good, just not quite there.  6 - Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 22:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465946, 188823, 34192, '<td valign="top">Excellent sky.  Think the bird was moving a little to fast for this shot - its going out of the frame and out of focus.  We should tie little weights to his legs to slow him down!  If you shot birds (with a camera) again, I would recommend a higher ISO or manually setting the camera a little faster.  This will stop the action a little better.  Problem I know is that 9 times out of 10 these things happen upon us when we aren''t prepared in advance.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Excellent sky.  Think the bird was moving a little to fast for this shot - its going out of the frame and out of focus.  We should tie little weights to his legs to slow him down!  If you shot birds (with a camera) again, I would recommend a higher ISO or manually setting the camera a little faster.  This will stop the action a little better.  Problem I know is that 9 times out of 10 these things happen upon us when we aren''t prepared in advance.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 22:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465948, 189005, 34192, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  Wish it all was in a little sharper focus.  Looks like a flash was used so it was taken when it was darker.  you can use a flash during the day also - give you light in those hard to reach places like inside a birdhouse.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Very cute.  Wish it all was in a little sharper focus.  Looks like a flash was used so it was taken when it was darker.  you can use a flash during the day also - give you light in those hard to reach places like inside a birdhouse.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 22:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465949, 188022, 34192, '<td valign="top">Looks like gaussian blur was used.  Doesn''t really enhance the image for me as it blurs the subject.  They are cute though!</td>', 'Looks like gaussian blur was used.  Doesn''t really enhance the image for me as it blurs the subject.  They are cute though!', '2005-06-18 22:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465950, 188981, 34192, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  Couldn''t imagine having that many kids at once!  This is a little oversaturated for my eyes.  Maybe oversharpened but that just might be the sat playing tricks on me.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Very cute.  Couldn''t imagine having that many kids at once!  This is a little oversaturated for my eyes.  Maybe oversharpened but that just might be the sat playing tricks on me.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 22:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465953, 188672, 34192, '<td valign="top">I haven''t figured out why the Nationals have a bird for a mascot.  But its better than a senator any day.  The shirt is spot on in focus but the birds head is not.  Must have been a really short DOF in a night game?  Like the camera guy at the bottom right. Interesting take on the challenge.  Good luck!</td>', 'I haven''t figured out why the Nationals have a bird for a mascot.  But its better than a senator any day.  The shirt is spot on in focus but the birds head is not.  Must have been a really short DOF in a night game?  Like the camera guy at the bottom right. Interesting take on the challenge.  Good luck!', '2005-06-18 22:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465955, 187924, 34192, '<td valign="top">the bird is so small and the water so big he almost gets lost.  Is that a swallowtail?  Scissortail?  He''s so small all the details are lost.</td>', 'the bird is so small and the water so big he almost gets lost.  Is that a swallowtail?  Scissortail?  He''s so small all the details are lost.', '2005-06-18 22:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465957, 188320, 34192, '<td valign="top">Yep.  Definitely a duck.  Like the lighting/reflection in this image.  The image itself is kind of static -  there is no wow factor. 5 - good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Yep.  Definitely a duck.  Like the lighting/reflection in this image.  The image itself is kind of static -  there is no wow factor. 5 - good luck in the challenge.', '2005-06-18 22:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465959, 187902, 34192, '<td valign="top">Black swans - beautiful birds.  Unfortunately there is so much else in your image I can''t see them very well.  A closer crop would have really make this image work for me.  As it is, all I see are two orange dots and a big gray thing.  With some work, this could be an impressive image.  Good luck int he challenge!</td>', 'Black swans - beautiful birds.  Unfortunately there is so much else in your image I can''t see them very well.  A closer crop would have really make this image work for me.  As it is, all I see are two orange dots and a big gray thing.  With some work, this could be an impressive image.  Good luck int he challenge!', '2005-06-18 22:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465964, 188699, 34192, '<td valign="top">Would love to see more detail in the bird - acchieved with a tighter crop.  As it is, the focus is excellent, the composition works well - colors are great.  DOF could have been a little tighter.  Love the POV - you are at the bird''s level instead of standing over it.  Good capture!  6 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Would love to see more detail in the bird - acchieved with a tighter crop.  As it is, the focus is excellent, the composition works well - colors are great.  DOF could have been a little tighter.  Love the POV - you are at the bird''s level instead of standing over it.  Good capture!  6 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 22:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465965, 188899, 34192, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool capture.  Wish your camera had been slightly faster to catch the stop motion.  I think its slightly over saturated.    They always fly at the wrong time, huh?  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Pretty cool capture.  Wish your camera had been slightly faster to catch the stop motion.  I think its slightly over saturated.    They always fly at the wrong time, huh?  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 22:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465970, 187635, 34192, '<td valign="top">I really hate this border.  For me, the garbledness of it completely takes away from the serenity of the smooth water and deep green tones.  Its jarring.  That, of course, is just my opinion.  The duck is ever so slightly soft to my eyes but I love the colors of the water - think they are a positive in this image (I ordinarily don''t like green water - something icky about it).  I can''t get around this border so I will give you a 5 - border is part of the presentation and this just does not do it for me.  Sorry!</td>', 'I really hate this border.  For me, the garbledness of it completely takes away from the serenity of the smooth water and deep green tones.  Its jarring.  That, of course, is just my opinion.  The duck is ever so slightly soft to my eyes but I love the colors of the water - think they are a positive in this image (I ordinarily don''t like green water - something icky about it).  I can''t get around this border so I will give you a 5 - border is part of the presentation and this just does not do it for me.  Sorry!', '2005-06-18 22:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465975, 188673, 34192, '<td valign="top">I know that feeling!  And she''s actually a very cute duck.  Sharp, in focus, point of view good.  I would have cropped some of the bottom off but that''s my opinion.  All those rocks kind of detract and cropping them out would put more focus on the duckling.  She looks very similar in coloring to them!  6 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I know that feeling!  And she''s actually a very cute duck.  Sharp, in focus, point of view good.  I would have cropped some of the bottom off but that''s my opinion.  All those rocks kind of detract and cropping them out would put more focus on the duckling.  She looks very similar in coloring to them!  6 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 22:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465980, 187953, 34192, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...Interesting.  The blues play well together.  Interesting crop.  They appear huge from the composition.  Looks like street reflections so they must be.  Honestly, for this challenge I can''t score you as highly as I do a clear sharp in focus shot of a live bird.  I vote on a curve and I don''t think it would be fair to someone who captured a much more difficult shot.  A will give you kudos for  uniqueness though.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Hmmm...Interesting.  The blues play well together.  Interesting crop.  They appear huge from the composition.  Looks like street reflections so they must be.  Honestly, for this challenge I can''t score you as highly as I do a clear sharp in focus shot of a live bird.  I vote on a curve and I don''t think it would be fair to someone who captured a much more difficult shot.  A will give you kudos for  uniqueness though.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-18 22:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465982, 188268, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very cute apparition.</td>', 'A very cute apparition.', '2005-06-18 22:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
