(1466474, 189022, 32767, '<td valign="top">This is a very hard bird to shoot as I have more than my own personal experience with those white feathers. Nice job. I like the crop and  the length, keeping the pole was a good choice. I like the light/dark contrast on the bird it has a nice effect.</td>', 'This is a very hard bird to shoot as I have more than my own personal experience with those white feathers. Nice job. I like the crop and  the length, keeping the pole was a good choice. I like the light/dark contrast on the bird it has a nice effect.', '2005-06-19 08:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
