(1466992, 186654, 27605, '<td valign="top">Extremely strong composition, I like it a lot.  Returning to comment, considered bumping from it''s current (8) but have decided to leave it there due to blown highlights on each bird.  Still very, very nice shot.</td>', 'Extremely strong composition, I like it a lot.  Returning to comment, considered bumping from it''s current (8) but have decided to leave it there due to blown highlights on each bird.  Still very, very nice shot.', '2005-06-19 16:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
