(1467006, 186564, 36299, '<td valign="top">I like the tones in this photo.</td>', 'I like the tones in this photo.', '2005-06-19 17:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467049, 188988, 22970, '<td valign="top">What Some wild looking birds. Your picture, as you know, has a fair amount of noise that I have to deal with. I guess from a high ISO or sharping. To me the picture looks flat. What I mean by that there are a lot of white and light colors but little dark other than the few feathers on the bird. The colors could of popped a little more, like on the feet and beaks of the birds. The focus is a little soft, not OOF, but soft enough not to show the fine detail of the birds. The DOF could of been smaller because it make the habitat around the birds not look natural.  A smaller DOF would of blended the background to where it would not of destructed me as much. Not a bad picture but that is what if feel separates this picture from a great picture. 5</td>', 'What Some wild looking birds. Your picture, as you know, has a fair amount of noise that I have to deal with. I guess from a high ISO or sharping. To me the picture looks flat. What I mean by that there are a lot of white and light colors but little dark other than the few feathers on the bird. The colors could of popped a little more, like on the feet and beaks of the birds. The focus is a little soft, not OOF, but soft enough not to show the fine detail of the birds. The DOF could of been smaller because it make the habitat around the birds not look natural.  A smaller DOF would of blended the background to where it would not of destructed me as much. Not a bad picture but that is what if feel separates this picture from a great picture. 5', '2005-06-19 17:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
