(1467479, 189059, 22689, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot ! I like it very much but there''s something strange in the upper right side .<br/>My vote : 8</td>', 'Excellent shot ! I like it very much but there''s something strange in the upper right side .My vote : 8', '2005-06-19 22:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467482, 187224, 34192, '<td valign="top">okay - this is a really ugly bird.  I''m surprised he can eat with that underbite action.  Ostrich baby?  Composition works for me.  POV great, DOF could be a little larger but it doesn''t really hurt the image.  Great capture!  7 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'okay - this is a really ugly bird.  I''m surprised he can eat with that underbite action.  Ostrich baby?  Composition works for me.  POV great, DOF could be a little larger but it doesn''t really hurt the image.  Great capture!  7 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-19 22:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467483, 188911, 6667, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Want to brush him against my cheek.  He looks so soft. BOL 8</td>', 'Wow!  Want to brush him against my cheek.  He looks so soft. BOL 8', '2005-06-19 22:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467487, 188756, 34192, '<td valign="top">last minute bump to 9.  How''d I miss this the first time voting?  Beautiful!  Looks like an angel almost.  Blue background works exceptionally well.  Flash used?  Great action capture - not at all easy!</td>', 'last minute bump to 9.  How''d I miss this the first time voting?  Beautiful!  Looks like an angel almost.  Blue background works exceptionally well.  Flash used?  Great action capture - not at all easy!', '2005-06-19 22:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467493, 189011, 6667, '<td valign="top">Great capture. But IMHO a little over worked,  BOL</td>', 'Great capture. But IMHO a little over worked,  BOL', '2005-06-19 22:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467509, 189052, 21072, '<td valign="top">Great capture of a generally uninteresting bird</td>', 'Great capture of a generally uninteresting bird', '2005-06-19 22:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467524, 186619, 10432, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  I love that the color of the bird and the background are monotone but that the bird does not blend into the background.  Very sharp - great lighting.  10</td>', 'Very nice capture.  I love that the color of the bird and the background are monotone but that the bird does not blend into the background.  Very sharp - great lighting.  10', '2005-06-19 22:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467530, 188918, 10432, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture.  Great DoF, sharp focus, good color and lighting.  10</td>', 'Excellent capture.  Great DoF, sharp focus, good color and lighting.  10', '2005-06-19 22:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467539, 188930, 10432, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This has it all - color, sharp focus, great composition.  I really can''t find anything wrong here.  I''m thinking ribbon.  10</td>', 'Wow.  This has it all - color, sharp focus, great composition.  I really can''t find anything wrong here.  I''m thinking ribbon.  10', '2005-06-19 22:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467542, 187641, 10432, '<td valign="top">Fabulous.  I love the framing - the backlighting really works with the head feathers.  Well done.</td>', 'Fabulous.  I love the framing - the backlighting really works with the head feathers.  Well done.', '2005-06-19 22:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467545, 187550, 10432, '<td valign="top">Nice take on this challenge - out of the ordinary from bird close ups.  Nice tones and lighting.</td>', 'Nice take on this challenge - out of the ordinary from bird close ups.  Nice tones and lighting.', '2005-06-19 22:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467548, 189008, 22689, '<td valign="top">So lovely and colorful ! really a nice shot !</td>', 'So lovely and colorful ! really a nice shot !', '2005-06-19 22:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467551, 188441, 10432, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  Sharp focus.  Lighting looks a bit harsh, overexposed.  BOL</td>', 'Great capture.  Sharp focus.  Lighting looks a bit harsh, overexposed.  BOL', '2005-06-19 22:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467553, 188948, 10432, '<td valign="top">Excellent color, clarity.  Not sure if I like the blurred second flamingo in this vertical position.  It looks a bit chopped off.</td>', 'Excellent color, clarity.  Not sure if I like the blurred second flamingo in this vertical position.  It looks a bit chopped off.', '2005-06-19 22:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467562, 188889, 10432, '<td valign="top">Very nicely shot - good focus, lighting and color.  Nice and simple photo - nothing to distract.  Would be an excellent calendar shot. 10</td>', 'Very nicely shot - good focus, lighting and color.  Nice and simple photo - nothing to distract.  Would be an excellent calendar shot. 10', '2005-06-19 22:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467569, 188737, 10432, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Great, simple background.  The lighting is just a bit harsh - with some areas blown.  But overall a pretty capture.  BOL</td>', 'Very nice. Great, simple background.  The lighting is just a bit harsh - with some areas blown.  But overall a pretty capture.  BOL', '2005-06-19 22:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467570, 188446, 11769, '<td valign="top">Good luck</td>', 'Good luck', '2005-06-19 22:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467574, 189080, 11769, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the title too.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the title too.', '2005-06-19 22:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467577, 188573, 10432, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture.  Looks a tad over processed - maybe too much sharpening?  Some harsh lighting.  But overall a good job.</td>', 'This is a great capture.  Looks a tad over processed - maybe too much sharpening?  Some harsh lighting.  But overall a good job.', '2005-06-19 22:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467584, 187846, 11769, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous capture. Just love everything about this photograph.</td>', 'Gorgeous capture. Just love everything about this photograph.', '2005-06-19 22:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467585, 188990, 10432, '<td valign="top">What a cutie pie.  Photo looks too dark and a bit flat.  Try lightening and bumping up the contrast.  Focus is also somewhat soft.  Good luck!</td>', 'What a cutie pie.  Photo looks too dark and a bit flat.  Try lightening and bumping up the contrast.  Focus is also somewhat soft.  Good luck!', '2005-06-19 22:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467591, 188980, 10432, '<td valign="top">Very dreamy.  Nice capture!</td>', 'Very dreamy.  Nice capture!', '2005-06-19 22:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467595, 187043, 11769, '<td valign="top">Bumping up, perfect.</td>', 'Bumping up, perfect.', '2005-06-19 22:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467623, 187139, 10402, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Poor focus.</td>', 'Interesting composition. Poor focus.', '2005-06-19 23:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467633, 188322, 10402, '<td valign="top">Black and white is effective here, and I like the composition. Couild use a little more contrast I think.</td>', 'Black and white is effective here, and I like the composition. Couild use a little more contrast I think.', '2005-06-19 23:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467636, 188697, 22689, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot but the size is too small.</td>', 'Interesting shot but the size is too small.', '2005-06-19 23:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467643, 188436, 10402, '<td valign="top">I love the negative space here. Very effective composition.</td>', 'I love the negative space here. Very effective composition.', '2005-06-19 23:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467651, 186619, 33947, '<td valign="top">I love the similarity of coloring between background and the bird. Very nice tone. Great detail. I hope you do well.</td>', 'I love the similarity of coloring between background and the bird. Very nice tone. Great detail. I hope you do well.', '2005-06-19 23:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467653, 186564, 10402, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful! The light is a bit harsh, but the backlighting on the wings works very well. Great color choice.</td>', 'This is just beautiful! The light is a bit harsh, but the backlighting on the wings works very well. Great color choice.', '2005-06-19 23:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467654, 189036, 39144, '<td valign="top">Unique pose. I bet it took a while to get the right cooperation.</td>', 'Unique pose. I bet it took a while to get the right cooperation.', '2005-06-19 23:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467655, 189062, 33947, '<td valign="top">I love the softness of the background, but, the foreground is a bit too soft for me. Still, the lighting and highlights are very nice.</td>', 'I love the softness of the background, but, the foreground is a bit too soft for me. Still, the lighting and highlights are very nice.', '2005-06-19 23:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467664, 189038, 10432, '<td valign="top">Interesting looking bird - with nice blue color.  The background is just way too busy.  I''m having a hard time figuring out if the bird''s face has a shadow or if the dark area is the feather coloring.</td>', 'Interesting looking bird - with nice blue color.  The background is just way too busy.  I''m having a hard time figuring out if the bird''s face has a shadow or if the dark area is the feather coloring.', '2005-06-19 23:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467667, 188889, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a beautiful bird. Could use some space on the left.</td>', 'Nice capture of a beautiful bird. Could use some space on the left.', '2005-06-19 23:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467669, 188254, 33947, '<td valign="top">She''s sweet, and the coloring looks spot on. Lighting is a bit flat, though.</td>', 'She''s sweet, and the coloring looks spot on. Lighting is a bit flat, though.', '2005-06-19 23:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467677, 189077, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great Idea.  The comp is different than I''d have done. I think I''d hve left the buildings and shore out.  The duck sillhouettes are enough.</td>', 'Great Idea.  The comp is different than I''d have done. I think I''d hve left the buildings and shore out.  The duck sillhouettes are enough.', '2005-06-19 23:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467679, 187635, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF but its still alittle soft on the focus.</td>', 'Nice DOF but its still alittle soft on the focus.', '2005-06-19 23:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467681, 188791, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the light on the water. Very crisp shot.</td>', 'I like the light on the water. Very crisp shot.', '2005-06-19 23:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467682, 188114, 10402, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture with great focus, but the composition lacks balance. Try cropping off the top half to just above the head.</td>', 'Beautiful capture with great focus, but the composition lacks balance. Try cropping off the top half to just above the head.', '2005-06-19 23:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467684, 188573, 33672, '<td valign="top">Tough shot to take. Great capture and I kind of like the blurry movement. Its what I''d expect from a hummingbird</td>', 'Tough shot to take. Great capture and I kind of like the blurry movement. Its what I''d expect from a hummingbird', '2005-06-19 23:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467685, 188903, 33672, '<td valign="top">This would be such a great shot if it were more in focus.</td>', 'This would be such a great shot if it were more in focus.', '2005-06-19 23:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467688, 188697, 10432, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry - but the details are lost in this small photo.   From what I can tell - it looks a a bit dark.  The background trees are too busy and the bird blends in.</td>', 'I''m sorry - but the details are lost in this small photo.   From what I can tell - it looks a a bit dark.  The background trees are too busy and the bird blends in.', '2005-06-19 23:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467689, 188827, 33672, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot but needs to be clearer.</td>', 'This is a nice shot but needs to be clearer.', '2005-06-19 23:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467690, 188647, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice comp and capture.</td>', 'Nice comp and capture.', '2005-06-19 23:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467693, 186994, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Uneven lighting will keep this from finishing where it deserves.</td>', 'Nice capture. Uneven lighting will keep this from finishing where it deserves.', '2005-06-19 23:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467697, 187610, 10402, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic and a bit surreal. I like it.</td>', 'Very dramatic and a bit surreal. I like it.', '2005-06-19 23:29:17.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1467699, 189069, 10432, '<td valign="top">Excellent!!  Fabulous tones, very sharp.  9</td>', 'Excellent!!  Fabulous tones, very sharp.  9', '2005-06-19 23:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467701, 188811, 10432, '<td valign="top">This is fabulous.  Bumping up!  9</td>', 'This is fabulous.  Bumping up!  9', '2005-06-19 23:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467726, 189056, 10261, '<td valign="top">The focus on the bird is a little soft</td>', 'The focus on the bird is a little soft', '2005-06-19 23:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467741, 188367, 24486, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Looks like he popped his head up just as you were going to  photograph the zebra.</td>', 'Great composition. Looks like he popped his head up just as you were going to  photograph the zebra.', '2005-06-19 23:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467744, 188445, 10261, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see this cropped with more negative space to either side of the rooster; as it is it seems rather cramped.</td>', 'I would have liked to see this cropped with more negative space to either side of the rooster; as it is it seems rather cramped.', '2005-06-19 23:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467753, 188240, 13091, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2005-06-19 23:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467754, 187613, 10261, '<td valign="top">This image is so over processed that it almost looks like the bird was pasted in from another image.</td>', 'This image is so over processed that it almost looks like the bird was pasted in from another image.', '2005-06-19 23:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467758, 188930, 10402, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait. Nice composition, beautiful color, and interesting textures.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait. Nice composition, beautiful color, and interesting textures.', '2005-06-19 23:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467762, 187635, 10261, '<td valign="top">The border is distracting, and the focus on the duck is rather soft</td>', 'The border is distracting, and the focus on the duck is rather soft', '2005-06-19 23:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467765, 189008, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasting head colors</td>', 'I like the contrasting head colors', '2005-06-19 23:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467770, 188252, 10402, '<td valign="top">The birds are nicely captured, but the background is so bright it is distracting.</td>', 'The birds are nicely captured, but the background is so bright it is distracting.', '2005-06-19 23:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467772, 188460, 10261, '<td valign="top">What kind of bird is this? It looks more like a Muppet than any bird I''m familiar with. The DOF is a little shallow, as his beak is the only thing in sharp focus.</td>', 'What kind of bird is this? It looks more like a Muppet than any bird I''m familiar with. The DOF is a little shallow, as his beak is the only thing in sharp focus.', '2005-06-19 23:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467780, 188587, 9581, '<td valign="top">Supposed to be a bird but the colors are ok... I hate spiders so I can not look long....</td>', 'Supposed to be a bird but the colors are ok... I hate spiders so I can not look long....', '2005-06-19 23:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467784, 188106, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and composition. I wish the focus was sharper.</td>', 'Nice lighting and composition. I wish the focus was sharper.', '2005-06-19 23:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467786, 189068, 9581, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.. I like the background..</td>', 'Nice colors.. I like the background..', '2005-06-19 23:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467788, 187217, 10261, '<td valign="top">The selective desaturation here seems to be the ''because I can'' variety rather than something that adds to the image.</td>', 'The selective desaturation here seems to be the ''because I can'' variety rather than something that adds to the image.', '2005-06-19 23:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467789, 187399, 10402, '<td valign="top">The sadness is portrayed well.</td>', 'The sadness is portrayed well.', '2005-06-19 23:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467790, 188976, 9581, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, .. the clouds have some good texture and color.. the plane could be a bit sharper.</td>', 'Nice framing, .. the clouds have some good texture and color.. the plane could be a bit sharper.', '2005-06-19 23:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467793, 189052, 10261, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective here. I think that the DOF is a bit too shallow; the bird''s face seems to have rather soft focus. A bit more light on the bird''s face would have improved the shot as well. Still, this is a solid entry, and one of my highest rated images of the challenge.</td>', 'I love the perspective here. I think that the DOF is a bit too shallow; the bird''s face seems to have rather soft focus. A bit more light on the bird''s face would have improved the shot as well. Still, this is a solid entry, and one of my highest rated images of the challenge.', '2005-06-20 00:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467794, 188446, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great use of color, and very humorous! Not really a bird, but perhaps close enough...</td>', 'Great use of color, and very humorous! Not really a bird, but perhaps close enough...', '2005-06-20 00:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467796, 188649, 22734, '<td valign="top">What a lovely species and such graceful lines. The concentric circles add interest to the pleasant reglections.</td>', 'What a lovely species and such graceful lines. The concentric circles add interest to the pleasant reglections.', '2005-06-20 00:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467799, 188573, 22734, '<td valign="top">These little guys are more efficient than helicopters. A wonderful capture. Bumpimg up.</td>', 'These little guys are more efficient than helicopters. A wonderful capture. Bumpimg up.', '2005-06-20 00:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467800, 188787, 22734, '<td valign="top">Quite a capture and lovely to look at.</td>', 'Quite a capture and lovely to look at.', '2005-06-20 00:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467802, 188016, 22734, '<td valign="top">Another beauty very well captured. Great colors.</td>', 'Another beauty very well captured. Great colors.', '2005-06-20 00:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467803, 189076, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a dreamy composition with charm. Bumping up.</td>', 'This is a dreamy composition with charm. Bumping up.', '2005-06-20 00:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467804, 189060, 22734, '<td valign="top">A cutie and softer lighting would have played well your way. Personally, I like the expression and the perch position. Bumping up.</td>', 'A cutie and softer lighting would have played well your way. Personally, I like the expression and the perch position. Bumping up.', '2005-06-20 00:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467807, 187321, 22734, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a capture. This is ideal for a bookcover and great conversational study.</td>', 'Wow! What a capture. This is ideal for a bookcover and great conversational study.', '2005-06-20 00:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467809, 188937, 22734, '<td valign="top">These guys are pretty and very efficient. Bumping up to 7.</td>', 'These guys are pretty and very efficient. Bumping up to 7.', '2005-06-20 00:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467818, 188227, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very well captured. The detail and colors are great.</td>', 'Very well captured. The detail and colors are great.', '2005-06-20 00:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
