(1467872, 189068, 22734, '<td valign="top">Looks like his wearing a mask. Amazing detail with great background to support the lovely colors. This guy is so neat returning for a bump. 8</td>', 'Looks like his wearing a mask. Amazing detail with great background to support the lovely colors. This guy is so neat returning for a bump. 8', '2005-06-20 00:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
