(1468444, 188715, 34590, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tasha4paws:</b></div><hr/><i> Very apt title.<br/>superb image,this could be the one!I <br/>I  particularly like the moldy leaf, and the sore  red feet are a nice touch.<br/>the feathers look a little thin, giving that appealing abandoned look.<br/> and the wings suggesting movement really are great, <br/>Composition is excellent, the rule of thirds, allthough ignored alltogether gives this central subject a certain fullness, allmost stuffed feeling,<br/>how did u get so close without scaring him.<br/> <br/>(:-} </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>ahah, thats great</td>', 'Originally posted by tasha4paws: Very apt title.superb image,this could be the one!I I  particularly like the moldy leaf, and the sore  red feet are a nice touch.the feathers look a little thin, giving that appealing abandoned look. and the wings suggesting movement really are great, Composition is excellent, the rule of thirds, allthough ignored alltogether gives this central subject a certain fullness, allmost stuffed feeling,how did u get so close without scaring him. (:-}   ahah, thats great', '2005-06-20 05:56:08.000000', NULL, 0),
