(1468469, 187680, 35317, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by KaDi:</b></div><hr/><i> Wonderful wing action!  The red seems a bit off--did you up the saturation on this?<br/>Hard to capture these quick birds other than on a perch, I applaud the effort.<br/>Grass, however, is one of the dreariest background imaginable for most subjects. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks for your complement. I only used levels in photoshop to adjust the color. The photo was a little dark to start with - underexposed.</td>', 'Originally posted by KaDi: Wonderful wing action!  The red seems a bit off--did you up the saturation on this?Hard to capture these quick birds other than on a perch, I applaud the effort.Grass, however, is one of the dreariest background imaginable for most subjects.  Thanks for your complement. I only used levels in photoshop to adjust the color. The photo was a little dark to start with - underexposed.', '2005-06-20 06:37:34.000000', NULL, 0),
