(1468476, 187973, 11738, '<td valign="top">Another shot that got hammered by the "bird headshot lovers".  I had this pegged for top-10, maybe even top-5.  Probably one of the best composed images of the challenge.  Ignore the comments about tighter crops.  It''s perfect just the way it is.  I can''t believe the number of 5''s (83!!!) that this image received.  Keep up the excellent work.</td>', 'Another shot that got hammered by the "bird headshot lovers".  I had this pegged for top-10, maybe even top-5.  Probably one of the best composed images of the challenge.  Ignore the comments about tighter crops.  It''s perfect just the way it is.  I can''t believe the number of 5''s (83!!!) that this image received.  Keep up the excellent work.', '2005-06-20 06:48:55.000000', NULL, 0),
