(1468590, 187565, 32082, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone for all your wonderful comments and great suggestions in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This picture was taken on a dark overcast rainy day and because of that <br/>I had a hard time saturating it with color. Yes, I sort of over saturated the eyes. Yes, the background is a bit distracting.<br/> <br/>As for the expression, I was about seven foot from the owl and everytime I would press the shutter button the owl would turn its head.<br/>It was the red beem that the camera puts off that the owl was amused with.<br/> <br/>Thanks again for all the comments, I am looking forward to the next challenge!<br/> <br/>Jeff O  :)</td>', 'Thanks to everyone for all your wonderful comments and great suggestions in this challenge. This picture was taken on a dark overcast rainy day and because of that I had a hard time saturating it with color. Yes, I sort of over saturated the eyes. Yes, the background is a bit distracting. As for the expression, I was about seven foot from the owl and everytime I would press the shutter button the owl would turn its head.It was the red beem that the camera puts off that the owl was amused with. Thanks again for all the comments, I am looking forward to the next challenge! Jeff O  :)', '2005-06-20 08:48:23.000000', NULL, 0),
