(1468892, 188811, 25742, '<td valign="top">Thank you all very much.<br/>I''ve been waiting for that ribbon for a long time :)<br/>I knew after 50 votes I was gonna be in top 10 (with 7.4+) so this week has been really exiting for me, esp since I went away for 3 days and had next to no internet connection.<br/> <br/>I''m now working on a print, I was in a hurry when I edited this one and forgot to save it before I downsized it and for some strange reason I can''t get the same wonderful sharpness now. But don''t worry, print will be here very soon.<br/> <br/>Outtakes are in the editing room as well, will post ''em soon.</td>', 'Thank you all very much.I''ve been waiting for that ribbon for a long time :)I knew after 50 votes I was gonna be in top 10 (with 7.4+) so this week has been really exiting for me, esp since I went away for 3 days and had next to no internet connection. I''m now working on a print, I was in a hurry when I edited this one and forgot to save it before I downsized it and for some strange reason I can''t get the same wonderful sharpness now. But don''t worry, print will be here very soon. Outtakes are in the editing room as well, will post ''em soon.', '2005-06-20 11:51:51.000000', NULL, 0),
