(1469022, 189013, 29797, '<td valign="top">Guess you overestimated yourself with that 4.9 score. ;-) Cool idea though. Reminds me of that scene in ET with ET in the closet with all the stuffed animals and the mom didn''t even notice him. Keep having fun with it, but not for too long. I really do I miss your old stuff.</td>', 'Guess you overestimated yourself with that 4.9 score. ;-) Cool idea though. Reminds me of that scene in ET with ET in the closet with all the stuffed animals and the mom didn''t even notice him. Keep having fun with it, but not for too long. I really do I miss your old stuff.', '2005-06-20 12:34:07.000000', NULL, 0),
