(1469442, 188698, 24454, '<td valign="top">Judy, I LOVE this picture.   This is one of the ones that I thought would be way, way up there!   I don''t understand the voting sometimes -- I sure gave this one a high score.   I don''t think I''ve ever seen a picture of one of these birds close-up enough to see the blue, blue eyes -- contrasting so vividly with that yellow beak.   I would be really proud to have this one in my collection!!!<br/> <br/>SandyP</td>', 'Judy, I LOVE this picture.   This is one of the ones that I thought would be way, way up there!   I don''t understand the voting sometimes -- I sure gave this one a high score.   I don''t think I''ve ever seen a picture of one of these birds close-up enough to see the blue, blue eyes -- contrasting so vividly with that yellow beak.   I would be really proud to have this one in my collection!!! SandyP', '2005-06-20 16:25:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1469485, 188811, 11897, '<td valign="top">Hope you get the print done, should sell well,<br/>Great photo, well done.</td>', 'Hope you get the print done, should sell well,Great photo, well done.', '2005-06-20 16:51:08.000000', NULL, 0),
