(1469598, 188826, 30507, '<td valign="top">Nice effort ("The shot was hard to get as Mikisi was way back in his cage and would not come up front (despite my pleadings) where the lighting was better") but I see this shot is out of focus.<br/>The background is too dark also. I think you are getting high score because of the meaning of the picture instead of its quality.<br/>Nice but you can do it much better cole, I''ve seen it.</td>', 'Nice effort ("The shot was hard to get as Mikisi was way back in his cage and would not come up front (despite my pleadings) where the lighting was better") but I see this shot is out of focus.The background is too dark also. I think you are getting high score because of the meaning of the picture instead of its quality.Nice but you can do it much better cole, I''ve seen it.', '2005-06-20 18:15:46.000000', NULL, 0),
