(1470998, 188372, 18197, '<td valign="top">JB, what a great shot. And reading the story, it sounds like you had a ball getting it. This was a pretty hot challenge, with many many very good photos and a lot of high scores. Makes your top 20 finish all the sweeter! Congratulations!</td>', 'JB, what a great shot. And reading the story, it sounds like you had a ball getting it. This was a pretty hot challenge, with many many very good photos and a lot of high scores. Makes your top 20 finish all the sweeter! Congratulations!', '2005-06-21 11:17:37.000000', NULL, 0),
