(1484455, 188118, 36078, '<td valign="top">From the Critique Club<br/> <br/>First off their is alot going on which I think is a good thing.  Alot of the photos entered in the challenge were static and seemed caged.  I think it was a good idea to enter this with all of its action.  Their is not much detail in the acutal birds but this is outset by the action.<br/> <br/>Nice tones...but does seem a bit on the dark side but then the water capture might not be as nice.  So I think you struck a nice compromise.  The rocks have nice textures and framed in the lower right so does not draw your eye.<br/> <br/>I think what over all hurt his image during the challenge was the lack of detail.  Which is sad because their were few other action shots and fewer with multiple birds.  I feel you should have scored higher and way to go for doing something different.</td>', 'From the Critique Club First off their is alot going on which I think is a good thing.  Alot of the photos entered in the challenge were static and seemed caged.  I think it was a good idea to enter this with all of its action.  Their is not much detail in the acutal birds but this is outset by the action. Nice tones...but does seem a bit on the dark side but then the water capture might not be as nice.  So I think you struck a nice compromise.  The rocks have nice textures and framed in the lower right so does not draw your eye. I think what over all hurt his image during the challenge was the lack of detail.  Which is sad because their were few other action shots and fewer with multiple birds.  I feel you should have scored higher and way to go for doing something different.', '2005-06-26 17:15:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1485871, 188755, 35078, '<td valign="top">I voted it a 5. Liked the composition, but didn''t like the eye lid appearing to be out of focus. The white on the wing is a little over exposed and detarcts my eye from the head. Well done in making the top 100 anyway. I still would have put it around 50th myself.</td>', 'I voted it a 5. Liked the composition, but didn''t like the eye lid appearing to be out of focus. The white on the wing is a little over exposed and detarcts my eye from the head. Well done in making the top 100 anyway. I still would have put it around 50th myself.', '2005-06-27 09:20:48.000000', NULL, 0),
